<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CH" style="id" />
  <para style="h">2 TEKWARO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Buk me aryo me Tekwaro</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Tekwaro</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Tek</para>
  <para style="mt2">Buk me aryo me</para>
  <para style="mt1">TEKWARO</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">Buk man me aryo me Tekwaro cake ki kama buk me acel me Tekwaro ogik i iye. I buk man waneno kit ma rwot Solomon oloyo kwede lobo Icrael nio wa i tone. Inge coyo lok ikom kit ma jo Icrael ma kumalo ma latela wigi Jeroboam gujemo kwede ikom Rekoboam ma en aye lale katyen rwot Solomon, lok acoya mukene ducu dong tye malube ki tito lok ikom loc me ker me Icrael ma tung kupiny i Judaya keken nio ikare ma kiterogi i opii ikare ma Jerucalem opoto kwede i mwaka miya abic ki pyere aboro wiye abicel (Mwaka ma peya onongo kinywalo iye Rwot Yecu Kricito).</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Loc pa Solomon <char style="ior"><ref loc="2CH 1:1-9:31">1:1—9:31</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">Acaki loc mere <char style="ior"><ref loc="2CH 1:1-17">1:1-17</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">Kigero Ot pa Lubanga <char style="ior"><ref loc="2CH 2:1-7:10">2:1—7:10</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">Loc pa rwot Solomon ikare me agikine <char style="ior"><ref loc="2CH 7:11-9:31">7:11—9:31</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Jemo pa kaka ma kumalo me Icrael <char style="ior"><ref loc="2CH 10:1-19">10:1-19</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Luker me Juda <char style="ior"><ref loc="2CH 11:1-36:12">11:1—36:12</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Poto pa Jerucalem i cing Babilon <char style="ior"><ref loc="2CH 36:13-23">36:13-23</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CH 1" />
  <para style="s1">Solomon olego ryeko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 3:3-15">1 Luk 3:3-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 1:1" />Solomon wod pa Daudi omoko kere matek, kun Rwot Lubangane bene onongo tye kwede, man omiyo en obedo madit tutwal.<verse eid="2CH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 1:2" />Solomon oloko ki jo Icrael ducu, wa bot ludito maloyo buca mony me jo alip ki buca mony me jo miya, ki bot lungolkop ki ludito ducu ma gitye ducu i Icrael, ma gin aye ludito wi kaka ki i odi pa kwarigi ducu. <verse eid="2CH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 1:3" />Solomon kacel ki lwak mucoke ducu gucito i kabedo me woro Lubanga iwi got ma i Gibeon; pien Kema me Rwate pa Lubanga, mayam Moses latic pa Rwot otiyo ki i tim, onongo pud tye kiketo bedo kunu. <verse eid="2CH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 1:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 6:1-17">2 Cam 6:1-17</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 13:5-14">1 Tek 13:5-14</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 15:25-16:1">15:25—16:1</ref></char></note>(Ento Daudi yam okwanyo canduk pa Lubanga ki i Kiriat-jearim, okelo i kabedo ma en ceng oyubu pire, pien onongo oguru kema pire i Jerucalem.) <verse eid="2CH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 1:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 38:1-7">Nia 38:1-7</ref></char></note> Onongo keno tyer me mola mayam Bejalel wod pa Uri, ma wod pa Kur otiyoni, pud tye wa kunu bene inyim Kema me tye pa Rwot. <verse eid="2CH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 1:6" />Solomon ocito cok ki keno mola ma inyim Kema me Rwate, wa inyim Rwot, ci otyero iye gitum awanga maromo alip acel kulu.<verse eid="2CH 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 1:7" />I dyewor meno Lubanga onen iye bot Solomon, kun owace ni, “Penya gin ma abimiyo boti.” <verse eid="2CH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 1:8" />Ci Solomon ogamo dog Lubanga ni, “In yam i nyutu mar meri madwong ma pe loke bot wora Daudi, dok iketo an adoko rwot me leyo katyene. <verse eid="2CH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 1:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 13:16">Aca 13:16</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 28:14">28:14</ref></char></note>Ai Rwot Lubanga, wek lok mayam iciko bot wora Daudi dong ocobe ka kare, pien iketo an adoko rwot me loyo roki madit ma gipol marom ki apwa me ngom. <verse eid="2CH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 1:10" />Ber tin in imiya ryeko ki kit me ngeyo piny, wek ange kit me loyo rok man, pien anga ma bitwero loyo lwaki man, madwong marom man kuluni?” <verse eid="2CH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 1:11" />Lubanga ogamo dog Solomon ni, “Ka meno aye gin matye i cwinyi, macalo in pe i lego lim nyo lonyo nyo deyo, kadi pi jo ma gidaggi ni myero kinekgi woko, pe bene i lega ni amii irii iwi lobo nakanaka, ento i lego ryeko ki kit me ngeyo piny giri keni, wek ilo lwaka ma aketo in ibedo rwotgi, <verse eid="2CH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 1:12" />ryeko ki kit me ngeyo piny dong amiyogi boti. Dok abimiyi lwak lonyo ki lim ki yweka, ma pe tye ngat mo acel ikin luker ma gukwongo nyimi mayam gulimo gin marom meno, kadi wa rwodi mo ma bilubu kori pe bilimo kumeno.” <verse eid="2CH 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 1:13" />Ci Solomon ocako a woko ki i kabedo me woro Lubanga matye iwi got ma i Gibeon, kama Kema me Rwate tye iye ci odok i Jerucalem, ci obedo kaloyo jo Icrael ki kunu.<verse eid="2CH 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lonyo pa Solomon</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 10:26-29">1 Luk 10:26-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 1:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 4:26">1 Luk 4:26</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Solomon yam ocoko gadigadi lweny ki lulweny ma ringo ki aguragura. En obedo ki gadigadi lweny alip acel ki miya angwen, ki wegi aguragura alip apar wiye aryo ma oketo mogo ikin gi i taun madito me gadigadi lweny, ki mukene gubedo bote i Jerucalem. <verse eid="2CH 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 1:15" />Rwot Solomon yam omiyo ryal odoko gin ma lam marom ki gwenggu i Jerucalem, dok okelo yadi cedar mapol ata marom ki olam ma i bar Cepela. <verse eid="2CH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 1:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:16">Nwo 17:16</ref></char></note>En yam omiyo jone loyo wilo aguragura ma a ki i Ejipt ki Kuc; ma lucat wil pa rwot aye gamogi ki kunu i wel lim ma onongo ki moko. <verse eid="2CH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 1:17" />Gadigadi ma gia ki i Ejipt welgi onongo romo cekel me ryal miya abicel, ki aguragura acel wele cekel miya acel ki pyere abic; ka dok lucat wil pa rwot catogi bot luker ducu pa jo Kit, ki bot luker me Ciria.<verse eid="2CH 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Yub pi gero Ot pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 5:1-18">1 Luk 5:1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 2:1" />Solomon omoko tame me gero Ot pa Lubanga pi woro nying Rwot, kacel ki gang kale kikome. <verse eid="2CH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 2:2" />Solomon oyero jo alip pyere abiro me yweko jami gedo, ki jo alip pyere aboro me muku godi i lobo ma obedo gotgot, ki jo alip adek ki miya abicel me bedo ludito maloyo lutic. <verse eid="2CH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 2:3" />Solomon dok ocwalo lok bot Kuram rwot me Turo ni, “Kit mayam ibedo ki wora Daudi kun i cwale bao cedar me gero ode me bedone, ber i bed kweda bene kitmeno. <verse eid="2CH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 2:4" />Nen, ayube pi gero ot pi woro nying Rwot Lubangana, ci abidyero bote pi wango i ye odok eceta ma ngwece kur inyime, ki pi tyero iye mugati me gitum awanga i odiko ki otyeno, ki i ceng Cabit ducu, ki i Por Dwe, ki inino madito ma Rwot Lubangawa oketo, mayam en ociko pi jo Icrael matwal. <verse eid="2CH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 2:5" />Ot ma abigeroni bibedo dit mada, pien Lubangawa dit makato lubanga mukenegu ducu. <verse eid="2CH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 2:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:27">1 Luk 8:27</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 6:18">2 Tek 6:18</ref></char></note>Ento anga matwero gero ot pi Lubanga? Kadi polo kulu matye malo twali, pe twero romo en me bedo iye. An kono an anga ma atwero gero ot pire? Ento kono atwero tiyo ot mo wek obedo kawango odok eceta inyime keken. <verse eid="2CH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 2:7" />Pieno amito ni icwala dano mo ma kwiri matwero tic ikom jabu, ki ryal, ki mola, ki nyonyo iron, ki bongo ma lamarlamar, ki ma kwar ki ma bulu, ki dano ma kipwonyo ki goro kom jami, wek otii ki lutica ma kwiri ma gitye kweda i Juda ki i Jerucalem, mayam wora Daudi oyerogi pi tic. <verse eid="2CH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 2:8" />Dok i cwala bene bao cedar, ki ciprec, ki bao algum ma gia i Lebanon, pien angeyo ni lutici gingeyo tongo yadi ma i Lebanon. Dok lutica gibibedo ki lutici, <verse eid="2CH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 2:9" />wek guyuba bao madwong, pien ot ma abigeroni bibedo dit dok me aura. <verse eid="2CH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 2:10" />Abimiyo bot joni ma gitingo bao, ngano ma nyige maromo guniya alip pyere abicel, ki cayiri maromo guniya alip pyere abicel, ki kongo bwino maromo lita miya angwen ki moo jeituni bene lita miya angwen obed pi lutici me acamagi.”<verse eid="2CH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 2:11" />Kuram rwot me Turo odok iye ki waraga ma ocwalo bot Solomon ni, “Pien Rwot maro jone omiyo oketo in ibedo rwot ma loyogi.” <verse eid="2CH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 2:12" />Kuram dok owaco ni, “Kipak Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael, ma con ocweyo polo ki lobo, ma dok bene omiyo ki Daudi wode maryek, matye ki niang matut, ma dong bigero Ot pi Rwot, kacel ki gang kale kikome.<verse eid="2CH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 2:13" />An dong acwali dano ma ladiro matye ki ngec matut, en Kuram-abi, <verse eid="2CH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 2:14" />ma wod pa dako ma anyira Dan, ma wone dano me Turo. Kipwonyo en ki tic ikom jabu, ki ryal, ki nyonyo bronze, ki nyonyo iron ki godi, ki bao, ki bongo ma lamarlamar, ki ma bulu ki ma kwar ki camanini mabere. En ngeyo bene tic ducu me goro coc ikom jami, ngeyo lubu kit cal mo keken me tic ma kimiye, kun tiyo kacel ki ludironi, ki ludiro pa rwoda Daudi ma woru. <verse eid="2CH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 2:15" />Pieno dong icwal botwa ngano ki cayiri, ki moo ki kongo bwino ma ceng iwaconi; <verse eid="2CH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 2:16" />ci wan wa bitongo kit bao ducu ma i mito ki i Lebanon, ka dok wabitweyogi ci ki bikwangogi iwi pii macalo bwoda nio wa i Jopa, wek in dong iom i ter wa i Jerucalem.”<verse eid="2CH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Solomon ocako gero Ot pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 6:1-38">1 Luk 6:1-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 2:17" />Solomon dok ocako kwano wel jo ducu me rok mukene ma gibedo i lobo Icrael, kit mayam wone Daudi kong okwanogini. Ci kinongo ni welgi romo jo alip miya acel ki pyere abic wiye adek ki miya abicel. <verse eid="2CH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 2:18" />En oyero jo alip pyere abiro ki ikin gi me yweko jami gedo ducu, ki jo alip pyere aboro me muku godi i lobo ma obedo gotgot, ki jo alip adek ki miya abicel me bedo ludito maloyo lutic, pi cuku cwiny dano wek gutii tic.<verse eid="2CH 2:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 22:2">Aca 22:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Solomon ocako gero Ot pa Rwot i Jerucalem iwi got me Moria, kama yam Rwot onyute iye bot wone Daudi, i kabedo mayam Daudi oyero, ikom laro moyo pa Ornan ma jo Jebuc. <verse eid="2CH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 3:2" />En ocako gerone i dwe me aryo i mwaka me angwen me loce. <verse eid="2CH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 3:3" />Solomon opimo Ot pa Lubanga ma en omito geroneni kit man: bore romo puti pyere abongwen, ki lace puti pyere adek. <verse eid="2CH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 3:4" />Ki kicika ma i dogola me donyo ma inyim kicika me ot lace romo puti pyere adek, marom ki lac me ot ma dite; ki bore tung malo romo puti miya acel ki pyere aboro. Ci omwono iye woko ki jabu ma kiliyo maber. <verse eid="2CH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 3:5" />Solomon oguru kor ot me kicika ma dite ki bao ciprec, ci omwono kom bao woko ki jabu mabere, ma kigoro iye cal yadi otit ki nyor. <verse eid="2CH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 3:6" />Ci odeyo i ot ma mwonya mada ki godi matino me wel ma kimwono ikom jabu. Jabune obedo jabu ma kikelo ki i Parvaim. <verse eid="2CH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 3:7" />Kitmeno en omwono i ot ducu ki jabu, riine, ki rii dogolane, kor kicika ot ducu, ki dogolane; ka dok ogoro cal lukerubi i kor kicika ot.<verse eid="2CH 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 3:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 26:33-34">Nia 26:33-34</ref>
      </char>
    </note>En dok otiyo Kabedo Maleng Makato ducu; bore puti pyere adek, marom ki lac me kicika ot ma dite, ki lace bene puti pyere adek. Ci omwono kome woko ki jabu mabere maromo talanta miya abicel. <verse eid="2CH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 3:9" />Pek me mucumar me jabu ma kiguro kwede obedo cekel pyere abic. En dok omwono kicika mamalo ducu ki jabu.<verse eid="2CH 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 3:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 25:18-20">Nia 25:18-20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>I Kabedo Maleng Makato ducu en oketo iye cal lukerubi aryo me bao ma kipayo, ci omwono komgi woko ki jabu. <verse eid="2CH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 3:11" />Bwom lukerubi ducu bore muyare romo puti pyere adek. Bwomgi acel acel bore romo puti abiro ki nucu. Wi bwom lakerubi acel ogudu kor ot, kun bwome tungcel ma bore puti abiro ki nucu, wiye ogudu wi bwom lakerubi wadi; <verse eid="2CH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 3:12" />ki bwom lakerubi man bwome acel ma bore puti abiro ki nucuni, wiye bene ogudu kicika ot, ki bwome mukene, maromo puti abiro ki nucuni, wiye orwate ki bwom lakerubi mukwongoni. <verse eid="2CH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 3:13" />Bwom cal lukerubi magi borgi muyare oromo puti pyere adek. Gucung ki tyen gi ma gineno tung kicika ot ma dite. <verse eid="2CH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 3:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:31">Nia 26:31</ref></char></note>Okwoyo bongo kicika ki bongo ma bulu ki ma lamarlamar ki ma kware, ki bongo camanini mabere, ma odeyo ki cal lukerubi.<verse eid="2CH 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tic pa Kuram i Ot pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 7:5-51">1 Luk 7:5-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 3:15" />En dok otiyo wir aryo ma bocogi romo puti pyere abic wiye aryo, ki lalukana iwigi ma bocogi romo puti abiro ki nucu, ci oketogi inyim ot. <verse eid="2CH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 3:16" />Ka dok otiyo nyor macalo tiko ngut, ci oketogi iwi wir aryo ducu, ka dok otimo cal nyig okwer pomegranat miya acel, ci oketogi ikom nyor. <verse eid="2CH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 3:17" />Ci ocibo wir magi inyim ot pa Lubanga, acel tung kupiny, ki mukene tung kumalo. Ci ocako nying ma tung kupinyi ni, Jakin<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="fk">Jakin </char> ki i leb Ibru winye calo “En (Lubanga) aye ma moko”. </note>, ki ma tung kumaloni olwongo ni Boaj<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="fk">Boaj </char> ki ileb Ibru winye calo “Pi tek mere (pa Lubanga).” </note>.<verse eid="2CH 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Jami ma kitiyo pi Ot pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 7:23-51">1 Luk 7:23-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 4:1" />Solomon<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 27:1-2">Nia 27:1-2</ref></char></note>otiyo keno tyer me mola ma bore romo puti pyere adek, ki lace bene puti pyere adek; bore ma dok malo romo puti apar wiye abic. <verse eid="2CH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 4:2" />Ka dok otiyo nam me mola ma kiliyo ma otwode adunu, ma lace romo puti apar wiye abic, nia idoge tungcel nio idoge tungcel; bore tung malo oromo puti abiro ki nucu. Kipimo doge ki tol ci oromo puti pyere angwen wiye abic. <verse eid="2CH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 4:3" />Ki i tere piny tye iye cal keno munyak ma orumu kom lagwok pii ducu, ma bore tye puti pyere angwen wiye abic; cal keno magi kiryeyogi latyeng aryo. Ikare ma kitiyo lagwok pii, kitiyo ki cal keno ikome lawangacel. <verse eid="2CH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 4:4" />Ci kicibo lagwok pii ocung iwi cal twoni dyangi apar wiye aryo; kiketo adek gineno tung kumalo, adek gineno tung kupotoceng, adek gineno tung kupiny, ki adek gineno tung kunyango. Kicibo lagwok pii ocung inge twoninu, kun ngegi ducu odok tung iye. <verse eid="2CH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 4:5" />Kome kinong maromo incic adek; ki doge bene calo dog kikopo, marom ki cal ature lenga, piine romo lita pyere abicel. <verse eid="2CH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 4:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:17-21">Nia 30:17-21</ref></char></note>Ka dok otiyo otako apar me lwok, oketo abic tung kupiny ki abic tung kumalo. Magi obedo me lako jami ducu ma kitiyo kwedgi pi gitum awanga, ki lagwok pii kiketo me lwok pa ajwaki.<verse eid="2CH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 4:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 25:31-40">Nia 25:31-40</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 25:23-30">Nia 25:23-30</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Dok otiyo lacib mac me jabu apar kit ma kiciko ni oketogi i Ot pa Lubanga; ci oketo abic tung kupiny ki abic yo tung kumalo. <verse eid="2CH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 4:8" />En dok otiyo meja apar, ci oketogi i Ot pa Lubanga, abic tung kupiny ki abic tung kumalo. Dok otiyo becen me jabu miya acel. <verse eid="2CH 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 4:9" />Ka dok oyubu dyekal pa ajwaki, ki dyekal ma dite, ki kika me dyekal, ci omwono kom kika ducu ki mola; <verse eid="2CH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 4:10" />ka oketo lagwok pii i twok Ot ikine me tung kupiny ki tung kunyango.<verse eid="2CH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 4:11" />Kuram ocweyo agulu mapol bene, ki akwaya, ki becengu. Kitmeno Kuram otyeko tic ikom Ot pa Lubanga kit ma rwot Solomon ociko pire. <verse eid="2CH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 4:12" />Kuram gutiyo jami magi: wir aryo, ki lalukana aryo ma olunge macalo agulu ma kiketo iwi wir, ki obwo aryo me umu kom lalukana aryo ma olunge ma obedo iwi wiri. <verse eid="2CH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 4:13" />Dok otiyo cal okwer pomegranat miya angwen pi obwo aryonu, kun cal pomegranat kiryeyo latyeng aryo ikom obwo acel acel me umu kom lalukana aryo ma olunge ma obedo iwi wir. <verse eid="2CH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 4:14" />Kuram bene otiyo lutino gadigadi apar, ki otako mola apar ma kilutu i lutino gadigadi, <verse eid="2CH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 4:15" />ki lagwok pii acel, ki cal twoni dyangi apar wiye aryo ma ite lagwok pii. <verse eid="2CH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 4:16" />Lwak agulu ki akwaya latokegu, ki gin lacob ringo, ki jami ducu ma mite pi tic ki jami magi ma Kuram-abi otiyogi pi Ot pa Rwot Lubanga ki pi rwot Solomon obedo me mola ma kililo maleng. <verse eid="2CH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 4:17" />Solomon omiyo kiliyo mola meno i pwor kulu Jordan, kama lobo agulu tye iye, ikin Cukot ki Jereda. <verse eid="2CH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 4:18" />Solomon otimo lwak jaminu madwong tutwal, mapek me nyonyo bronze meno pe tye ngat mo ma okwano.<verse eid="2CH 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 4:19" />Solomon otiyo jami ducu matye i Ot pa Lubanga kit man: keno tyer me jabu, ki lwak meja ma kicano iye mugati ma kiketo inyim Rwot, <verse eid="2CH 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 4:20" />lacib mac ki lwak laputgi me jabu ma kiliyo maber, ma myero gubed kilyel i Kabedo Maleng Makato ducu, kit ma kicikoni; <verse eid="2CH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 4:21" />ki lwak cal ature, ki laputgu, ki boyi lakar mac, ducu me jabu ma kiliyo maber makato. <verse eid="2CH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 4:22" />Magacgu, becengu, atabo me odok eceta, ki weer me wango mac otiyogi ki jabu ma kiliyo maber; ki pata me Ot pa Lubanga ma kiketo ikom kika me Kabedo Maleng Makato ducu, ki i kika me kicika ma dite bene, gubedo me jabu.<verse eid="2CH 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CH 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 5:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 8:11">2 Cam 8:11</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 18:11">1 Tek 18:11</ref></char>
    </note>Tic ma Solomon otiyo pi Ot pa Rwot otum kitmeno. Ci Solomon okelo jami mayam wone Daudi odyero ki Rwoti, ci oketo ryal, ki jabu, ki jami ticgu ducu i ot me kano lim matye i Ot pa Lubanga.<verse eid="2CH 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Solomon okelo Canduk me Gicike i Ot pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 8:1-9">1 Luk 8:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 5:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 6:12-15">2 Cam 6:12-15</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 15:25-28">1 Tek 15:25-28</ref></char>
    </note>Solomon ocoko ludongo pa jo Icrael ki ludito wi kaka ducu, ma gin aye lutela wi dogola pa kwarigi ma ikin jo Icrael, ci gubino i Jerucalem pi kwanyo Canduk me Gicike pa Rwot ki i gangkal pa Daudi, ma kilwongo ni Cion. <verse eid="2CH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 5:3" />Ci lwak jo Icrael ducu gucoke inyim rwot pi nino Madito me Bolo matye i dwe me abironi. <verse eid="2CH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 5:4" />Ludongo pa jo Icrael ducu gubino, ci Lulevi gucako tingo Canduk me Gicike. <verse eid="2CH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 5:5" />Ka gutero Canduk i Kema me Rwate, kacel ki jami maleng ducu mayam tye i Kema, ma ajwaki ki Lulevi gukelogi. <verse eid="2CH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 5:6" />Rwot Solomon ki lwak jo Icrael ducu ma gucoke boteni, gubedo inyim Canduk kun gitumu romi ki twonigu mapol ma welgi pe i twero kwanone oyotoyot dok maber bene. <verse eid="2CH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 5:7" />Kitmeno ajwaki gucako kelo Canduk me Gicike pa Rwot wa i kabedone ma i tyelo me Ot maleng, i Kabedo Maleng Makato ducu, ci guketo piny ite bwom lukerubi. <verse eid="2CH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 5:8" />Lukerubi guyaro bwomgi ka wi kabedo me Canduk wek lukerubi guum wi canduk woko kacel ki tal latinge ducu. <verse eid="2CH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 5:9" />Dok tal latinge yam wigi nen ki i Kabedo Maleng ma inyim kabedo maleng ma i tyeloni; ento pe kitwero nenogi ki woko; ci pud gitye kunu nio wa onyo. <verse eid="2CH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 5:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:5">Nwo 10:5</ref></char></note>Gin mo onongo pe tye i Canduk, kono kidi aryo ma apada keken mayam Moses oketo i iye ki i Koreb, kama yam Rwot oketo iye gicikene ki jo Icrael, ikare ma gia ki i lobo Ejipt.<verse eid="2CH 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Deyo pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 5:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 16:34">1 Tek 16:34</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 7:3">2 Tek 7:3</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 3:11">Eji 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 100:5">Jab 100:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:1">106:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 107:1">107:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 116:1">116:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 136:1">136:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 33:11">Jer 33:11</ref></char>
    </note>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 40:34-35">Nia 40:34-35</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ajwaki gukato woko ki i Kabedo Maleng, pien ajwaki ducu ma onongo gityeni dong gutyeko lonye keken gi, ma pe giparo pi dul ticgi; <verse eid="2CH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 5:12" />ci Lulevi ducu ma gin luwer, Acap ki Eman, ki Jedutun, ki awobegi, ki utmegigi, onongo guruke ki bongi camanini ma becone, ci gumako atego agoya, ki nanga ki opuk. Kacel kwedgi obedo ajwaki ma giromo miya acel ki pyere aryo ma gin lukut tum. <verse eid="2CH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 5:13" />Tic pa lukut tum ki luwer en aye me ribo dwon gi kacel kapako ki ka pwoyo Rwot, ki dwon gi ma winye malongo. Ikare ma gucako wer, kacel ki tum ki atego agoya ki jami mukene ducu me wer, pi pako Rwot kun giwero ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 5:13">“Pien Rwot ber,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 5:13">mar mere ma pe loke bedo nakanaka.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CH 5:13">Ci deyo pa Rwot opongo i ote woko, <verse eid="2CH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 5:14" />ma omiyo ajwaki pe gitwero cung katiyo ticgi, pien pol ma obedo tye i ot meno, ki deyo pa Rwot nongo opongo i Ot pa Lubanga woko.<verse eid="2CH 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CH 6" />
  <para style="s1">Solomon oloko ki lwak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 8:12-21">1 Luk 8:12-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 6:1" />Inino meno Solomon owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 6:1">“Rwot in ityeko waco ni in ibibedo i pol macol woko licuc. <verse eid="2CH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 6:2" />Kombedi dong atyeko geri Ot ma ocudu malo likung, wek obed kabedoni ma koni ibedo iye matwal.”<verse eid="2CH 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 6:3" />Ka dok rwot Solomon oloke, ci olamo gum ikom lwak jo Icrael ma gucoke ducu, kun jo Icrael ma gucokeni gucung mot laling. <verse eid="2CH 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 6:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:1-13">2 Cam 7:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:1-12">1 Tek 17:1-12</ref></char></note>En ocako lok botgi kuman ni. “Kipak Rwot, Lubanga pa Icrael, ma dong cinge otyeko cobo gin ma en oloko ki doge bot wora Daudini, kun waco ni, <verse eid="2CH 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 6:5" />‘Nia wa ikare ma akwanyo kede jona jo Icrael ki i Ejipt, an onongo peya ayero gang mo ma i kaka me Icrael pi gero iye ot mo, wek kiwora iye. Dok pe ayero laker mo me loyo jona jo Icrael; <verse eid="2CH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 6:6" />ento dong koni atyeko yero Jerucalem wek nyinga obed kenyo, ka dok ayero Daudi me bedo lalo lwaka jo Icrael.’<verse eid="2CH 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 6:7" />I karenu onongo wora Daudi obedo ki tam i cwinye me gero ot pi woro nying Rwot, Lubanga pa Icrael. <verse eid="2CH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 6:8" />Ento Rwot aye owaco bot wora Daudi ni, ‘Kit macalo onongo dong tam tye i cwinyi me gero ot pi woro nyinga, itimo giri maber pi keto lok meno i cwinyi. <verse eid="2CH 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 6:9" />Ento pe in aye dok ibigera ot, ento wodi ma ibinywalo en aye bigero ot pi woro nyinga.’<verse eid="2CH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 6:10" />Ikareni, Rwot dong otyeko cobo gin ma en ociko i cikene; pien an dong atyeko leyo katyen wora Daudi, dong atyeko bedo iwi komker pa Icrael, kit mayam Rwot ocikoni, dok bene atyeko gero ot pi woro nying Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael. <verse eid="2CH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 6:11" />Dong atyeko keto iye kabedo pa Canduk me Gicike pa Rwot, matye iye cike ma Rwot con oketo ki jo Icrael.”<verse eid="2CH 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lega pa Solomon</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 8:22-53">1 Luk 8:22-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 6:12" />Solomon dok ocung inyim keno tyer pa Rwot ki inyim lwak jo Icrael ducu ma gucoke, ka ocako tango cinge aryo ducu malo. <verse eid="2CH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 6:13" />Solomon onongo otiyo abam mola ma bore puti abiro ki nucu, ki lace puti abiro ki nucu, ki bore nia piny dok malo puti angwen ki nucu, ci ocibo idyekal; en ocung i wiye. Ka dok orumu conge piny inyim lwak jo Icrael ducu ma gucoke, ka dong ocako tango cinge aryo ducu malo kun okemo polo, <verse eid="2CH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 6:14" />kun waco ni, “Ai Rwot, Lubanga pa Icrael, pe tye lubanga mo macalo in, kadi malo i polo nyo piny iwi lobo, matye kagwoko gicikene macalo in, ma i nyutu mar meri ma pe loke bot lutici ma bedo ka lubi ki cwinygi ducu. <verse eid="2CH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 6:15" />Ibedo kalubu kit gin mayam iciko bot wora Daudi, eyo, gin mayam iloko ki dogi, icako dong tiyone ikare man ki tekoni, ci icobo ducu maber. <verse eid="2CH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 6:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:4">1 Luk 2:4</ref></char></note> Kombedi ai Rwot, Lubanga pa Icrael, dong ilub gin mayam iciko ki latici wora Daudi, kun iwaco ni, ‘Pe ibibedo labongo danoni mo inyima ma bibedo iwi komker pa Icrael, teke awobeni gugwoko kitgi maber, kun gilubu cik mera kit macalo ibedo kwede i nyimani.’ <verse eid="2CH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 6:17" />Ai Rwot, Lubanga pa Icrael, kombedi mii loki dong omok matek, kit ma ceng iloko ki wora Daudi ma latici.<verse eid="2CH 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 6:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 2:6">2 Tek 2:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ento Lubanga in ibibedo iwi loboni kacel ki dano ada? Nen, kadi wa polo bene kulu manen malo tutwali pe romo in me bedo iye, ci ot man matidi ma ageroni rom mene kono wek in ibed iye! <verse eid="2CH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 6:19" />Dong icik iti kawinyo legana ma an latici atye kalego inyimi tin, ki kit ma abako kwede doga, ai Rwot Lubangana, dong iwiny koko ki lega ma atye kalegone inyimi tin; <verse eid="2CH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 6:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:11">Nwo 12:11</ref></char></note>wek wangi obed twolo kun ineno Ot man dyeceng ki dyewor, en aye kabedo mayam iwaco pire ni ibiketo iye nyingi wek kiwori iye, kun iwinyo legana ma akelo boti ka aloke akemo kabedo man atir. <verse eid="2CH 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 6:21" />Dok ibed kawinyo bako dog latici ki pa joni jo Icrael, ikare ducu ka walegi kun wakemo kabedo man atir. Eyo, in dong ibed kawinyone ki i polo kama ibedo iyeni; ci ka dong ityeko winyone, dong iwek balwa.<verse eid="2CH 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 6:22" />Kace dano mo otimo bal ikom wadi mo, ci kimiye okwongo kwong mo pire, ka obino ce okwongo kwonge ki inyim keno tyeri ma i Ot man, <verse eid="2CH 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 6:23" />ci in Lubanga iwinye ki i polo, iket i tic lok man me ngol kop pa laticini, imii kop oloo dano ma tingo alii, kun iketo gin ma en otimo iwiye kene, dok imii dano ma pe obalo oloo kop, kun itime ber muporo lengcwinye.<verse eid="2CH 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 6:24" />Kace mony pa lumerok guloyo joni jo Icrael pi balgi ma gutimo ikomi, kace gungut kun gudwogo boti, ci gucako tucu nyingi, ma gilego in ka gibako doggi boti ki i Ot man, <verse eid="2CH 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 6:25" />ci in ber dong iwinygi ki i poloni ai Rwot, ci iwek bal pa joni jo Icrael. Ka dok idwokgi cen wa i lobo mayam imiyo bot kwarigi.<verse eid="2CH 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 6:26" />Kace polo ocege woko, ma kot mo pe ocwer pi lakit balgi mo ikomi, kace lwaki gucako lega kun gukemo kabedo man, kun gitucu nyingi, dok gungut ikom balgi ci gubwoto balgini woko, ki dok nyo ikare ma iketo can malit ikomgini, <verse eid="2CH 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 6:27" />ci ber in Lubanga i winygi ki i polo, iwek bal pa lutici, gin joni jo Icrael, dok bene i pwonygi ki yo maber ma myero gulub; ci dong imii kot ocwer i lobonini mayam imiyo bot lwaki ni obed meggi.<verse eid="2CH 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 6:28" />Kace kec opoto i lobo, nyo ka two gemo opoto, nyo ka cam apita obware nyo odoko ocone, nyo ka bonyo opoto nyo okwil obino, nyo kace merokgi orumugi i gangigi mogo, nyo kadi bed kit gemo ango, nyo kit two moni obino i lobogi, <verse eid="2CH 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 6:29" />kace lwaki gucako lega nyo bako doggi, kadi bed dano acel kok boti, nyo joni jo Icrael ducu, kun dano acel acel gire ngeyo maber kit atwom mere kene, ki kwayi cwercwinye kene bene, ki kace dong otango cinge kun okemo ki otti man; <verse eid="2CH 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 6:30" />ci in Lubanga ber dong iwinygi ki i polo kama ibedo iyeni, ci iwek balgi. Tim dano acel acel kit ma ingeyo kwede cwinye, ma rwate bene ki kit kwone ducu, pien in keni aye ingeyo kit cwiny matye i dano ducu; <verse eid="2CH 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 6:31" />meno bimiyo gibedo kalworo in kun gilubu yo meri nino ducu kama gibedo iye, i lobo mayam imiyo bot kwarigi.<verse eid="2CH 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 6:32" />Wek obed kitmeno bene kace larok mo, ma pe joni jo Icrael, obino kany ma oa ki i lobo mo ma bor, ma obino pi nyingi ma diti, ki badi ma teki, ki bene pi cingi ma i ryeyo, kace laroki obino ce ocako legane ma okemo Ot man, <verse eid="2CH 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 6:33" />ci in Lubanga iwinye ki i polo kama ibedo iyeni, i tim kit gin ducu ma larok meno okok iye kwede inyimi, wek rok me wi lobo ducu gunge nyingi, ci gucak lwori, kit ma iweko lwaki jo Icrael gilworini, dok iwek gunge maber ni, Ot man ma ageroni kilwongo ki nyingi keken.<verse eid="2CH 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 6:34" />Kace lwaki gucito kalweny ikom lumerokgi i kabedo mo ducu ma icwalogi iye, kace gukelo legagi boti ma kun gukemo taun madit man ma in iyero, ki Ot man ma agero pi nyingini, <verse eid="2CH 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2CH 6:35" />ci in iwiny legagi ki bako doggi ki i polo. Ci ikony korgi macalo ineno ni lokgi tye atir.<verse eid="2CH 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2CH 6:36" />Dok kace gutimo bal ikomi, pien pe tye dano mo ma pe balo, ci kace kiniga omaki ikomgi, ci imiyogi i cing lamerok mo ma oyakogi ci oterogi i opii wa i lobo mo kamabor nyo kamacok; <verse eid="2CH 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2CH 6:37" />ento ka ki i lobo ma kiterogi iye i opiini cwinygi otur ikare ma gutamo pi lok meri maleng, ce gungut iye ci gubako doggi boti ki i lobo ma gitye iye i opiini, kun gikok ni, ‘Wabalo, watyeko ngak woko ata, watiyo lwak balgu mapol inyimi,’ <verse eid="2CH 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2CH 6:38" />ci kace gutyeko ngut ada ki tamgi ducu ki cwinygi ducu, wa ki i lobo kama kiterogi iye i opiini, ka dong gulego inyimi kun gukemo lobogi, mayam imiyo bot kwarigini, ki gang man ma nene iyero me keto iye nyingi wek ki wori, ki Ot man ma atyeko gerone pi nyingi malengi, <verse eid="2CH 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2CH 6:39" />ci in Lubanga dong iwiny legagi ki bako doggi ki i polo kama ibedo iyeni, ci iye konyo korgi kit ma ineno ni ber. Ka dok iwek bal pa joni ma gubalo ikomi.<verse eid="2CH 6:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2CH 6:40" />Ai Lubanga, kombedi dong iwek wangi obed twolo ci icik iti iwiny lega ma kilego i kabedo man.<verse eid="2CH 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2CH 6:41" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:41: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 132:8-10">Jab 132:8-10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>A malo, ai Rwot Lubanga, ci idony i kabedo me yweyoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 6:41">in ki Canduk me Gicike, ma en aye lanyut me teki.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 6:41">Ai Rwot Lubanga, wek ajwakini guruke ki lare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 6:41">wek joni maleng cwinygi obed yom pi beri.<verse eid="2CH 6:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2CH 6:42" />Ai Rwot Lubanga, pe ikwer lega pa lakeri ma kiwiro!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 6:42">Po pi mar meri ma pe loke ikom latici Daudi.”<verse eid="2CH 6:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CH 7" />
  <para style="s">Kwero Ot pa Lubanga pi tic maleng</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 8:62-66">1 Luk 8:62-66</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 7:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 9:23-24">Lev 9:23-24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ka Solomon dong otyeko legane, ci mac obino piny ma oa ki i polo, owango gitum awanga ki gitum mukene ducu, ci deyo pa Rwot opongo i Ot pa Lubanga woko limuk. <verse eid="2CH 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 7:2" />Ma omiyo ajwaki pa Rwot dong pe gitwero donyo i Ot pa Rwot Lubanga, pien deyo pa Rwot nongo opongo i Ot pa Rwot woko. <verse eid="2CH 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 7:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 16:34">1 Tek 16:34</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 5:13">2 Tek 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 3:11">Eji 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 100:5">Jab 100:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:1">106:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 107:1">107:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 118:1">118:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 136:1">136:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 33:11">Jer 33:11</ref></char></note>Ka jo Icrael ducu guneno mac obino piny, ki deyo pa Rwot oboyo kom Ot pa Lubanga woko, ci gukulu wigi piny aryeba ic idyekal ma kipeto iye godi, ci gumiyo woro ki pak bot! Rwot, kun giwaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 7:3">“Rwot en ber,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 7:3">pien mar mere ma pe loke bedo nakanaka.”<verse eid="2CH 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 7:4" />Ka dok Solomon ki jo Icrael ducu gucako tyero gitum inyim Rwot. <verse eid="2CH 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 7:5" />Ci Solomon i ceng meno otyero gityer maromo twoni dyangi alip pyere aryo wiye aryo, ki romi alip miya acel ki pyere aryo. Ci rwot ki jo Icrael ducu gukwero Ot pa Lubanga kitmeno. <verse eid="2CH 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 7:6" />Ajwaki gucung i kabedogi, kacel ki Lulevi ma gumako jami me wer meggi me pako Rwot, kit mayam rwot Daudi oyubu pi miyo pwoc bot Rwot, kun giwero ni, “Pien mar mere ma pe loke bedo nakanaka!” Meno time ikare ducu mayam Daudi pako iye Lubanga, kun gin gitiyo ki jami wergi. Ki jo ma gucung ma gukemogi gin aye obedo ajwaki ma gikutu tum, kun nongo jo Icrael ducu gucung mot.<verse eid="2CH 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 7:7" />Solomon dok ocako kwero kabedo ma i cwiny dyekal matye inyim Ot pa Rwot. En otyero kunu gitum awanga, ki moo dwologu me gityer lakwecwiny, pien keno tyer me mola ma Solomon otiyoni onongo tidi tutwal, ma pe romo keto iye gitum awanga kacel ki gityer me moko kwon ki dwologu.<verse eid="2CH 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 7:8" />Ikare meno Solomon okwero nino madito meno pi nino abiro kulu, kacel ki jo Icrael ducu. Onongo lwak gucoke madwong, kun gua wa i yoo ma donyo i Kamat nio wa i nota ora me Ejipt. <verse eid="2CH 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 7:9" />Inino me aborone gubedo ki coke madit; pien gubedo ki lega me kwero keno tyer nino abiro kulu, ki nino madito mukene bene nino abiro. <verse eid="2CH 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 7:10" />Ikom nino dwe pyere aryo wiye adek i dwe me abiro en aye Solomon ocwalo lwak gudok kwede woko tugi. Lwak gudok i pacogi ki yomcwiny madwong, ma igi okwe pi gin ducu mabeco ma Rwot Lubanga otimo pi Daudi ki pi Solomon ki pi lwake jo Icrael.<verse eid="2CH 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rwot onyute bot Solomon tyen me aryone</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 9:1-9">1 Luk 9:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 7:11" />Ci Solomon otyeko gero Ot pa Rwot Lubangane ki ot ma mege bene; ki tic ducu mayam en oyubu me atiya i Ot pa Rwot ki ma i ode en bene ocobo maber tutwal. <verse eid="2CH 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 7:12" />Ci Rwot onen bot Solomon i dyewor meno kun wace ni, “Atyeko winyo legani, dong atyeko yero kabedo man wek obed mera me bedo Ot kama kibityero iye gitum bota. <verse eid="2CH 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 7:13" />Kace acego polo woko ma kot pe dong cwer, nyo kace aciko ni bonyo ocam cam ma i lobo otyek woko, nyo kace acwalo two gemo opoto ikom lwaka, <verse eid="2CH 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 7:14" />kace lwaka ma ki lwongogi ki nyingani gumwole woko, ce gulega ma kun giyenyo wanga an kikoma, ka dok guweko bene kit timgi maracu, ci dong abiwinyogi ki i polo, ci abikwanyo gin matye kabalo lobogi woko ni, ki dok abiweko balgi bene. <verse eid="2CH 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 7:15" />Cake tin wanga bibedo twolo, dok abiciko ita kawinyo lega ma kibilego i kabedo man. <verse eid="2CH 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 7:16" />Pien tin an dong atyeko yero ot man, dok bene atyeko lonyone odoko maleng, wek nyinga obed iye matwal; dok wanga ki cwinya bikemo kunu matwal! <verse eid="2CH 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 7:17" />Ki lok ma tung boti ene, kace ibibedo ki kit kwo inyima mayam woru Daudi obedo kwede ni, ce ka ibitiyo gin ma aciko ducu, kun igwoko cika ma aketo, ki gin ma dong angolo, <verse eid="2CH 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 7:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:4">1 Luk 2:4</ref></char></note>ci an Lubangani abimoko komkeri bibedo me loyo Icrael matwal. Ki kit jami ducu mayam aciko bot woru Daudi kun awace ni, ‘Pe ibibedo labongo danoni mo ma biloyo jo Icrael.’<verse eid="2CH 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 7:19" />Ento kace wungak woko, ma kun wubwoto lubu cika ki mako lok ma aciko ma aketogi inyimwu, ce dok wukobo woko bene katiyo bot lubanga mogo mukenegu kun wuworogi, <verse eid="2CH 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 7:20" />ci miyo abiputuwu woko ki i lobo mayam amiyowuni; dok abikwanyo wanga woko, ma pe dok abineno kom Ot man ma atyeko lonyo odoko maleng pi nyingani; ci miyo nying Icrael bidoko carolok ki lok aboka ikin lurok ducu.<verse eid="2CH 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 7:21" />Jo ducu ma bikato ki kanget Ot man madit tutwali gibiuru ki dok bene gibijwat kun giwaco ni; ‘Kit lok ango ma omiyo Rwot otimo loboni ki Ot man ki kit tim macalo man?’ <verse eid="2CH 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 7:22" />Ka dok gibiwaco ni, ‘Pien gubwoto woro Rwot Lubanga pa kwarigi woko mayam okwanyogi ki i lobo Ejipt, ci gukobo bot lubanga mogogu mukene, dok gubedo kaworogi kun gitiyo botgi bene; en aye lok ma omiyo Rwot omiyo can man opoto ikomgi magwar kit man.’”<verse eid="2CH 7:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CH 8" />
  <para style="s1">Tic mukene ma Solomon otiyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 9:10-28">1 Luk 9:10-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 8:1" />Otero Solomon mwaka pyere aryo me gedo Ot pa Lubanga ki ot me bedone. <verse eid="2CH 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 8:2" />Solomon dok oroco taun madito odoco mayam Kuram omiyogi bote, ci omiyo jo Icrael gubedo i igi.<verse eid="2CH 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 8:3" />Solomon dok ocito i Kamat-joba, ci omako woko. <verse eid="2CH 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 8:4" />En ogero taun madit me Tadmor ma i tim, ki taun madito ducu me kano cam ma i Kamat. <verse eid="2CH 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 8:5" />Dok en ogero Bet-koron Mamalo ki Bet-koron Mapiny orumu taun madito magi ki cel gogo, dok oketo iye dogola ma gicego ki rii. <verse eid="2CH 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 8:6" />Ogero Baalat bene, ki taun madito ducu me kano cam ma en Solomon yam tye kwedgi, ki taun madito me keto gadigadi monye, ki taun madito pa lulweny ma giringo ki aguragura, ki bene omede kiyubu kit gedo ducu mayam en Solomon omito ni kigergi i Jerucalem, ki i Lebanon, ki i lobo ma en loyo ducu. <verse eid="2CH 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 8:7" />Jo ducu mayam gubwot ci gudong ki ikom jo Kit, jo Amor, jo Periji, jo Kiv ki jo Jebuc, ma pe gin jo Icrael, <verse eid="2CH 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 8:8" />gin aye Solomon oketo tic muroni iwigi, kit macalo tyeni nio wa onyo. <verse eid="2CH 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 8:9" />Ento Solomon pe odiyo jo Icrael i tic me opii; gin gubedo acikarine, ki luditone, ki ludito me gadigadi monye, ki lulweny ma giringo ki aguragurane. <verse eid="2CH 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 8:10" />Jo magi gin aye ludito tic pa rwot Solomon ma giloyo dog tic ducu; welgi romo miya aryo ki pyere abic. <verse eid="2CH 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 8:11" />Solomon okelo nya pa Parao nia ki i gangkal pa Daudi ci otere i ot ma en ogero pire, pien owaco ni, “Dakona pe bibedo i ot pa Daudi rwot me Icrael, pien kabedo ducu ma dong Canduk pa Rwot obino iyeni dong odoko kabedo maleng.”<verse eid="2CH 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 8:12" />Dok Solomon obedo katyero gitum awanga iwi keno tyer pa Rwot mayam en ocano inyim kicika Ot ma i dogola me Ot pa Rwot. <verse eid="2CH 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 8:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:14-17">Nia 23:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:22-23">34:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 28:9">Wel 28:9</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 29:39">29:39</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:16">Nwo 16:16</ref></char></note>En obedo kamiyo gityer kit ma tic me nino acel acel mite kwede, kun lubu Cik pa Moses i ceng Cabit ducu, ki i Por Dwe, ki inino madito adek me mwaka ki mwakani, ma gin aye nino madito me Mugati ma Tobi Pe iye, nino madit me kwero Karama me Kac, ki nino madito me Bolo. <verse eid="2CH 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 8:14" />Kit macalo yam wone Daudi ociko, en oketo lwak dul pa ajwaki ki dog ticgi, ki Lulevi man ki dog ticgi me pako Lubanga ki me tic inyim ajwaki, muporo tic me nino acel acel. Opoko bene tic pi lugwok dogola ducu ki dulgi i dogola acel acel, kit ma Daudi ma dano pa Lubanga yam ociko. <verse eid="2CH 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 8:15" />Gin gubedo kalubu cik ducu ma rwot Daudi ociko ki ajwaki ki Lulevi, pe guweko gin mo ma mako lok ducu, ki ma mako kano lim.<verse eid="2CH 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 8:16" />Solomon otyeko tice ducu kitmeno, cake ki inino ma kiketo iye guti me te ot pa Rwot nio ka tice ducu dong otum, en otiyo tice ducu maleng labongo kalo mo ki iye.<verse eid="2CH 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 8:17" />Solomon dok ocito wa i Ejion-geber ki i Elot ma i dog nam, ma i lobo Edom. <verse eid="2CH 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 8:18" />Kuram yam ocwalo lutice ki meli bot Solomon; en ocwalo lutice ma gungiyo ki nam, ci gucito wa i Opir kacel ki lutic pa Solomon, guomo ki kunu jabu maromo talanta miya angwen ki pyere abic, ci gukelo bot rwot Solomon.<verse eid="2CH 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CH 9" />
  <para style="s1">Rwot ma dako me lobo Ceba olimo Solomon</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 10:1-13">1 Luk 10:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 9:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:42">Mat 12:42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:31">Luk 11:31</ref></char>
    </note>Ikare ma rwot ma dako me lobo Ceba owinyo pi yweka pa Solomon, ci en obino bote i Jerucalem katemo niange ki lapeny matego. Obino ki lwak jo madito mapol ma gucom i kore, kacel ki lwak kinagagu ma giyeyo angwece, ki jabu madwong tutwal, ki lutino godi me welgu. Ka en obino bot Solomon, ci ocako tite lok ducu ma onongo tye i cwinye. <verse eid="2CH 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 9:2" />Solomon odok i lapenye ducu; pe onongo tye lok mo wacel ma okane ki bot Solomon ma en onongo pe romo tucune bot dakonu. <verse eid="2CH 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 9:3" />Ka rwot ma dako me Ceba oneno ryeko pa Solomon ducu, ki ot ma en ogero, <verse eid="2CH 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 9:4" />ki cam ma iwi mejane, ki kit kabedo pa luditone ducu, ki tic pa lutice, ki bongi me arukagi, ki luting kikopogu, ci tam otum woko ki i cwinye liweng.<verse eid="2CH 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 9:5" />Ka dong owaco bot rwot ni, “Lok ikomi ducu mayam kitero bota ki i lobona, ki lok ikom ryekoni ducu bene, anongo loke weng tye kakare. <verse eid="2CH 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 9:6" />Ento yam pe aye lok ma kitero bota ducu, nio ka abino kany ka aneno ki wanga. Ci nen, kadi wa nucu ryekoni madite onongo pe ki tita kulu, pien ryekoni ki lonyoni kato lok dog ma kitera ma awinyoni. <verse eid="2CH 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 9:7" />Lutici gitye ki yomcwiny kuman! Lutici magi ducu gitye ki yomcwiny marom mene, ma gicung inyimi jwijwi kawinyo lok me ryekoni! <verse eid="2CH 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 9:8" />Kipak Rwot Lubangani ma cwinye opwoyo in ci oketi iwi komker me bedo rwot pi Rwot Lubangani! Pien Lubangani omaro jo Icrael matwal, dok omito mokogi gubed matek, en aye omiyo en oketi ibedo rwot ma loyogi, wek ibed kangolo kop atir dok kakare.”<verse eid="2CH 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 9:9" />Rwot ma dako me Ceba man omiyo bot Solomon jabu madwong maromo talanta miya acel ki pyere aryo, ki lwak angwece mapatpat madwong tutwal, ki lwak lutino godi me wel. Ikare ca onongo pe tye angwece mukene macalo meno ma rwot ma dako me Ceba omiyo bot Solomon.<verse eid="2CH 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 9:10" />Ka dok lutic pa Kuram ki lutic pa Solomon ma onongo gukelo jabu nia ki i Opir, gukelo wa ki bao yat algum ki lwak godi matino me wel bene. <verse eid="2CH 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 9:11" />Ci rwot otiyo ki bao yat algum pi jengo kor Ot pa Rwot Lubanga ki kor ot pa rwot. Ki mukene en otiyo kwede opuk ki nanga pa luwer. Kit jami macalo meno onongo peya yam onen kulu i lobo Juda.<verse eid="2CH 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 9:12" />Ci rwot Solomon omiyo bot rwot ma dako me Ceba jami ducu ma cwinye omito, dok omiye gin ducu ma openyo, makato jami ducu ma onongo en okelo bot rwot. Kitmeno rwot ma dako me Ceba ocako wote me dok cen wa i lobone kikome, kacel ki lutice ducu.<verse eid="2CH 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lonyo pa Solomon</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 10:14-25">1 Luk 10:14-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 9:13" />Lwak jabu ma obedo kabino bot Solomon i mwaka acel acel peke oromo talanta miya abicel ki pyere abicel wiye abicel <verse eid="2CH 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 9:14" />ma pe kiribo iye ma lucatwil gikelo; ki luker pa jo Arabia, ki ludito maloyo lobo bene gikelo jabu ki ryal bot Solomon. <verse eid="2CH 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 9:15" />Rwot Solomon otiyo lwak kwot ma dongo miya aryo me jabu, ma kitetogi ki nyol. Ikom kwot acel acel odonyo iye jabu ma peke romo cekel miya abicel. <verse eid="2CH 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 9:16" />Dok otiyo kwot matinone miya adek me jabu ma kitetogi ki nyol, kun kwot acel acel kiteto ki jabu ma peke cok romo ratili apar. Ci rwot oketogi i ot ma ki lwongo ni, Bunga me Lebanon. <verse eid="2CH 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 9:17" />Rwot dok otiyo komker madit me lak lyec, ci omwono kome woko ki jabu ma kiliyo maber. <verse eid="2CH 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 9:18" />Komker meno onongo tye ki rwome abicel ki kom me jabu me teno tyen, ma kikubugi ikom komker. Kangete tungi ki tungi kiketo iye kateno cing dano, ki cal labwor aryo gucung kanget bad kom me teno cing, <verse eid="2CH 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 9:19" />kun tye bene lwak cal labwor apar wiye aryo ma gucung i agiki rwom abiceli, tungi ki tungi. Pe tye kom mo ma kitiyo ma cal ki meno ite ker ducu.<verse eid="2CH 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 9:20" />Jami ducu mayam rwot Solomon mato kwede onongo tye me jabu keken, wa jami ducu ma kitiyo kwedgi i ot Bunga me Lebanon yam kitiyogi ki jabu ma kiliyo maber. Ikare pa Solomon pe tye ngat mo ma tamo pi ryal. <verse eid="2CH 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 9:21" />Rwot Solomon onongo tye ki lwak mel ma giwoto Tarcic kacel ki mel pa Kuram. Mel me Tarcic yam dwogo cen ka mwaka okato adekadek kun gikelo lwak jabu, ryal, lak lyecgu, ayomgu, ki gunyagu.<verse eid="2CH 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 9:22" />Rwot Solomon obedo dit makato lwak luker ma wi lobo ducu pi lonyone ki pi ryekone. <verse eid="2CH 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 9:23" />Lwak luker ducu me wi lobo gubedo kayenyo kit yo me neno wang Solomon ki bene pi winyo kit ryekonegu ma Lubanga oketo i cwinyeni. <verse eid="2CH 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 9:24" />Dano acel acel yam tero mote bote, kun gitero jami me ryal, me jabugu, me ginarukagu, odok mura, angwece, aguraguragu, ki kanagu, mwaka ki mwaka.<verse eid="2CH 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 9:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 4:26">1 Luk 4:26</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Solomon obedo tye ki loc alip angwen pi aguragurane ki pi gadigadi lwenye, ki lulweny ma giringo ki aguragura alip apar wiye aryo. En yam oketo mogo i taun madito me gadigadi lweny ki mukene gubedo bote wa i Jerucalem. <verse eid="2CH 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 9:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:18">Aca 15:18</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 4:21">1 Luk 4:21</ref></char></note>En oloyo luker ducu cake wa i kulu Euprate nio kwede i lobo pa jo Piliciti, ki iwang lobo me Ejipt. <verse eid="2CH 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 9:27" />Rwot Solomon yam omiyo ryal odoko gin ma lam marom ki gwenggu i Jerucalem, dok okelo yadi cedar mapol ata marom ki olam ma i bar Cepela. <verse eid="2CH 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 9:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:16">Nwo 17:16</ref></char></note>Solomon yam gamo aguragura ma a ki i Ejipt ki i lobo mukene.<verse eid="2CH 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ladol lok me loc pa Solomon</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 11:41-43">1 Luk 11:41-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 9:29" />Lok kom Solomon mudonge ducu, nia i acaki nio i agikine, kityeko coyone i <char style="bk">Buk me Tekwaro Mamako Kwo pa Lanebi Natan, </char> ki <char style="bk">Lok me Nebi pa Akija ma jo Cilo, </char> ka dok i <char style="bk">Buk me gin Anyuta pa Lanebi Iddo </char> ma ocoyo lok ikom Jeroboam wod pa Nebat. <verse eid="2CH 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 9:30" />Kare ma Solomon oloyo kwede jo Icrael kun bedo i Jerucalem oromo mwaka pyere angwen, <verse eid="2CH 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 9:31" />Solomon oto ci oywe kacel ki kwarine, ka kiyike i gangkal pa wone Daudi. Rekoboam ma wode aye oleyo katyene.<verse eid="2CH 9:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CH 10" />
  <para style="s1">Jemo pa jo Icrael ikom Rekoboam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 12:1-20">1 Luk 12:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 10:1" />Rekoboam ocito i Cekem, pien onongo jo Icrael gumol gucito i Cekem kaketo en me bedo rwot. <verse eid="2CH 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 10:2" />Ka Jeroboam wod pa Nebat owinyo pire, ci oa ki i Ejipt odok cen; pien onongo Jeroboam yam pud tye i Ejipt kama yam oringo iye rwot Solomon. <verse eid="2CH 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 10:3" />Kicwalo lukwena kalwonge, ka Jeroboam ki lwak jo Icrael ma gucoke ducu guwaco bot Rekoboam ni, <verse eid="2CH 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 10:4" />“Woru oketo yec mapek ikomwa. In dong ilok tic matego ma woru omiyowa, ki yec mapek ma en oketo ikomwani, obed mayot, ci wan wabibedo lutici”. <verse eid="2CH 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 10:5" />En ogamo ni, “Wudwog bota kany inge nino adek.” Ci lwak gudok cen.<verse eid="2CH 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 10:6" />Rwot Rekoboam ocako yubu lok ki ludongo muteggi, mayam gicung inyim wone Solomon ikare ma en pud kwo, ci openyogi ni, “Wun wumiya kit tam ango wek adok iye ki lwak man?” <verse eid="2CH 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 10:7" />Gin guwace ni, “Kace kica bimaki ikom lwak man, ma ikweyo cwinygi, kun iloko botgi lok ducu mabeco, ci gin ducu bene gibibedo lutici matwal.” <verse eid="2CH 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 10:8" />Ento en obwoto tam pa ludongo muteggi woko, ocako dok yubu lok ki awobe ma yalwake, ma gimiye tam. <verse eid="2CH 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 10:9" />Openyogi ni, “Wun wumiya kit tam ango wek adok iye ki lwak man ma gupenya ni, ‘Wek yec ma woru oketo ikomwa mapek obwoyo wa ni obed yot?’ ” <verse eid="2CH 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 10:10" />Ci awobe ma yalwake guwace ni, “Ibidok iye ki lwak ma gupenyi kit man ni, ‘Woru yam omiyo yecwa odoko pek, ento in imii obed yot botwa;’ ci in ibidok iye ki gin kit man ni, ‘Nyig cinga kinong makato pyer wora. <verse eid="2CH 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 10:11" />Dong abitiyo kit man: wora yam oketo yec mapek ikomwu, an dok abimedone bedo mapek ada. Wora yam opwodowu ki del anino, an abipwodowu ki yib oton.’”<verse eid="2CH 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 10:12" />Jeroboam ki lwak ducu ma gubino bot Rekoboam ikom nino me adeke, kit mayam rwot ociko ni, “Wudwog cen bota inino me adeke.” <verse eid="2CH 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 10:13" />Rwot ocako dok i peny pa lwak ki gero, pien oweko tam ma ludongo muteggi gumiye. <verse eid="2CH 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 10:14" />Rwot Rekoboam oloko ki lwak kit ma awobe guyubu kun waco ni, “Wora yam omiyo yecwu odoko pek, ento an abimedone bedo mapek ada; wora yam pwodowu ki del anino, an abipwodowu ki yib oton.” <verse eid="2CH 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 10:15" />Rwot Rekoboam pe oye winyo lok pa lwak; pien Rwot Lubanga aye omiyo en okwero, wek loke ma ceng oloko ocobe kakare, mayam en oloko bot Jeroboam wod pa Nebat kun ocwalo Akija ma jo Cilo ocito ka otiteni.<verse eid="2CH 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 10:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 20:1">2 Cam 20:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ka jo Icrael ducu guneno ni rwot Rekoboam dong pe owinyogi, ci lwak gudok iye ki rwot ni, “Wan watye ki wang pok wa ango ikom Daudi? Pe watye ki dul mo ikom latin pa Yece. Wun jo Icrael wudok i kemawu! Wek Rekoboam dong oloo jo ma i ot pa Daudi.” Ci jo Icrael gucako poke woko, gudok i pacogi. <verse eid="2CH 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 10:17" />Ento Rekoboam pud loyo jo Icrael ma gibedo i taun madito ma i Juda. <verse eid="2CH 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 10:18" />Ci rwot Rekoboam ki Adoram gucito kaporo lok ki jo Icrael, Adoram ceng obedo ladit maloyo tic muroni, ci nen jo Icrael ducu gucele ki got, guneke woko, ci rwot Rekoboam orune oito iwi gadigadi lwenye, ci oringo kwede woko wa i Jerucalem. <verse eid="2CH 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 10:19" />Kitmeno jo Icrael gucako jemo woko kwede ikom ot pa Daudi nio wa onyo.<verse eid="2CH 10:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CH 11" />
  <para style="s1">Lok ma lanebi Cemaya otito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 12:21-24">1 Luk 12:21-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 11:1" />Ka Rekoboam odwogo cen i Jerucalem, ci ocoko jo ma kiyero ki i ot pa Juda ki ikin jo Benjamin, ki twoni oteka lweny alip miya acel ki pyere aboro, pi lweny ikom jo Icrael wek kidwok ker bot Rekoboam. <verse eid="2CH 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 11:2" />Ento lok pa Rwot obino bot dano pa Lubanga ma nyinge Cemaya, kun waco ni, <verse eid="2CH 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 11:3" />“Wac ki Rekoboam wod pa Solomon ma rwot me Juda, ki bot jo ducu me ot pa Juda ki jo Benjamin ni, <verse eid="2CH 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 11:4" />‘Wun pe wubicito kalweny ikom lutuwu ma gin jo Icrael. Wek dano acel acel odok cen i pacone, pien lok man oa ki bota.’” Gin ducu guwinyo lok pa Rwot, ci gudok cen i pacogi, pe dok gucito kalweny ikom Jeroboam.<verse eid="2CH 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rekoboam orumu taun madito ki cel gogo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 11:5" />Rekoboam obedo ki i Jerucalem, ci en ogero taun madito ma cel gogo orumugi woko me gwoko Juda ki ikom mony pa lumeroke. <verse eid="2CH 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 11:6" />I lobo ma kipoko bot kaka me juda ki Benjamin en omiyo lutice ogero Beterekem, Etam, Tekoa, <verse eid="2CH 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 11:7" />Bet-jur, Coko, Adulam, <verse eid="2CH 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 11:8" />Gat, Mareca, Jip, <verse eid="2CH 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 11:9" />Adoraim, Lakic, Ajeka, <verse eid="2CH 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 11:10" />Jora, Aijalon, ki Kebron, gin ducu obedo taun madito ma kirumu ki cel gogo ma gitye i Juda ki i Benjamin. <verse eid="2CH 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 11:11" />En oyubu cel gogo magi ducu obedo matek, ci oketo ludito mony i igi, ki okano iye cam, ki moo ki kongo bwino. <verse eid="2CH 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 11:12" />Ka dok oketo kwot mapol ki tongi i gangi meno ducu, ci omiyogi gubedo matek mada. Kitmeno Juda ki Benjamin gudong ite loce.<verse eid="2CH 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ajwaki ki Lulevi gubino i Juda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 11:13" />Ajwaki ducu pa Lubanga ki Lulevi mayam gitye i lobo Icrael ma tung kumalo gua ki i kabedogi ducu, ci gubino ka bedo i Juda ki i lobo ma ingete Jerucalem. <verse eid="2CH 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 11:14" />Lulevi gubwoto lobo ma nongo gibedo iye gudok wa i Juda ki i Jerucalem, pien Jeroboam ki likwayone gukwero woko ni pe dong guti tic macalo ajwaki pa Rwot. <verse eid="2CH 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 11:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:31">1 Luk 12:31</ref></char></note>Jeroboam oketo ajwakine ma en oyero me tic iwang jogi ma iwi godi, ki bot jogi macalo nyogi dyegi, ki bot cal lutino twoni ma en oweko kitiyogi ki cing. <verse eid="2CH 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 11:16" />Jo mayam guketo cwinygi kacito bot Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael gulubu kor ajwaki pa Rwot ki Lulevi, nia ki i kaka pa jo Icrael ducu, kun guwoto wa i Jerucalem katyero gitum bot Rwot, Lubanga pa kwarigi. <verse eid="2CH 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 11:17" />Ci gujingo ker pa Juda matek, gumiyo Rekoboam wod pa Solomon obedo matek pi mwaka adek, pien gubedo kalubu kit pa Daudi ki Solomon pi mwaka adek.<verse eid="2CH 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jo ot pa Rekoboam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 11:18" />Rekoboam onyomo Makalat nya pa Jerimot wod pa Daudi. Min Makalat obedo Abikail nya pa Eliab ma wod pa Yece. <verse eid="2CH 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 11:19" />Makalat onywalo ki Rekoboam lutino awobe magi, Jeuc, Cemaria ki Jakam. <verse eid="2CH 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 11:20" />Ka dok ki ingeye en onyomo Maaka nya pa Abcalom ci onywalo kwede Abija, Atai, Jija, ki Celomit. <verse eid="2CH 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 11:21" />Ci Rekoboam omaro Maaka nya pa Abcalom makato mon ma obedo kwedgi ducu wa ki mon angecanegu. En yam onyomo mon apar wiye aboro ci obedo ki mon angecane pyere abicel kulu; ci onywalo awobe pyere aryo wiye aboro ki anyira pyere abicel. <verse eid="2CH 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 11:22" />Rekoboam oketo wode Abija latin pa Maaka me bedo ladit maloyo wi omegine, pien yam onongo omito keto en me bedo rwot. <verse eid="2CH 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 11:23" />Rekoboam obedo katic ki ryeko mada, opoko awobene mogo i dul lobo ducu ma i Juda ki Benjamin, ci oketogi i dog taun madito me cel gogo ducu, ki opoko botgi cam madwong, dok bene onyomo botgi mon.<verse eid="2CH 11:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CH 12" />
  <para style="s1">Rwot Cicak me Ejipt omonyo Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 14:21-28">1 Luk 14:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 12:1" />Ka ker pa Rekoboam dong omoko maber, kun mede ki cung matek, en kacel ki jo Icrael ducu gucako bwoto Cik pa Rwot. <verse eid="2CH 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 12:2" />I mwaka me loc pa Rekoboam me abice, en aye Cicak rwot me Ejipt obino kwede kalweny ikom jo ma i Jerucalem, pien gubwoto Rwot woko. <verse eid="2CH 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 12:3" />Ci gubino ki gadigadi lweny alip acel ki miya aryo, ki lulweny ma giringo ki aguragura alip pyere abicel. Ki lwak dul mony ma welgi pe kwane gubino kwede ma gua ki i Ejipt, jo Libya, jo Cukiim, ki jo Etiopia. <verse eid="2CH 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 12:4" />Ci en omako taun madito ma kirumu ki cel gogo ma i Juda ducu nio kwede wa i Jerucalem. <verse eid="2CH 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 12:5" />Ci Cemaya ma lanebi ocito bot Rekoboam ki bot rwodi me Juda, ma onongo gin ducu gucoke gitye i Jerucalem pi lworo Cicak ka owaco botgi ni, “Rwot owaco kuman ni, ‘Wun wutyeko bwoto an woko, pimeno an bene atyeko miyowu i cing Cicak.’” <verse eid="2CH 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 12:6" />Rwodi me Icrael ducu kacel ki rwot gumwole woko, omiyo guwaco ni, “Rwot loke tye kakare.” <verse eid="2CH 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 12:7" />Ka Rwot Lubanga oneno ni gumwole ken gi, ci lok pa Rwot obino bot Cemaya ma waco ni, “Gin gumwole ken gi; pe dong abityekogi woko, ento dong abilarogi, pe dong abitoyo akemona ikom Jerucalem ki i cing Cicak. <verse eid="2CH 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 12:8" />Ento gibibedo lutice, ka wek gunge tic kweda ki dok me tic ki luloc me lobo mukene bene.”<verse eid="2CH 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 12:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 10:16-17">1 Luk 10:16-17</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:15-16">2 Tek 9:15-16</ref></char>
    </note>Kitmeno Cicak rwot me Ejipt ocako bino kalweny ikom Jerucalem, ci oyako jami ma kikano i Ot lim pa Rwot Lubanga, ki jami ma kikano i ot lim pa rwot Rekoboam. En oyako woko ducu, dok oyako lwak kwot mapol me jabu mayam Solomon otiyogi. <verse eid="2CH 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 12:10" />Rwot Rekoboam dok otiyo lwak kwot mapol mukene; otiyo kwot me mola, ci omiyogi i cing ludito pa lugwok rwot ma gigwoko dogola ot pa rwot. <verse eid="2CH 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 12:11" />Ikare ducu ma nongo rwot cito i Ot pa Rwot Lubanga, lugwok en yam gimako kwot, ka dok gidwoko kakagi i ot kicika pa lugwok rwot. <verse eid="2CH 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 12:12" />Ka dong en omwole kene ci akemo pa Rwot oa woko ki ikome, ci pe omiyo kityekogi woko liweng, ci kwo odoko yot i Juda.<verse eid="2CH 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ladol lok me loc pa Rekoboam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 12:13" />Kitmeno Rekoboam omoko ker mere matek i Jerucalem dok obedo kaloc bene, Rekoboam ocamo ker ma mwaka me dite romo pyere angwen wiye acel, ci obedo kaloc i Jerucalem pi mwaka apar wiye abiro, Jerucalem ma en aye taun madit mayam Rwot oyero ki ikin kaka ducu me Icrael pi keto iye nyinge wek ki wor. Nying min Rekoboam obedo Naama ma anyira Ammon. <verse eid="2CH 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 12:14" />En con obedo katiyo gin marac, pien pe oketo cwinye pi yenyo miti pa Rwot.<verse eid="2CH 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 12:15" />Lok kom Rekoboam mudonge ducu, nia i acaki nio i agikine, ki tyeko coyone i <char style="bk">Buk me Tekwaro ma Lanebi Cemaya ocoyo, </char> ki i <char style="bk">Buk ma Lanebi Iddo ocoyo.</char> Lweny yam obedo tye ikin Rekoboam ki Jeroboam pi kare me locgi ducu, lweny obedo magwar ikin gi ma pe ogik. <verse eid="2CH 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 12:16" />Rekoboam oto, oywe kacel ki kwarine, ci kiyike kacel ki kwarine i gangkal pa Daudi; wode Abija aye oleyo katyene.<verse eid="2CH 12:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CH 13" />
  <para style="s1">Lweny pa Abija gin ki Jeroboam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 15:1-8">1 Luk 15:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 13:1" />I mwaka me apar wiye aboro me loc pa rwot Jeroboam, en aye Abija ocako loyo iye jo Juda. <verse eid="2CH 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 13:2" />En obedo kaloc i Jerucalem pi mwaka adek. Nying mine Mikaya ma nya pa Uriel me Gibea.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 13:2">Lweny obedo tye ikin Abija ki Jeroboam. <verse eid="2CH 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 13:3" />Abija yam ocito kalweny kun woto ki monye ma gin oteka lweny, ma giromo alip miya angwen ma kiyerogi ayera. Ci Jeroboam orwayo dul monye pi cok ka lweny ikome ki jo ma kiyerogi matego alip miya aboro, ma gin twoni oteka lweny. <verse eid="2CH 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 13:4" />Abija ocung iwi got Jemaraim matye i lobo gotgot ma i lobo Epraim, kun waco ni, “Winy loka, in Jeroboam ki wun jo Icrael ducu!” <verse eid="2CH 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 13:5" />Pe wungeyo mono ni Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael omiyo ker bot Daudi ki likwaye i gicike ma kimoko ki kado, me loyo Icrael matwal? <verse eid="2CH 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 13:6" />Jeroboam wod pa Nebat, ma latic pa Solomon wod pa Daudi, pud dok ojemo woko ikom rwode. <verse eid="2CH 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 13:7" />Jo mogo ma konygi pe ma kitgi obedo atata gucoke bote, ci gubalo Rekoboam wod pa Solomon woko. Pien onongo Rekoboam pud tidi ma time bene pud woto atata, dok nongo bene pe otwero kwero tamgi.<verse eid="2CH 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 13:8" />Nen kombedi wumito kwanyo ker pa Rwot woko ki i cing likwayo pa Daudi, pien ni wun wutye ki lwak madwong, dok wutye bene ki cal lutino twoni apaya me jabu ma Jeroboam otiyo me bedo lubangawu. <verse eid="2CH 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 13:9" />Wun pe dong wuryemo ajwaki pa Rwot woko, ma gin likwayo pa Aron, ki Lulevi, ka dok wuketo ajwaki pirwu kenwu macalo jo ma i lobo mukeneni? Kun ka ngat mo obino bot wu, teke en mito ni ki kwere ci en okelo wod twon nyo nyogi romi abiro, ci tugi doko ajwaka cut pi jogiwu ma pe gin Lubanga kikomeni. <verse eid="2CH 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 13:10" />Ento ki tung botwa, Rwot en aye Lubangawa, peya wabwoto en, wan watye ki ajwaki ma gitiyo ki Rwot ma gin aye likwayo pa Aron, ki Lulevi ma gikonyogi ki tic. <verse eid="2CH 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 13:11" />Odiko ki odiko ki otyeno ki otyeno, kiwango gitum awanga ki odok eceta ma ngwece kur, gicano mugati inyim Rwot iwi meja me jabu ma kiliyo maber, dok gigwoko lacib mac me jabu wek mace obed kalyel otyeno ki otyeno; ci wan watye kagwoko cik ma mako tic pa Rwot Lubangawa, ento wun wutyeko bwoto en woko. <verse eid="2CH 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 13:12" />Nen, Lubanga tye kwedwa, tye katelo wiwa, ki ajwakine gitye ki tum ma gikutu me ywayo mony me lweny ikomwu. Wun awobe pa Icrael, pe wulweny ikom Rwot, Lubanga pa kwariwu, pien pe wutwero loyo mony.<verse eid="2CH 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 13:13" />Jeroboam onongo ocwalo dul mony gukane woko me bino ikomgi ki yo ngegi; kitmeno onongo monye tye inyim jo Juda, ki jo ma gubutu gurumu piny woko tye tung ngegi. <verse eid="2CH 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 13:14" />Ka jo Juda guneno, ci gunongo ni mony tye inyimgi ki i ngegi bene; ci gucako kok bot Rwot, kun ajwaki gikutu tum. <verse eid="2CH 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 13:15" />Ci jo Juda gucako wayu me lweny. Ikare ma jo Juda gudange, Lubanga oloyo Jeroboam woko, omiyo jo Icrael ducu guringo woko ki inyim Abija ki jo Juda. <verse eid="2CH 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 13:16" />Jo Icrael guringo woko, ci Lubanga omiyogi i cing Abija. <verse eid="2CH 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 13:17" />Abija ki jone gunekogi ki nek malit tutwal; ci jo ma guto giromo alip miya abic ki ikom jo ma kiyerogi ayera ki ikin jo Icrael. <verse eid="2CH 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 13:18" />Kiloyo jo Icrael kitmeno, pien jo Juda ma oloyogini onongo gujenge ikom Rwot Lubanga pa kwarigi. <verse eid="2CH 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 13:19" />Abija olubu kor Jeroboam ci omayo taun madito mogo pa jo Icrael woko ki bote, Betel ki gangi matino ma ingete, Jecana ki taun madito ki matino ma ingete, ki Epron ki taun madito ki matino ma ingete. <verse eid="2CH 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 13:20" />Jeroboam pe dok olimo tek mo wacel ikare pa Abija; dok Rwot opwode, ci oto woko. <verse eid="2CH 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 13:21" />Ento Abija omede odoko tek, onyomo mon apar wiye angwen, onywalo kwedgi lutino awobe pyere aryo wiye aryo ki anyira apar wiye abicel. <verse eid="2CH 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 13:22" />Lok kom Abija mudonge ducu, ma nyutu kite mayam oloko, kityeko coyone i <char style="bk">Buk pa lanebi Iddo.</char><verse eid="2CH 13:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2CH 14" />
  <para style="s1">Rwot Aca otayo mony pa Etiopia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 15:9-12">1 Luk 15:9-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 14:1" />Abija oywe kacel ki kwarine, ci kiyike i gangkal pa Daudi; wode Aca aye oleyo katyene. Ikarene lobo oywe mot ki kuc pi mwaka apar. <verse eid="2CH 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 14:2" />Aca yam obedo katiyo gin maber dok manen atir iwang Rwot Lubangane. <verse eid="2CH 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 14:3" />En okwanyo keno tyer ki wang jogi ma iwi godi pa lurok woko, omuku wir jogigi bene, ka dok otongo yen ducu ma kicomo pi woro jok ma dako ma kilwongo Acera oreto woko piny. <verse eid="2CH 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 14:4" />Ka dok ociko jo Juda ni gubin bot Rwot, ma Lubanga pa kwarigi, dok gugwok pwonye ki loke ki gin ducu ma en ociko. <verse eid="2CH 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 14:5" />En bene yam omuku wang jogi ma i taun madito ducu ma i Juda, okwanyo keno tyer me wango odok eceta ducu, ci ker okwe mot ikarene. <verse eid="2CH 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 14:6" />Ogero taun madito ma kirumu ki cel gogo i Juda, pien lobo onongo okwe mot. Pe obedo ki lweny pi lwak mwakanu ducu, pien Rwot onongo omiye kuc. <verse eid="2CH 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 14:7" />En owaco bot jo Juda ni, “Wageru taun madito magi, warumugi woko ki cel ma wagero ikom odi matego ma ocudu malo, ci waket bene dogola iye ma kicego ki rii; lobo dong pud mewa, pien wabedo kabino bot Rwot Lubangawa, wabedo kabino bote ci en omiyowa kuc i kabedo ducu.” Gugedo dok gubedo ki lonyo madwong. <verse eid="2CH 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 14:8" />Aca obedo ki lumony ma gua ki i Juda ma giromo alip miya adek, ma gitye ki kwot mapol ki tongi, ki lumony ma gua ki i Benjamin ma giromo alip miya aryo ki pyere aboro ma gutingo kwot mapol, ma gin bene lucel atum; gin ducu twoni oteka lweny ma gitego.<verse eid="2CH 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 14:9" />Jera ma Laetiopia obino kalweny ikomgi ki mony maromo jo milion acel ki gadigadi miya adek; gubino guo cok ki Mareca. <verse eid="2CH 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 14:10" />Ci Aca ocito karwate kwede, kun guryeyo monygi i nota Jepata i Mareca. <verse eid="2CH 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 14:11" />Aca okok bot Rwot Lubangane ni, “Ai Rwot, pe tye lakony mo macalo in, ma konyo jo magoro kun lwenyo pirgi ikom jo matego. Konywa, ai Rwot Lubangawa, pien wa geno in, wabino kalweny ikom lwak man madwongi pi nyingi. Ai Rwot, in aye Lubangawa; pe i yee dano mo oloyo in.” <verse eid="2CH 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 14:12" />Kitmeno omiyo Rwot oryemo jo Etiopia opoto woko ki inyim Aca ki inyim jo Juda, ci omiyo jo Etiopia guringo woko. <verse eid="2CH 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 14:13" />Aca ki monye guryemo korgi nio wa i Gerar, ci guneko jo Etiopia matek ma dano mo acel pe obwot makwo; pien guket woko ata ki inyim Rwot ki monye. Jo Juda gutingo lwak jami madwong ma guyako gucito kwede. <verse eid="2CH 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 14:14" />Guturu taun madito ducu ma gurumu Gerar, pien Rwot omiyo lworo opoto ikomgi. Guyako taun madito ducu, pien onongo jami me ayaka dwong i igi tutwal. <verse eid="2CH 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 14:15" />Guputu kema pa jo mayam wegi dyangi, guyako romi madwong tutwal ki kinagagu. Ci gudok kwede cen i Jerucalem.<verse eid="2CH 14:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2CH 15" />
  <para style="s1">Aca odwoko cwiny jone ikom Rwot</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 15:13-15">1 Luk 15:13-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 15:1" />Cwiny pa Lubanga obino ikom Ajaria wod pa Oded, <verse eid="2CH 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 15:2" />omiyo en ocito orwate ki Aca, ci otite ni, “Winy an, Aca, ki jo Juda ki Benjamin ducu. Rwot tye kwedwu, kace wun wutye kwede. Ka wuyenyo en, ci wubinongo en, ento ka wubwoto en, en bene bibwotowu. <verse eid="2CH 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 15:3" />Jo Icrael onongo gubedo labongo Lubanga me ada pi kare ma lac, wa ajwaka ma pwonyogi bene onongo peke, dok gubedo labongo cik. <verse eid="2CH 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 15:4" />Ento ikare ma arubaruba madwong odiyogi ci guloke bot Rwot, Lubanga pa Icrael, kun giyenyo en, omiyo gunongo en. <verse eid="2CH 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 15:5" />Ikare meno ducu onongo ngat mo pe tye ki kuc me kato woko nyo kadi me dwogo cen i gang, pien cwiny dano orube woko pi can mapatpat ma obedo kapoto ikom jo ma gibedo i lobo ducu. <verse eid="2CH 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 15:6" />Ci kin gi opoke woko atata, rok lwenyo ki rok wadi ki taun madit ikom taun madit wadi, pien Lubanga odiyogi ki can ikit yo mapatpat. <verse eid="2CH 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 15:7" />Ento wun, cwinywu obed tek! Pe wuwek badwu okwe woko ki bedo nyabo, pien Lubanga biculu wang ticwu.”<verse eid="2CH 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 15:8" />Ka Aca owinyo lok meno ducu, ma lanebi Ajaria wod pa Oded otitoni, ci loke ocuku cwinye odoko tek, omiyo ocako jwero cal jogi me kipyeda woko ducu ki i lobo Juda ki Benjamin ki i taun madito ducu ma en omayogi i lobo godi ma i Epraim, ci oyubu keno tyer pa Rwot mayam tye inyim kicika ma kidonyo kwede i Ot pa Rwot. <verse eid="2CH 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 15:9" />En ocoko jo Juda ducu ki jo pa Benjamin, ki jo ma gua i Epraim ki Manace ki Cimeon, ma onongo gibedo ikin gi, pien onongo jo mapol gudak gua ki i Icrael gukobo bote pien guneno ni Rwot Lubanga tye kwede. <verse eid="2CH 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 15:10" />Ci gucoke i Jerucalem i dwe me adek i mwaka me apar wiye abic me loc pa Aca. <verse eid="2CH 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 15:11" />Ci gutyero gitum bot Rwot inino meno, kun kikwanyo ki ikom jami ma gukelo, mayam guyako, twoni maromo miya abiro ki romi alip abiro. <verse eid="2CH 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 15:12" />Ci gucako keto gicike me tic bot Rwot, Lubanga pa kwarigi, ki cwinygi ducu ki tipugi ducu; <verse eid="2CH 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 15:13" />ki dok bene guciko matek ni ka ngat ma pe bitic bot Rwot, Lubanga pa Icrael, ci myero kineke woko, kadi bed dano matidi nyo dano muteggi, laco nyo dako. <verse eid="2CH 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 15:14" />Ci gucako kwongo kwong bot Rwot ki dwon malongo, kun gidange, ma gikutu tumgu ki bilagu. <verse eid="2CH 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 15:15" />Ci jo Juda ducu cwinygi obedo yom pi kwongo kwong man; pien gukwongo kwong ki cwinygi ducu, kun gudwogo bot Rwot pi cobo mitine dok gunongo en, ci Rwot omiyo botgi yweyo ki oweko gubedo ki kuc ikin gi ki lobo ma orumugi dyere.<verse eid="2CH 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 15:16" />Rwot Aca pe orwo, en oryemo wa minne Maaka woko, pe oye ni omede ki bedo daker pien en otiyo cal me kipyeda pi Acera ma jok ma dako. Aca otongo cal joke ongido woko, ci owango woko i nota kulu Kidron. <verse eid="2CH 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 15:17" />Ento wang jogi ma iwi godi pe kimukugi woko ducu ki i Icrael. Kadi bed kumeno, Aca obedo ki lengic ikom Rwot pi kare me kwone ducu. <verse eid="2CH 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 15:18" />En okelo i Ot pa Rwot mot ma wone odyero, kacel ki mere kikome bene ma en odyero, ryal ki jabu ki weergu. <verse eid="2CH 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 15:19" />Lweny kong dok obedo peke i lobo nio wa i mwaka me pyere adek wiye abic me loc pa Aca.<verse eid="2CH 15:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2CH 16" />
  <para style="s1">Icrael oywayo mony ikom Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 15:17-22">1 Luk 15:17-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 16:1" />I mwaka me pyere adek wiye abicel me loc pa Aca, Baaca rwot pa jo Icrael ocito ka ywayo monyo ikom jo Juda, ci orumu taun me Rama ki cel matek, wek ogeng dano cito woko nyo bino bot Aca rwot me Juda. <verse eid="2CH 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 16:2" />Ci Aca okwanyo ryal ki jabu ma i ot kano lim pa Rwot Lubanga ki ma i ot pa rwot, ci ocwalo bot Ben-adad rwot me Ciria, mayam tye bedo i Damaciko, kun waco ni, <verse eid="2CH 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 16:3" />“Wek an ki in waribe kacel, kit macalo ribe con obedo tye ikin wora ki woruni. Nen, atyeko acwali ryal ki jabu; cit wek i citi itur ribe matye ikin in ki Baaca rwot me Icraeli woko, wek en oa woko ki bota.” <verse eid="2CH 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 16:4" />Ben-adad owinyo lok pa rwot Aca, ci ocwalo ludito monye kamonyo taun madito pa jo Icrael, ci guloyo Ijon, Dan, Abel-maim, ki taun madito ducu me kano cam ma i lobo pa jo Naputali. <verse eid="2CH 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 16:5" />Ka Baaca owinyo loke ci en oweko gero cel Rama woko, ci ogiko tice iye. <verse eid="2CH 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 16:6" />Rwot Aca olwongo jone ki i Juda ducu, ci guyweko lutino godi ducu ma i Rama kacel ki lwak bao, mayam Baaca obedo ka gedo kwede, ci ogero kwede cel i Geba ki Mijpa.<verse eid="2CH 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lanebi Kanani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 16:7" />Ikare meno Kanani ma lanebi obino bot rwot Aca, ci owace ni, “Pien in dong i geno rwot me Ciria, ma pe ibedo ki gen ikom Rwot Lubangani, omiyo mony pa rwot me Icrael guringo gubwot woko ki boti. <verse eid="2CH 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 16:8" />Onongo mony pa jo Etiopia ki pa jo Libya yam pe dit tutwal ma gitye ki lwak gadigadi lweny ki wegi aguraguragu? Ento in ibedo ka eno Rwot, ci oweko en omiyogi i cingi. <verse eid="2CH 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 16:9" />Pien wang Rwot neno lobo ducu, me nyutu teke bot jo ma gibedo ki lengic ikome. In itimo lok me mingo mada i lok man; pimeno cake tin in ibibedo ki lweny.” <verse eid="2CH 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 16:10" />Cut kiniga omako Aca ikom lanebi, ci okete i mabuc, otweye ki okol, pien ojul ikome pi lok meno. Ka dok oketo can ikom jo mogo bene matye ikin lwak ikare meno.<verse eid="2CH 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 16:11" />Lok kom Aca nia i acakine nio i agikine ki tyeko coyone i <char style="bk">Buk pa Luker me Juda ki me Icrael. </char> <verse eid="2CH 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 16:12" />I mwaka pyere adek wiye abongwen me loc pa Aca, en aye two omako iye tyene, ci twone omede marac mada; ento i twone ni en pe oyenyo kony ki bot Rwot, obedo mere kayenyo kony ki bot ludaktar. <verse eid="2CH 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 16:13" />Aca oto i mwaka me pyere angwen wiye acel me loce, ci en oywe kacel ki kwarine. <verse eid="2CH 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 16:14" />Kiyike i lyel ma onongo en okwinyo pire kene i taun madit me kal pa Daudi. Gupyelo kome iwi kitara ma kiketo iye lwak angwece mapatpat ma kiyubu ki diro pa luyub angwece; ka dok gumoko mac madit mada pi miyo ki en deyo.<verse eid="2CH 16:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2CH 17" />
  <para style="s1">Ker pa Yekocapat omoko matek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 17:1" />Yekocapat ma wod pa Aca aye oleyo katyen wone, ci oyubu monye odoko tek mada ikom jo Icrael kun tayogi woko ki i lweny. <verse eid="2CH 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 17:2" />Oketo mony i taun madito ma kirumu ki cel gogo ma i Juda ducu, ka dok oketo ludito wi mony oromo i lobo Juda ducu ki taun madito ma i Epraim mayam wone Aca omayogini. <verse eid="2CH 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 17:3" />Rwot ogwoko Yekocapat, pien en obedo kalubu kit pa wone ma con otiyo boteni; en pe obedo ka woro nyo yenyo kony ki bot lwak lubanga Baalgu. <verse eid="2CH 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 17:4" />En obedo kayenyo kony ki bot Lubanga pa wone ki lubu cike ducu, pe bene obedo kalubu kit pa jo Icrael. <verse eid="2CH 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 17:5" />Pieno Rwot omoko kere matek i cinge; ka jo Juda ducu gubedo kakelo lim ajog bot Yekocapat; ci en onongo tye ki lonyo madwong wa ki deyo bene. <verse eid="2CH 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 17:6" />En obedo ki awaka madit me lubu kor Rwot Lubanga dok me tic bote; ci en omuku wang jogi bene ducu ma iwi godi woko ki i Juda, kacel ki yen ma kicomo pi woro Acera ma jok ma dakoni.<verse eid="2CH 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 17:7" />I mwaka me adek me loce ocwalo rwodine Ben-kail, Obadia, Jekaria, Netanel ki Mikaya ka pwony i taun madito ma i Juda. <verse eid="2CH 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 17:8" />Medo ikomgi en dok ocwalo Lulevi magi, Cemaya, Netania, Jebadia, Acael, Cemiramot. Yekonatan, Adoniya, Tobiya ki Tob-adoniya; ki ajwaki ma onongo guwoto kwedgi obedo Elicama ki Jekoram. <verse eid="2CH 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 17:9" />Gucako pwony i Juda, ma gitye ki buk me Cik pa Rwot; ci gubedo bene kawot i taun mukene ducu me Juda kun gipwonyo iye dano.<verse eid="2CH 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yweka pa Yekocapat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 17:10" />Ci lworo ocako mako ker ducu ma gurumu lobo me Juda, ci pe guero lweny ikom Yekocapat. <verse eid="2CH 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 17:11" />Lupiliciti mogo gukelo motgi bene bot Yekocapat, guculu bote ryal, jo Arab bene gutero bote nyogi romi alip abiro ki miya abiro, ki nyogi dyegi alip abiro ki miya abiro. <verse eid="2CH 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 17:12" />Ci ker pa Yekocapat ocako dongo omede odoko madit mada. En ogero cel gogo ki taun madito me kano jami i Juda. <verse eid="2CH 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 17:13" />En obedo ki odi madito me kano jami i Juda. Obedo ki lwak acikari i Jerucalem ma gin twoni oteka lweny. <verse eid="2CH 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 17:14" />Man aye onongo welgi ma kiryeyo malubu dog odi pa kwarigi. I ot pa Juda ludito mony maloyo jo alip gin ene: Adna ladit me mony, kacel ki twoni oteka lweny alip miya adek; <verse eid="2CH 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 17:15" />ki ma lubu en obedo Yekokanan ladit me mony, maloyo jo alip miya aryo ki pyere aboro; <verse eid="2CH 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 17:16" />ki ma olube obedo Amacia wod pa Jikri, ma odyero kome pi tic pa Rwot, kacel ki jo alip miya aryo ma gin twoni oteka lweny. <verse eid="2CH 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 17:17" />I ot pa Benjamin onongo tye Eliada, ma en twon oteka lweny, kacel ki jo alip miya aryo ma gitye ki atum ki kwot; <verse eid="2CH 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 17:18" />ki ngat ma olubu en obedo Yekojabad, kacel ki jo alip miya acel ki pyere aboro ma guruke pi lweny. <verse eid="2CH 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 17:19" />Magi aye jo ma gubedo lutic pa rwot, medo ikom jo mayam rwot oketogi i taun madito ma kirumu ki cel gogo ma i Juda.<verse eid="2CH 17:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2CH 18" />
  <para style="s1">Lanebi Mikaya ociko Akab</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 22:1-28">1 Luk 22:1-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 18:1" />Yekocapat onongo tye ki lwak lonyo madwong wa ki yweka bene; ka en ocako ribe ki Akab, ci omiyo wode onyomo nya pa Akab. <verse eid="2CH 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 18:2" />Lacen inge mwaka mogo manok en ocito bot Akab i Camaria. Akab oneko lwak romi ki twoni dyangi mapol ata pire ki pi lwak ducu ma onongo gitye kwede. Man otimo pi bito en wek ocit kwede kalweny ikom Ramot-gilead. <verse eid="2CH 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 18:3" />Akab rwot me Icrael openyo Yekocapat rwot me Juda ni, “I bicito kweda kalweny ikom gang me Ramot-gilead?” Yekocapat ogamo dog rwot me Icrael kun wace ni, “An ki in wan acel, lwaka gin aye lwaki. Wabibedo kwedi i mony.”<verse eid="2CH 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 18:4" />Yekocapat owaco bot rwot me Icrael ni, “Kong i kwong penyo lok ki bot Rwot.” <verse eid="2CH 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 18:5" />Rwot me Icrael nongo ocoko lwak lunebine ducu kacel, gucoke gin miya angwen. En openyogi ni, “Wacit kalweny ikom Ramot-gilead, nyo pe waciti?” Gin lunebi gugamo ni, “Tugi cito cut, rwot, pien Lubanga bimiyogi icingi.” <verse eid="2CH 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 18:6" />Ento Yekocapat dok owaco ni, “Lanebi mo mukene pa Rwot pe tye kany, wek kong dok wapeny doge?” <verse eid="2CH 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 18:7" />Rwot me Icrael ogamo dog Yekocapat ni, “Pud tye dano mo acel ma myero wapenye wek wawiny dog Rwot ki bote, en Mikaya wod pa Imla; ento cwinya dage matek, pien peya otita kit lok mo maber, en tita lok marace keken.” Yekocapat ogamo doge ni, “Pe kumeno, rwot, wek lok kitmeno obedi.” <verse eid="2CH 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 18:8" />Rwot me Icrael ocako lwongo ladit mo ci owace ni, “Cit i cikel Mikaya wod pa Imla oyotoyot.” <verse eid="2CH 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 18:9" />Onongo rwot me Icrael ki Yekocapat rwot me Juda gubedo iwi komkergi, ma guruku jor kergi mabeco; gubedo kwede i laro moyo me dino bel ma inget dogcel ma ki donyo kwede i Camaria, kun lunebi ducu gitye katito lok inyimgi. <verse eid="2CH 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 18:10" />Jedekia wod pa Kenaana otiyo cal tung lee me nyonyo pire kene, ci owaco ni, “Rwot owaco kuman ni, ‘I bitwomo jo Ciria kit magi nio ka ityekogi woko ducu.’” <verse eid="2CH 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 18:11" />Ci lunebi ducu gutito lok ma kitmeno bene, kun giwaco ni, “Tugi cito i Ramot-gilead, ci ibiloyo; Rwot Lubanga bimiyogi i cingi, rwot.”<verse eid="2CH 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 18:12" />Lakwena ma ocito kalwongo Mikaya ni obino owace ni, “Nen ba, lok pa lunebi ducu obedo me cuku cwiny rwot; pieno wek loki bene obed marom ki meggi, loki bene obed lok me cuku cwiny.” <verse eid="2CH 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 18:13" />Ci Mikaya ogamo doge ni, “Macalo Rwot tye makwoni, gin ducu ma Lubangana owaca, en aye abilokone.” <verse eid="2CH 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 18:14" />Ka Mikaya oo bot rwot, ci rwot openye ni, “Mikaya, wacit kalweny ikom Ramot-gilead, nyo pe waciti?” En ogamo ni, “Tugi cito cut, ci ibiloyo; Rwot bimiyogi i cingi.” <verse eid="2CH 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 18:15" />Ento rwot dok owace ni, “An mono abiciko in i nying Lubanga tyen adi nio ka ibiloka lok ada keken i nying Rwot?” <verse eid="2CH 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 18:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:17">Wel 27:17</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:5">Eje 34:5</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:36">Mat 9:36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:34">Mar 6:34</ref></char></note>Ci Mikaya owaco ni, “Anene jo Icrael ducu guket woko lijayi iwi godi, macalo romi ma gipe ki lakwat; dok Rwot bene owaco ni, ‘Joni laditgi peke; wek ngat acel acel odok gire i pacone ki kuc.’” <verse eid="2CH 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 18:17" />Rwot me Icrael owaco ki Yekocapat ni, “An pe onongo awaco ni, Mikaya pe bitito lok mo maber ma otika, ento bitito marace?” <verse eid="2CH 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 18:18" />Mikaya ogamo ni, “Pimeno kong dok iwiny lok pa Rwot mono. Abedo kaneno Rwot Lubanga ma en obedo iwi komkere, kun lwak lumalaika ducu gucung kangete ki yo tung bade ma lacuc ki yo tung bade ma lacam. <verse eid="2CH 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 18:19" />Rwot owaco ni, ‘Anga mono ma bibito Akab rwot me Icrael, wek ocit oto i Ramot-gilead?’ Ci lumalaika gubedo kawaco lok mapatpat. <verse eid="2CH 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 18:20" />Lacen kit cwiny mo obino ci okati wa anyim, ci ocung wa inyim Rwot Lubanga, kun waco ni, ‘An aye abibito en.’ Ci Rwot openye ni, ‘Ibibito en ningning?’ <verse eid="2CH 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 18:21" />En ogamo ni, ‘An abicito, ci abibedo cwiny ma lagoba kun aloko ki i dog lunebine ducu.’ Ci Rwot Lubanga ogamo ni, ‘In ibibite, ci biye loki; dong icitim kitmeno.’ <verse eid="2CH 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 18:22" />Ci Mikaya omoko loke kitman ni: Kombedi in dong ineno ka Rwot otyeko keto cwiny ma lagoba i dog lunebini magi ducu; Rwot dong otyeko ciko pi kelo lok marac ikomi.”<verse eid="2CH 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 18:23" />Ci Jedekia wod pa Kenaana onyiko cok bot Mikaya ci odongo leme ki cinge, kun en waci, “Cwiny pa Rwot dok oa ki ikoma ningning ka okobo oloko boti?” <verse eid="2CH 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 18:24" />Mikaya owaco ni. “Meno ibiniang iye inino ma ibidonyo i kicika ma i tyelo wek i kane iye.” <verse eid="2CH 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 18:25" />Rwot Akab me Icrael owaco ni, “Wumaka Mikaya woko, wudwoke cen wa bot Amon ma laloyo me gang, ki bot Yoaci ma wod pa rwot. <verse eid="2CH 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 18:26" />Icit iwac ki gin ni, ‘Akab owaco kuman ni, wuket dano man i buc, dok wumiye ocam cam me buc, mugati ki pii keken, nio ka abidwogo paco ki kuc.’” <verse eid="2CH 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 18:27" />Mikaya ogamo ni, “Kace idwogo paco ki kuc, ci pe Rwot aye oloko ki idoga.” Ci dok owaco ni, “Wun rok ducu dong wuwiny!”<verse eid="2CH 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">To pa Akab</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 22:29-35">1 Luk 22:29-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 18:28" />Kitmeno rwot me Icrael ki Yekocapat rwot me Juda gucako cito i Ramot-gilead. <verse eid="2CH 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 18:29" />Rwot me Icrael owaco bot Yekocapat ni, “An abiruke macalo dano mo ata ka dong acako cito kalweny, ento in iruk jori me ker.” Rwot Akab ocako ruke macalo dano mo ata, ka ocito kwede i mony. <verse eid="2CH 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 18:30" />Onongo rwot me Ciria otyeko ciko ludito monye ma giloyo gadigadine me lweny ni, “Pe wucilweny ikom dano mo matidi nyo madit, ento wucilweny ikom rwot me Icrael keken.” <verse eid="2CH 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 18:31" />Ka ludito mony ma giloyo gadigadi lweny guneno Yekocapat, ci guwaco ni, “Meno aye rwot me Icrael kikome.” Ci guloke kalweny ikome. Yekocapat ocako dange ki koko bot Rwot kun mwoc, cutcut Rwot okonye. Ci Lubanga okwanyogi woko ki bote. <verse eid="2CH 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 18:32" />Ka ludito mony guneno ni pe en rwot me Icrael, ci guloke gudok woko cen gubwoto lubu kore. <verse eid="2CH 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 18:33" />Ento dano mo otelo atume ocelo ata, ci ocelo kwede rwot me Icrael atura; atero obaro kin nyonyo me gengo kore ki nyonyo mukene me gengo kome ma obedo macalo pok rec. Rwot Akab owaco ki laryem gadigadine ni, “Loke i dok cen wek i cit ikwanya woko ki iwang lweny, pien ret otyeko maka woko.” <verse eid="2CH 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 18:34" />Ci lweny odoko malyet inino meno, rwot me Icrael obedo ojenge i gadigadine kun wange okemo jo Ciria nio wa otyeno, ka ocako to ma ceng cito kapoto.<verse eid="2CH 18:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2CH 19" />
  <para style="s1">Lanebi Yeko ojuku Yekocapat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 19:1" />Yekocapat rwot me Juda odok gire cen maber wa i ode i Jerucalem. <verse eid="2CH 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 19:2" />Ento Yeko wod pa Kanani ma lanen piny aye ocito karwate kwede, ci owaco bot rwot Yekocapat ni, “In aye i myero me konyo jo maracu, ki maro jo ma gidag Rwot? Nen akemo pa Rwot dong otyeko bino me lweny ikomi. <verse eid="2CH 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 19:3" />Ento kadi bed kumeno gin mabeco tye ka nen ikin jami ma ceng i tiyogi, pien ityeko jwero yen ma kicomo pi woro jok Acera woko ducu ki i lobo man, ki me aryone in iketo cwinyi katiyo miti pa Rwot Lubangani.”<verse eid="2CH 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Alokaloka mabeco ma Yekocapat okelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 19:4" />Yekocapat obedo i Jerucalem; dok owoto ikin dano cake ki i Beer-ceba nio kwede wa i lobo godi me Epraim, ci en odwoko cwiny dano ikom Rwot Lubanga pa kwarigi. <verse eid="2CH 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 19:5" />Dok oyero lungolkop ki i taun madito ducu ma kirumu ki cel gogo matye i Juda, ki taun madito ducu, <verse eid="2CH 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 19:6" />ka dok ociko lungolkop ni, “Wubed ma wugwoko tamwu ikare ma wungolo kop; pimeno pe otim gin ma wutiyo pirwu kenwu, pien pe wubingolo kop pi dano ento pi twero pa Rwot Lubanga; dok en tye kwedwu ikare ma wungolo kop. <verse eid="2CH 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 19:7" />Pimeno wulwor Rwot kun wugwoke bene ikom gin ducu ma wutiyo, pien Rwot Lubangawa pe mito ni kingol kop kimed ki goba ma nongo loke pe tye atir, nyo kadi dworo kor dano mo, ki dok bene pe mito ni kigam lim me wilo loyo kop.”<verse eid="2CH 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 19:8" />Ki i Jerucalem Yekocapat dok oyero Lulevi mogo, ma ajwaki, ki ludito wi kaka me Icrael ducu, me bedo lungolkop pa Rwot ki me winyo pido ma pyem tye iye ma ngolo kope tek. Ci gin gubedo katic i Jerucalem. <verse eid="2CH 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 19:9" />Ka ocikogi ni. “Wubitiyo kun wulworo Rwot, kun wubedo ki gen, ki dok wubitic bote ki cwinywu ducu. <verse eid="2CH 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 19:10" />Kace utmegiwu ma gibedo i taun madito gukelo lok me pido mo mamako lok me oyo remo, ki mamako Cik pa Lubanga, nyo lok mo ma Lubanga ceng ociko nyo ongolo, wun aye wubipwonyogi, wek pe guting alii mo inyim Rwot, wek akemo pa Rwot Lubanga pe obin ikomwu ki ikom utmegiwu ducu. Wubitiyone kitmeno, wek pe wuting bal alii mo. <verse eid="2CH 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 19:11" />Dok wunen, Amaria ajwaka madit en aye ma biloyowu ikom lok pa Rwot ducu; gin ki Jebadia wod pa Icmael, ma laloyo ma i ot pa Juda, en aye maloyo lok ma bot rwot ducu; ki Lulevi gibitic botwu macalo lukaraniwu. Wubed ma cwinywu tek ka wulubu lok man ducu ma aciko, Rwot myero okony jo ma kitgi atir!”<verse eid="2CH 19:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2CH 20" />
  <para style="s1">Lweny ikom jo Moab ki jo Ammon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 20:1" />Lacen jo Moab ki jo Ammon ki jo mogo me Meun gubino kalweny ikom Yekocapat. <verse eid="2CH 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 20:2" />Jo mogo gucito ci gutito bot Yekocapat ni, “Mony madwong tye kabino kalweny ikomi ma gia ki i Edom, gua ki loka nam; nen, dong gitye wa i Kajajon-tamar” (ma en aye En gedi). <verse eid="2CH 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 20:3" />Ci lworo ocako mako Yekocapat matek, en kikome dong ocako yenyo kony ki bot Rwot cut, ka dok ociko pi rii kec i lobo Juda ducu. <verse eid="2CH 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 20:4" />Ci jo Juda gucoke kacel pi yenyo kony ma a ki bot Rwot Lubanga; dano oa wa ki i taun madito ducu me Juda gucito kayenyo kony ki bot Rwot Lubanga.<verse eid="2CH 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 20:5" />Yekocapat oa malo obino ocung inyim jo Juda ki jo Jerucalem ma gucoke. En obino ocung inyim Ot pa Rwot, ki inyim dyekal manyen, <verse eid="2CH 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 20:6" />ka dong olego ni, “Ai Rwot, Lubanga pa kwariwa, in aye pe Lubanga ma i tye i poloni? Pe in aye iloyo lwak ker ducu matye i lwak roki ducu bo? Tek ki tweroni tye i cingi, pieno pe tye ngat mo matwero juku in. <verse eid="2CH 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 20:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 41:8">Ica 41:8</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 2:23">Yak 2:23</ref></char></note>Pe in aye Lubangawa, ma oryemo jo ma i loboni ki inyim joni jo Icrael, ci imiyo bot likwayo pa Abraim laremi matwali? <verse eid="2CH 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 20:8" />Ka gubedo iye, ci gugero piri kabedo Maleng pi miyo deyo i nyingi, kun giwaco ni, <verse eid="2CH 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 20:9" />‘Ka gin mo marac opoto ikomwa, macalo lweny nyo lok ma in ingolo ikomwa, nyo two gemo, nyo kec, ci wan ka wabicung inyim Ot man, pien nyingi tye i Ot man, ci wabikok boti pi aroma can ma watye iye wa inyimi; ci in ibiwinyo ci ilarowa.’<verse eid="2CH 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 20:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 2:4-19">Nwo 2:4-19</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Dong inen jo Ammon, jo Moab, ki jo me got Ceir, mayam in pe iye Icrael omonyogi ikare ma gua ki i lobo Ejipt, mayam kwariwa gubwoto odong ma pe kijwerogi wokoni. <verse eid="2CH 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 20:11" />Nen kit ma dong giculuwa kwede ki bino karyemowa woko ki i loboni mayam imiyowa wacamo me bedo ginaleyawa. <verse eid="2CH 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 20:12" />Ai Lubangawa in pe ibingologi kop? Pien wan pe watye ki teko mo me lweny ikom mony man madwongi ma gubino kalweny ikomwani. Pe wangeyo giwa gin ma omyero watim, ento waketo wangwa keken ikomi ni in aye ikonywa ikom lukwor magi mateki.”<verse eid="2CH 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 20:13" />I karenu onongo jo Juda ducu gubino gucung inyim Rwot, co madito ki mon gi ki lutinogi. <verse eid="2CH 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 20:14" />Ci Cwiny pa Rwot obino opoto ikom Jakajiel wod pa Jekaria, wod pa Benaya, wod pa Jeyel, wod pa Matania, ma Lalevi ma jo pa Acap; onongo en tye i dye kal i coke meno. <verse eid="2CH 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 20:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 20:1-4">Nwo 20:1-4</ref></char></note>En owaco ni, “Wuwiny, wun jo Juda ki jo Jerucalem, ki in rwot Yekocapat: Rwot Lubanga owaco botwu kitman ni, ‘Pe wulwor, dok bene cwinywu pe opoti pi lwak man madwongi; pien lweny man pe mewu ento pa Lubanga gire. <verse eid="2CH 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 20:16" />Diki wucit kalweny ikomgi; nen, gibibino kun giwok ki iwi cere me Jij; wubinongogi wa kama nota ogik iye, tung kunyango me tim Jeruel. <verse eid="2CH 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 20:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:13-14">Nia 14:13-14</ref></char></note>Lweny man pe wun aye wubilwenyone, wun wubed i kabedowu, wucung iye mot, wek wunen kit ma Rwot bilarowu kwede tin, wun jo Juda ki Jerucalem.’ Pe wulwor, pe cwinywu opoti, diki wucit kalweny ikomgi, Rwot bibedo kwedwu.”<verse eid="2CH 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 20:18" />Yekocapat okulu wiye olungo wange piny i ngom, ci jo Juda ducu ki jo Jerucalem guryebe piny inyim Rwot, kun giworo Rwot. <verse eid="2CH 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 20:19" />Lacen Lulevi ma jo pa Kokat ki jo pa Kora, gucung kapako Rwot, Lubanga pa Icrael, ki dwon gi malongo.<verse eid="2CH 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 20:20" />Gua malo odiko con ci gucito i tim Tekoa. Ikare ma gicito, Yekocapat ocung ci owaco botgi ni, “Wuwiny an, wun jo Juda kacel ki wun jo ducu ma wubedo i Jerucalem! Wuye Rwot Lubangawu, ci wubicung matek; wuye lok pa lunebine, ci wubiloyo.” <verse eid="2CH 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 20:21" />Ka otyeko penyo tam ki bot lwak, ci ocako yero jo ma myero gubed kawer bot Rwot kun gipake ma guruku bongo maleng kun gitelo kwede nyim mony, ma giwero kuman ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 20:21">“Wumii pwoc bot Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 20:21">pien mar mere ma pe loke bedo nakanaka.”<verse eid="2CH 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 20:22" />Ka gucako wer ki pak, Rwot oketo mony ma gubutu pi kuru lweny ki jo Ammon, ki jo Moab, ki jo me got Ceir, ma gubino ikom Juda ni, ci kiloyogi woko. <verse eid="2CH 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 20:23" />Pien jo Ammon ki jo Moab gubino kalweny ikom jo ma gibedo i lobo godi me Ceir, ci gujwerogi woko liweng. Ikare ma lweny tum ikom jo ma gibedo i Ceir, gin bene gucako neke keken gi.<verse eid="2CH 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 20:24" />Ka jo Juda gua malo guito wa iwi lubele ma tung tim, ka guneno tung bot lwak monyi, ci guneno lwak kom dano ma oto ka gurade piny; ma acel mo pe obwot. <verse eid="2CH 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 20:25" />Ka Yekocapat ki lwake gucito kayako jamigi, ci gunongo dyangi mapol, ki jami ki bongi ki jami me welgu, ma gubedo kayakone me bedo meggi nio ka tingone oloyogi. Gubedo kayako jami pi nino adek, ento jamine obedo dwong mukato kare. <verse eid="2CH 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 20:26" />Inino me angwene gucoke i nota Beraka, pien gubedo kapwoyo Rwot ki kenyo; ma omiyo nying kabedo meno kilwongo ni nota Beraka nio wa onyo. <verse eid="2CH 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 20:27" />Dano gudok cen, jo Juda ducu ki jo Jerucalem kun Yekocapat telo wigi; gudok cen i Jerucalem ki nyate, pien Rwot omiyo gubedo ki nyate pi loyo lumerokgi. <verse eid="2CH 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 20:28" />Gubino i Jerucalem ki nangagi ki opuk ki obute wa i Ot pa Rwot. <verse eid="2CH 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 20:29" />Lubanga omiyo lworo omako ker ducu ma i lobo mapatpat ikare ma guwinyo ni Rwot obedo kalweny ki lumerok pa jo Icrael. <verse eid="2CH 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 20:30" />Kitmeno ker pa Yekocapat obedo mupye mot, pien Lubanga omiye yweyo i kabedo ma orumu ngete ducu.<verse eid="2CH 20:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Agiki me loc pa Yekocapat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 22:41-50">1 Luk 22:41-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 20:31" />Kitmeno Yekocapat oloyo lobo Juda. Yekocapat ocamo ker ma mwaka me dite pyere adek wiye abic, ci obedo, kaloc i Jerucalem pi mwaka pyere aryo wiye abic. Nying mine Ajuba ma nya pa Cilki. <verse eid="2CH 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 20:32" />En obedo kalubu kit pa wone Aca ducu; pe oloke oweko lubu kore; en obedo katiyo gin manen atir iwang Rwot. <verse eid="2CH 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 20:33" />Ento wang jogi ma iwi godi pe kimuku woko; lwak ducu onongo pud peya guketo cwinygi ikom Lubanga pa kwarigi.<verse eid="2CH 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 20:34" />Lok kom Yekocapat mudonge ducu, nia i acakine nio i agikine, kityeko coyo i <char style="bk">Buk me Tekwaro pa Yeko Wod pa Kanani, </char> ma kicoyo i <char style="bk">Buk pa Luker me Icrael. </char><verse eid="2CH 20:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2CH 20:35" />Lacen Yekocapat rwot me Juda oribe gin ki Akajia rwot me Icrael, mayam obedo katiyo bal maracu. <verse eid="2CH 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2CH 20:36" />Oribe kwede pi payo mel mapol me cito i Tarcic; gubedo kapayo mel i Ejion-geber. <verse eid="2CH 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2CH 20:37" />Ento Eliejer wod pa Dodayaku me Mareca otito lok ma okemo Yekocapat, kun waco ni, “Rwot bijwero gin ma wutiyoni woko, pien ityeko ribe ki Akajia.” Ci mel ducu gutur woko, pe gucito i Tarcic.<verse eid="2CH 20:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2CH 21" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 21:1" />Yekocapat oto ci en oywe kacel ki kwarine, ci kiyiko kacel ki kwarine i gangkal pa Daudi; wode Jekoram aye oleyo katyene.<verse eid="2CH 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jekoram rwot me Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 8:17-24">2 Luk 8:17-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 21:2" />En yam tye ki omegine, ma gin awobe pa Yekocapat: Ajaria, Jekiel, Jekaria, Ajaria, Mikael, ki Cepatia; gin ducu onongo awobe pa Yekocapat rwot me Juda. <verse eid="2CH 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 21:3" />Won gi omiyogi mot madito, me ryal, me jabu, ki me jami mabeco me wel, ki taun madito mogo ma i Juda ma kirumugi ki cel gogo; ento en omiyo ker bot Jekoram, pien Jekoram obedo latin kayone. <verse eid="2CH 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 21:4" />Ka Jekoram obedo wi komker pa wone ma dong kere omoko matek, ci oneko omegine woko ducu ki pala lucwan, kacel ki rwodi mogo ma i Icrael. <verse eid="2CH 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 21:5" />Jekoram ocamo ker ma mwaka me dite pyere adek wiye aryo, ci obedo kaloc i Jerucalem pi mwaka aboro. <verse eid="2CH 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 21:6" />Obedo kalubu kit pa luker me Icrael, kun tiyo kit macalo jo me ot pa Akab gutiyo; pien dakone nya pa Akab, obedo katiyo gin manen maracu iwang Rwot. <verse eid="2CH 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 21:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:36">1 Luk 11:36</ref></char></note>Ento Rwot pe omito tyeko Juda woko ducu, pi latice Daudi, kit ma con ocike kwede bote ni ebimiyo en ki likwaye bibedo kaloc matwal.<verse eid="2CH 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 21:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 27:40">Aca 27:40</ref>
      </char>
    </note>I karene en aye jo Edom gujemo iye woko ikom loc pa Juda, ci guketo rwotgi pirgi ken gi. <verse eid="2CH 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 21:9" />Jekoram okato loka kacel ki ludito monye ki ludito ma giloyo gadigadi lwenye ducu; en oa woko i dyewor olwenyo ikom jo Edom. Jo Edom onongo gurumu en woko kacel ki ludito ma giloyo gadigadi lwenye. <verse eid="2CH 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 21:10" />Kitmeno Edom ojemo woko ikom loc pa Juda nio wa onyo. Ka dok Libna bene ocako jemo woko ikom loce i karenu, pien en otyeko bwoto Rwot Lubanga pa kwarine.<verse eid="2CH 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 21:11" />Dok bene Jekoram ogero wang jogi iwi godi i lobo godi me Juda; en omiyo jo ma gibedo i Jerucalem gucako woro jogi, ma pe dong gitye ki gen ikom Rwot, omiyo Juda ongak woko. <verse eid="2CH 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 21:12" />Cut en olimo waraga ma oa ki bot lanebi Eliya, ma wace ni, “Rwot Lubanga pa kwaru Daudi owaco kuman ni, ‘In pe ilubu kit pa woru Yekocapat, nyo kit pa Aca rwot me Juda, <verse eid="2CH 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 21:13" />ento ibedo kalubu kit pa luker me Icrael, ityeko miyo jo Juda ki jo ducu ma gibedo i Jerucalem guworo jogi, macalo jo me ot pa Akab gumiyo jo Icrael guworo jogi; dok bene ityeko neko omegini woko ducu, jo me ot pa woru, ma onongo gibeco gikato in. <verse eid="2CH 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 21:14" />Nen, Rwot bikelo can madwong ikom lwaki, ikom lutinoni, ikom moni, ki ikom jamini ducu; <verse eid="2CH 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 21:15" />in kikomi ibibedo ki two matek two ma i cin ii, nio ka min ii bikati woko jwijwi pi two meno.’”<verse eid="2CH 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 21:16" />Rwot omiyo kiniga omako jo Piliciti ki jo Arab ma gibedo cok ki jo Etiopia; ci gubino gulwenyo ikom Jekoram. <verse eid="2CH 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 21:17" />Ka gubino pi lweny ikom Juda gumonyo lobogi, ci guyako jami ducu ma gunongo. Gutero jami ma i ot pa rwot, ki awobene ki mone, guweko wode acel keken mudong, en aye Yekoakaj, ma wode matidine.<verse eid="2CH 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 21:18" />Inge magi ducu Rwot opwode omiye two i cin iye ma pe twero cang. <verse eid="2CH 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 21:19" />Ka omede inge mwaka aryo, ci min iye obino woko pi two meno, ci oto ki arem me kom madwong. Lwake pe gumoko mac wacel pi miye deyo kit ma kimoko kwede mac pi kwarine. <verse eid="2CH 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 21:20" />En ocamo ker ma mwaka me dite pyere adek wiye aryo, ci obedo kaloc i Jerucalem pi mwaka aboro; cwiny dano mo pe ocwer pi tone. Kiyike i gangkal pa Daudi, ento pe ki yiko kome i lyel pa luker.<verse eid="2CH 21:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2CH 22" />
  <para style="s1">Akajia rwot me Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 8:25-29">2 Luk 8:25-29</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 9:21-28">9:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 22:1" />Jo ma gibedo i Jerucalem guketo Akajia ma wod pa Jekoram matidine odoko rwot ma oleyo katyene; pien mony pa jo mayam gubino i gony kacel ki jo Arab gutyeko neko awobe madito woko ducu. Man aye gin ma omiyo Akajia wod pa rwot Jekoram me Juda ocamo ker. <verse eid="2CH 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 22:2" />Akajia onongo dite romo mwaka pyere angwen wiye aryo ka ocamo ker, ci obedo kaloc ki i Jerucalem pi mwaka acel. Mine nyinge Atalia; en yam lakwar Omri. <verse eid="2CH 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 22:3" />Akajia bene obedo kalubu kit pa jo me ot pa Akab, pien mine aye obedo kamiye tam me tiyo gin maracu. <verse eid="2CH 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 22:4" />Ci obedo katiyo gin manen marac iwang Rwot, kit macalo jo me ot pa Akab gubedo katiyone; pien gin aye gubedo kamiye tam me tiyo gin marac ikare ma wone dong oto, ci gutere i to. <verse eid="2CH 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 22:5" />En bene oye tamgi, ci ocito gin ki Jekoram wod pa Akab rwot me Icrael kalweny ki Kajael rwot me Ciria i Ramot-gilead. Jo Ciria guketo ret ikom Joram, <verse eid="2CH 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 22:6" />ci en odwogo kamado rete i Jejreel, en aye wang ret ma jo Ciria guketo ikome ki i Rama ikare ma en olwenyo ikom Kajael rwot me Ciria. Akajia wod pa Jekoram rwot me Juda ocito kalimo Joram wod pa Akab i Jejreel, pien onongo kome lit.<verse eid="2CH 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeko oneko Akajia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 22:7" />Lubanga onongo dong otyeko yubu ni Akajia bito ikare ma en bicito kalimo Joram. Pien ka en cito kunu ci onywako wot gin ki Jekoram pi rwate ki Yeko wod pa Nimci, ma Rwot onongo owiro wek otyek jo me ot pa Akab woko. <verse eid="2CH 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 22:8" />Ikare ma Yeko tye kacobo lok ma Rwot ongolo ikom jo me ot pa Akab, en orwate ki ludito me Juda bene ki awobe pa omegi Akajia, ma gitiyo bot Akajia, ci onekogi woko. <verse eid="2CH 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 22:9" />En obedo kayenyo Akajia, ci kimako en ki i Camaria kama okane iye. Ka kikele bot Yeko ci Yeko oneke woko. Ci guyike, pien guwaco ni, “En lakwar Yekocapat, mayam obedo kayenyo Rwot ki cwinye ducu.” Dano mo pe odong i ot pa Akajia maromo camo ker.<verse eid="2CH 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Atalia omayo ker tektek</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 11:1-3">2 Luk 11:1-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 22:10" />Ka Atalia min Akajia oneno ni wode oto woko, ci en ocako jwero jo me dog otker pa Juda woko ducu. <verse eid="2CH 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 22:11" />Ento Yekocabeat nya pa rwot, otingo Yoaci wod pa Akajia, ci okwalo woko ki ikin awobe pa rwot ma kibinekogini, ci okano en ki lapidine i kicika mo me butu. Yekocabeat, ma nya pa rwot Jekoram obedo dako pa ajwaka Yekoyada, ma en lamin Akajia. En okano Yoaci woko ki bot Atalia kitmeno, ci omiyo Atalia pe oneke. <verse eid="2CH 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 22:12" />Ci en obedo kwedgi pi mwaka abicel, kun ki kano en i Ot pa Lubanga ikare ma Atalia tye kaloyo lobo.<verse eid="2CH 22:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2CH 23" />
  <para style="s">Jemo ikom Atalia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 11:4-16">2 Luk 11:4-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 23:1" />Ento i mwaka me abirone Yekoyada obedo ki tekcwiny kun ocamo co ci oweko, en oketo gicike ki ludito abic ma lulo buca mony pa jo miya, Ajaria wod pa Jerokam, Icmael wod pa Yekokanan, Ajaria wod pa Obed, Maceya wod pa Adaya, ki Elicapat wod pa Jikri. <verse eid="2CH 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 23:2" />Ci guket i lobo Juda ducu, kama gubedo kacoko Lulevi ki i taun madito me Juda woko ducu, ki ludito wi kaka ma i dog odi me Icrael ducu, ci gubino kwedgi wa i Jerucalem. <verse eid="2CH 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 23:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12">2 Cam 7:12</ref></char></note>Lwak mucoke ducu guketo gicike ki rwotgi ki i Ot pa Lubanga. Ci Yekoyada owaco botgi ni, “Nen, man wod pa rwot ene! Wuwek en aye obed lalocwu, kit mayam Rwot oloko ikom likwayo pa Daudi. <verse eid="2CH 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 23:4" />Man aye gin ma wubitiyo. Dong wun ajwaki ki Lulevi ma wua woko ki i dog tic inino me Cabit wubipoke i dul adek; dul acel me adek gubed lugwok dogola, <verse eid="2CH 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 23:5" />ki dul acel me adek mukene gibikuru ot pa rwot, ki dul acel me adek gubed i dogola ma kilwongo ni Guti Ot; ki lwak ducu gubed idyekal me Ot pa Rwot. <verse eid="2CH 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 23:6" />Pe wuwek dano mo odony i Ot pa Rwot, kono ajwaki ki Lulevi ma lutic keken aye gudony, pien gin jo maleng; ento lwak ducu gibigwoko Cik pa Rwot. <verse eid="2CH 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 23:7" />Lulevi gibirumu rwot dyere, kun dano acel acel omako jami lwenye i cinge. Ento dano mo ata ma otemo donyo i Ot pa Rwot kibineke woko. Wubibedo ki rwot kama en bicito iye ducu.”<verse eid="2CH 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 23:8" />Lulevi ki jo Juda ducu gutiyo gin ducu kit macalo ajwaka Yekoyada ociko botgi. Dano acel acel okelo lwake, ma onongo guweko dog ticgi inino me Cabit, gubino kacel ki jo ma gibino katic inino me Cabit; pien ajwaka Yekoyada pe oye jo ducu madong gutyeko ticgi inino meno me dok gang. <verse eid="2CH 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 23:9" />Ajwaka Yekoyada ocako miyo ki ludito me mony lwak tongi ki kwot mapol madito ki matino ma onongo yam pa rwot Daudi, ma onongo tye i Ot pa Lubanga. <verse eid="2CH 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 23:10" />En oketo lwak kagwoko rwot, kun dano acel acel omako jami lwenye i cinge, cake wa tung kupiny me ot nio kwede wa tung kumalo me ot, kun girumu keno tyer. <verse eid="2CH 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 23:11" />Ka dong ocako kelo Yoaci wod pa rwot, oketo lalukana i wiye, ka omiye cik pa Lubanga mamako kit me loc i cinge, ka kitucu atir ni en dong rwot. Yekoyada ki awobene guwiro en ki moo, ci dano gudange ni, “Rwot obed kwo nakanaka!”<verse eid="2CH 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 23:12" />Ka Atalia owinyo woo pa lwak ma guringo kun gipako rwot Yoaci, ci en ocito bot lwak wa i Ot pa Rwot. <verse eid="2CH 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 23:13" />Ka ongiyo piny, ci oneno rwot Yoaci ocung kanget wir ki i dog Ot pa Lubanga, kun ludito me mony ki lukut tum gurumu rwot Yoaci, ki lwak jo ducu ma gua ki ikin gang gubedo kawoo ki tum kun cwinygi yom, ki luwer ma gumako jami wergi gutelo wer me kwero en. Ci Atalia oyeco bongone cut ka ocako kok ni, “Roro yai! Roro yai!” <verse eid="2CH 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 23:14" />Ci ajwaka Yekoyada okelo ludito mony ma gubedo kacel ki monye, ci en ocikogi ni, “Wukel dakonu woko, pe wuwek obwot. Ka ngat mo olubu kore, ci wuneke woko ki pala lucwan.” Pien ajwaka onongo otamo ni pe omyero ki neke ki i Ot pa Rwot. <verse eid="2CH 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 23:15" />Gumako Atalia, ci guwok kwede ki i dogola ma aguragura donyo kwede, guo wa i ot pa rwot ci guneke kenyo.<verse eid="2CH 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alokaloka ma Yekoyada okelo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 11:17-20">2 Luk 11:17-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 23:16" />Yekoyada ocako keto gicike ikin en ki lwak ducu ki rwot Yoaci wek gubed lwak pa Rwot. <verse eid="2CH 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 23:17" />Lwak ducu gucako mol gucito i ot pa jok Baal, ci gumuku gureto woko piny; guturu keno tyere ducu, dok gungido cal jogine woko ducu matinotino, ci guneko Matan ajwaka pa Baal ki inyim keno tyere. <verse eid="2CH 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 23:18" />Lacen Yekoyada oketo lukurpiny me gwoko Ot pa Rwot ite twero pa ajwaki ma Lulevi, ki Lulevi mayam Daudi opoko tic botgi pi bedo lugwok Ot pa Rwot, kun gityero gitum awanga bot Rwot, macalo kicoyo i Cik pa Moses, ki yomcwiny kacel ki wer, kit mayam Daudi oyubuni. <verse eid="2CH 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 23:19" />Yekoyada dok oketo lugwok dogola i dogola Ot pa Rwot, wek dano mo ma kome kikeni pe odony iye. <verse eid="2CH 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 23:20" />En dok okwanyo ludito mony, ki rwodi, ki lulo wi lwak, kacel ki lwak ducu, ci gucako kelo rwot Yoaci woko ki i Ot pa Rwot Lubanga kun gidore giwok ki i cel madit nio kwede wa i ot pa rwot. Ci guketo rwot Yoaci obedo piny iwi komker pa luker. <verse eid="2CH 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 23:21" />Kitmeno lwak ducu cwinygi obedo yom; piny ocako kwe mot ki inge to pa Atalia ma kineke ki pala lucwan.<verse eid="2CH 23:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2CH 24" />
  <para style="s1">Yoaci rwot me Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 12:1-16">2 Luk 12:1-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 24:1" />Yoaci ocamo ker ma mwaka me dite tye abiro, ci obedo kaloc i Jerucalem pi mwaka pyere angwen. Nying mine Jibia me Beer-ceba. <verse eid="2CH 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 24:2" />Yoaci obedo katiyo gin manen atir iwang Rwot pi kare me kwo pa ajwaka Yekoyada ducu. <verse eid="2CH 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 24:3" />Yekoyada onyomo bote mon aryo, ci onywalo kwedgi lutino co ki anyira.<verse eid="2CH 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 24:4" />Lacen Yoaci obedo ki tam pi yubu Ot pa Rwot. <verse eid="2CH 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 24:5" />Ocoko ajwaki ki Lulevi, ci ocako waco botgi ni, “Wucit wa i gangi pa jo Juda, wek wucok lim ki bot jo Icrael ducu pi yubu Ot pa Lubangawa mwaka ki mwaka; ber wunen ni wutiyo tic man oyotoyot.” Ento Lulevi pe guruyu tiyone oyotoyot. <verse eid="2CH 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 24:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:11-16">Nia 30:11-16</ref></char></note>Ma omiyo rwot olwongo Yekoyada ajwaka madit, openye ni, “Pingo pe iweko Lulevi gujogo lim ki bot jo ma bedo i Juda ki Jerucalem kit mayam Moses latic pa Rwot ociko ni myero ki gam ki bot lwak jo Icrael pi tic me Kema pa Rwot Lubanga?” <verse eid="2CH 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 24:7" />Pien jo pa Atalia, ma en dako ma latim maraci, onongo dong yam guture woko pi donyo ki balo Ot pa Lubanga, pien gutero jami ducu mayam kidyero pi Ot pa Rwot, gutiyo kwedgi pi woro jok Baal.<verse eid="2CH 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 24:8" />Pimeno rwot ociko ni myero kipaa canduk, ci ki gur doge ki woko inyim dogola me Ot pa Rwot. <verse eid="2CH 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 24:9" />Kitito loke oromo i Juda ki Jerucalem ducu, ni myero dano gukel lim ajog pa Rwot kit ma Moses latic pa Lubanga ceng ociko ki jo Icrael ikare ma pud gitye i timi. <verse eid="2CH 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 24:10" />Pi lok meno lutela kacel ki lwak ducu cwinygi obedo yom, ci gucako kelo lim ajog megi, kun giketo i canduk nio ka lim ma gumiyo opongo iye woko. <verse eid="2CH 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 24:11" />Ikare ducu ma Lulevi gikelo canduk bot ludito ma rwot ocimo, kace guneno ni lim tye i canduk madwong, ci karan pa rwot, kacel ki ajwaka madit, gibino gikwanyo lim woko ki i canduk gicito kwede, ka gidwoko canduk kakare i kabedone. Gubedo katimo kitmeno nino ki nino, ci gucoko lim madwong. <verse eid="2CH 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 24:12" />Rwot gin ki Yekoyada gumiyo lim i cing lutic ma giloyo dog tic me Ot pa Rwot, ci kiculu ki lupaa godi ki lupaa bao pi yubu Ot pa Rwot, kiculu kwede bene lutic ki nyonyo ki mola pi yubu Ot pa Rwot. <verse eid="2CH 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 24:13" />Jo ma kimiyogi tic meno botgi gutiyo ticgi matek dok maber ci yubune owoto oyot i cinggi maber atikatika, ci guyubu Ot pa Rwot odoko ber kit mayam con, ki odoko tek kakare. <verse eid="2CH 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 24:14" />Ka dong gutyeko ticgi, ci gukelo lim mudonge bot rwot ki Yekoyada, ka gutiyo ki jami Ot pa Rwot, pi tic mapatpat ki pi gitum awanga, ki atabo me wango odok eceta, ki jami me jabu ki me ryal. Gutyero gitum awanga i Ot pa Rwot jwijwi ikare me kwo pa Yekoyada ducu.<verse eid="2CH 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 24:15" />Ento ka Yekoyada dong otegi, ma otii woko, ci en oto. Ikare ma en to onongo mwakane dong oromo miya acel ki pyere adek. <verse eid="2CH 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 24:16" />Kiyike i gangkal pa Daudi ikin luker, pien en obedo katiyo tic maber i Icrael, kun tiyo pi Lubanga ki pi Ot pa Rwot.<verse eid="2CH 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 24:17" />Lacen inge to pa Yekoyada, rwodi me Juda gubino guryebe inyim rwot, ci gucako ywayo tame wek owinyo lok ma meggi aye ento pe pa Rwot Lubanga. <verse eid="2CH 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 24:18" />Ci gucako bwoto Ot pa Rwot, ma en aye kabedo me woro Lubanga pa kwarigi, ci gin gudok ka woro Acera ma jok ma dakoni, ki cal jogi apayagu. Cut akeca pa Rwot obino ikom jo Juda ki Jerucalem pi bal meno. <verse eid="2CH 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 24:19" />Ento Rwot pud omede ki cwalo lunebine mogo botgi, wek gudwokgi cen bote, ci gutito loke botgi, ento dano gukwero winyone.<verse eid="2CH 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 24:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 23:35">Mat 23:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:51">Luk 11:51</ref></char>
    </note>Ka Cwiny pa Lubanga obino ikom Jekaria wod pa ajwaka Yekoyada ci en ocung inyim lwak ka ocako owaco botgi ni, “Lubanga owaco kuman ni, ‘Pingo wun wukalo wi Cik pa Rwot, miyo pe wulimo gum? Pien dong wutyeko bwoto Rwot Lubangawu woko, ci en bene dong otyeko bwotowu.’” <verse eid="2CH 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 24:21" />Ento gubedo kalibo en, ci gucele ki got pi gin ma rwot ociko, ci guneke idyekal me Ot pa Rwot. <verse eid="2CH 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 24:22" />Rwot Yoaci pe opo pi kica ki pi ber ma Yekoyada won Jekaria yam onyutu ikome, ento dok oneko wode woko. Ikare ma en to, Jekaria owaco ni, “Ber Rwot onen gin ma otimeni, ci ocul kwora!”<verse eid="2CH 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 24:23" />Ikare me tum mwaka meno mony pa jo Ciria obino kalweny ikom Yoaci. Kun gin gubino ikom Juda ki Jerucalem, ci gujwero lutela pa lwak woko ducu ki ikin dano, ka dok gucwalo jamigi ma guyako ducu bot rwot me Damaciko. <verse eid="2CH 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 24:24" />Kadi bed mony pa jo Ciria obino ki jo manok mo, ento Rwot omiyo mony madit pa jo Juda i cinggi, pien onongo gubwoto Rwot Lubanga pa kwarigi. Kitmeno gucobo kop ma Rwot ongolo ikom Yoaci.<verse eid="2CH 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 24:25" />Ka jo Ciria gua woko ki bote, gubwoto en ma dong guketo ret marac tutwal ikome. Ki lutice bene gupiro lok ikome pi culu kwor pi remo pa wod pa ajwaka Yekoyada, ci guneke woko i ot iwi kitandane. Ci en oto kitmeno, ci kiyike i gangkal pa Daudi, ento pe kiyiko en i lyel pa luker. <verse eid="2CH 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 24:26" />Jo ma gujemo ikome gin ene: Jabad wod pa Cimeat ma nya jo Ammon, ki Yekojabad ma wod pa Cimrit nya jo Moab. <verse eid="2CH 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 24:27" />Lok kom lutino awobe pa Yoaci, ki lok mapol ma lunebi guloko ikome, ki lok kom gero Ot pa Lubanga odoco ki tyeko coyone i <char style="bk">Buk Lagony Lok ma i Buk pa Luker. </char> Wode Amajia aye oleyo katyene.<verse eid="2CH 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="2CH 25" />
  <para style="s1">Amajia rwot me Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 14:1-6">2 Luk 14:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 25:1" />Amajia ocamo ker ma mwaka me dite tye pyere aryo wiye abic, ci obedo kaloc i Jerucalem pi mwaka pyere aryo wiye abongwen. Nying mine Yekoadan me Jerucalem. <verse eid="2CH 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 25:2" />En obedo katiyo gin manen atir iwang Rwot Lubanga, ento en onongo pe keto iye cwinye ducu. <verse eid="2CH 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 25:3" />Ka kere omoko matek i cinge, ci ocako neko lutice mayam guneko wone ma rwoti. <verse eid="2CH 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 25:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:16">Nwo 24:16</ref></char></note>Ento pe oneko lutino pa jo ma luneki, kit macalo kicoyo i buk me Cik pa Moses kama yam Rwot ociko ni, “Won latin pe kibineko pi bal pa wode, nyo latin pi bal pa wone; ento dano acel acel kibineke pi bale kikome.<verse eid="2CH 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lweny ikom Edom</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 14:7">2 Luk 14:7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 25:5" />Amajia dok ocoko lwak me Juda, ci oketogi muporo dog odi pa kwarogi ite ludito ma giloyo buca mony pa jo alip ki pa jo miya, pi jo Juda ki jo Benjamin ducu. Okwano jo ma mwaka me ditogi romo pyere aryo dok kwede malo, ci onongo ni jo ma kiyero ma gin twoni oteka lweny giromo alip miya adek, ma kiyerogi ayera ma giromo lweny, ma gingeyo mako tong ki kwot. <verse eid="2CH 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 25:6" />Dok onongo twoni oteka lweny alip miya acel mukene ki bot jo Icrael kun owilogi ki talanta me ryal miya acel. <verse eid="2CH 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 25:7" />Ento lanebi pa Lubanga obino bote owace ni, Rwoda, pe iye mony pa Icrael ocit kwedwu, pien Rwot pe tye ki jo Icrael, en pe tye ki jo Epraim magi ducu. <verse eid="2CH 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 25:8" />Ento ka in itamo ni ibilimo teko me lweny pi lok meno, ci Lubanga bimiyo lumeroki bitayo in woko; pien Lubanga tye ki teko me miyo dano loc ki me weko kitayo dano woko.” <verse eid="2CH 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 25:9" />Amajia ogamo dog lanebi pa Lubanga ni, “Wabitimo ango pi talanta miya acel ma dong atyeko miyone bot mony pa jo Icraeli?” Lanebi pa Lubanga odok iye ni, “Rwot twero miyi lim madwong makato man.” <verse eid="2CH 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 25:10" />Ci Amajia ocako cwalo mony ma oa ki i Epraim gubino boteni, me dok woko cen i pacogi doki. Ci kiniga omakogi matek ikom jo Juda, ci gucako dok i ganggi ki kiniga mager. <verse eid="2CH 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 25:11" />Ento Amajia odiyo cwinye, ci otero lwake, ocito kwedgi wa i nota me Kado, ci oneko jo Ceir ma giromo alip apar. <verse eid="2CH 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 25:12" />Jo Juda gumako jo mukene makwo ma giromo alip apar bene, ci guterogi iwi got ka gucorogi woko piny ki iwi got kunu; gin ducu gupoto gunyot woko. <verse eid="2CH 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 25:13" />Ento lumony me Icrael ma Amajia okwerogi ni pe gucit i lweny kwedgini, ma ocwalogi gudok cen ni, gumonyo gangi me Juda, cake ki i Camaria, nio kwede i Bet-koron, ci guneko jo alip adek ki kunu, dok guyako jami mapol.<verse eid="2CH 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 25:14" />Ka Amajia odwogo ki ka neko jo Edom, okelo ki lwak lubangagu pa jo Ceir, ci ocibogi gucung macalo lubangane, cut en ocako worogi, kun tyero gitum botgi. <verse eid="2CH 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 25:15" />Pimeno kiniga omako Rwot ikom Amajia ci ocwalo lanebi mo bote, ma owace ni, “Pingo icako lubu kor lubangagu me rok mukene, ma pe gutwero laro lwakgi kikome ki i cingini?” <verse eid="2CH 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 25:16" />Ka lanebi ni pud tye kalok kwede rwot openye ni, “Wan waketo in me bedo lami tam pa rwot bo? Tugi ling! Pingo imito ni kineki woko?” Lanebi ocako ling, ento owaco ni, “Angeyo ni Lubanga otyeko yubu me neki woko, pien in itiyo lok man ma pe iwinyo wa tama ma amiyo ki in ni.”<verse eid="2CH 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lweny ikom Icrael</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 14:8-20">2 Luk 14:8-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 25:17" />Amajia rwot me Juda dok openyo tam ki bot jo mukene ci ocwalo lukwena bot Yoaci wod pa Yekoakaj, wod pa Yeko, rwot me Icrael, kun wace ni, “Bin wacam co wanene wang ki wang.” <verse eid="2CH 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 25:18" />Yoaci rwot me Icrael odwoko lok bot Amajia rwot me Juda kun waco ni, “Yam okutu mo ma iwi Lebanon ocwalo kwena bot yat cedar me Lebanon, kun waco ni, ‘Miya nyari wek anyom ki woda.’ Ci lee tim mo me Lebanon ma owok ki kunu onyono okutu woko piny. <verse eid="2CH 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 25:19" />In iwaco ni, ‘Dong atyeko neko Edom woko,’ ci cwinyi otingi malo ki wake madwong. Bedo ki deyo meno romi, ci ibed kwede i paconi; pingo irobo dog dano me kelo ayela ikomi, miyo i poto woko i peko in kacel ki lujudaya pi atwom ma iyenyo ikomi kekeni giri.”<verse eid="2CH 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 25:20" />Ento Amajia pe owinyo lok meno; pien onongo Lubanga oyubu ni wek emigi i cing lumerokgi, pien guloke bot lwak lubangagu pa jo Edom. <verse eid="2CH 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 25:21" />Yoaci rwot me Icrael ocito; ci en ki Amajia rwot me Juda gucamo co ci gurwate i lweny ma i Bet-cemec, ma i gang ma i Juda. <verse eid="2CH 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 25:22" />Icrael ocako loyo Juda, ci dano acel acel oringo odok woko i pacone. <verse eid="2CH 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 25:23" />Yoaci rwot me Icrael omako Amajia rwot me Juda wod pa Yekoac, ma wod pa Akajia, ki i Bet-cemec, ka otere wa i Jerucalem, ci omuku cel me Jerucalem maromo yadi miya aryo kulu, nia ki i dogcel ma kilwongo ni pa Epraim nio kwede wa i dogcel ma i twok taun madit. <verse eid="2CH 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 25:24" />En oyako jabu ki ryal ducu ki atabogu ducu ma onongo tye i Ot pa Lubanga, kacel ki jami ducu ma Obed-edom gwoko me tic i Ot pa Rwot; ka dok bene oyako lim ki i ot kano lim pa rwot, kacel ki lwak dano ma en omakogi me akoka, ci odok kwedgi wa i Camaria.<verse eid="2CH 25:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 25:25" />Amajia wod pa Yoaci rwot me Juda kong dok obedo kwo ki inge to pa Yoaci wod pa Yekoakaj, rwot me Icrael pi mwaka apar wiye abic. <verse eid="2CH 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 25:26" />Lok kom Amajia mudonge ducu, nia i acakine nio i agikine, kityeko coyone i <char style="bk">Buk pa Luker me Juda ki Icrael. </char> <verse eid="2CH 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 25:27" />Cake ikare ma en obwoto Rwot woko, jo mogo gucako piro lok ikome ki i Jerucalem, ci en olwi oringo woko i Lakic. Ento gucwalo dano i kore wa i Lakic ci guneke woko ki kunu. <verse eid="2CH 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 25:28" />Ci gukelo kome ki aguragura, ci ki yiko kacel ki kwarine i gangkal pa Daudi.<verse eid="2CH 25:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="2CH 26" />
  <para style="s1">Rwot Ujia me Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 14:21-22">2 Luk 14:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 15:1-7">15:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 26:1" />Lwak me Juda ducu guyero Ujia, ma mwaka me dite onongo romo apar wiye abicel, ci guketo en me bedo rwot wek ole katyen wone Amajia. <verse eid="2CH 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 26:2" />En aye yam omayo Elot ka dok ogero ci odwoko cen bot jo Juda, ki inge to pa wone rwot Amajia ma dong oywe kacel ki kwarine. <verse eid="2CH 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 26:3" />Ujia ocamo ker ma mwaka me dite onongo tye apar wiye abicel, ci obedo kaloc i Jerucalem pi mwaka pyere abic wiye aryo. Nying mine Yekolia me Jerucalem. <verse eid="2CH 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 26:4" />Obedo katiyo gin manen atir iwang Rwot Lubanga, kun lubu gin ducu mayam wone Amajia otiyo. <verse eid="2CH 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 26:5" />Ikare pa ajwaka madit Jekaria en oketo cwinye me yenyo wang Rwot Lubanga kun tiyo bote, pien Jekaria opwonye kit me lworo Lubanga. Pi kare ducu ma en obedo kaketo cwinye ikom Rwot, Lubanga omiye gum.<verse eid="2CH 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 26:6" />En ocito kalweny ki jo Piliciti, ci oturu cel me Gat woko, ki cel me Jabne ki me Acidod; ka inge meno en ogero taun madito mukene i lobo ma inget Acidod, ki i kabedo mukene matye ikin jo Piliciti. <verse eid="2CH 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 26:7" />Lubanga obedo kakonye ikare me lweny ikom jo Piliciti, ki ikom jo Arab ma gibedo i Gur-baal, ki ikom jo Meun. <verse eid="2CH 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 26:8" />Jo Ammon gubedo kaculu mucoro bot Ujia; ci nyinge oywek o wa iwang lobo Ejipt, pien en onongo dong odoko tek mada. <verse eid="2CH 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 26:9" />Ujia dok ogero odi ma tego kun yubu lubele bene ma ocudu iye malo likung i Jerucalem. Oketo lubele ma ogero acel i dogcel ma itwok gang, acel i dogcel ma cito inota ki acel itwoke mukene; ma kigerogi matek tutwal. <verse eid="2CH 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 26:10" />Ka dok ogero odi matego ma ocudu malo i tim, dok okwinyo lwak wang pii mapol, pien onongo tye ki lee makwo madwong; obedo ki lee makwo wa i Cepela ki i bar bene, dok obedo ki lupur wa jo mapuru olok i lobo godi ki i lobo ducu ma ceko cam, pien en onongo yam maro pur.<verse eid="2CH 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 26:11" />Ujia obedo ki dul monye acikari matye atera ma giromo woto ilweny, i lwak buca mapatpat, kit macalo Jeyel ma karane oryeyo kwede welgi gin ki ladit monye Maaceya, ite loc pa Anania, ma en ngat acel ikin ludito ma giloyo mony pa rwot. <verse eid="2CH 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 26:12" />Wel twoni oteka lweny ducu ma gin ludito kaka i odi pa kwarigi yam onongo romo alip aryo ki miya abicel. <verse eid="2CH 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 26:13" />I te loc pa ludito mony magi onongo tye iye mony maromo jo alip miya adek ki abiro, ki miya abic ma gitwero lweny, ma komgi bene tek kalweny pi konyo rwot ki lweny ikom lumeroke. <verse eid="2CH 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 26:14" />Ujia oyubu lwak kwot mapol pi lumony ducu, ki tongi, ki otangwic, ki koti nyonyo, ki lwak atum, ki lalingling me latangdingo. <verse eid="2CH 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 26:15" />Dok oketo bao me lacel atero i Jerucalem ma luryekone guroto, wek kiketgi iwi odi matego ma ocudu malo itwok cel kama lubele kiyubu iye ducu, pi celo atero ki pi bayo lakidi ma ditogu. Nyinge oywek oromo i lobo ducu, pien Lubanga obedo kakonye i yo me aura, nio ka en odoko tek.<verse eid="2CH 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 26:16" />Ento kadi bed en obedo dano matek, en dok oloke obedo lawake, ci man okelo can ikome kene. Pien en ocayo dog Rwot Lubangane; ci en oete odonyo i Ot pa Rwot kawango odok eceta i keno tyer me wango odok eceta. <verse eid="2CH 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 26:17" />Ento ajwaka Ajaria olubu kore cut kun odonyo bote, kacel ki ajwaki pyere aboro ma gin twoni matego ki gin bene pe gin lulworo. <verse eid="2CH 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 26:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:7-8">Nia 30:7-8</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 3:10">Wel 3:10</ref></char></note>Ci gucung gupyem ki rwot Ujia kun giwaco bote ni, “Man pe tici, me wango odok eceta bot Rwot, man tic pa ajwaki ma gin likwayo pa Aron, mayam kikwerogi me wango odok eceta. A i kat woko ki i Kabedo Maleng; pien ityeko timo bal, pe dok ibinongo iye deyo mo ma a ki bot Rwot Lubanga.” <verse eid="2CH 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 26:19" />Cutcut kiniga omako Ujia woko matek ikom ajwaki, ma onongo en pud tye ki atabo weer me wango odok eceta i cinge. Ci dobo opoto ikome cut ma ajwaki bene gineno ma onongo pud gitye i Ot pa Rwot, i kanget keno tyer me odok eceta. <verse eid="2CH 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 26:20" />Ajaria ajwaka madit, ki ajwaki ducu ka guneno en, ci gunongo ni dobo tye i tur nyime! Ci guruyu cwale woko cen oyotoyot, en bene orune me cito woko, pien Rwot otyeko pwode. <verse eid="2CH 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 26:21" />Rwot Ujia obedo ladobo nio wa inino me tone; pi bedo ladobo omiyo kipoke obedo i ot kakene, pien pe kiye ni en odony i Ot pa Rwot. Yocam ma wode aye obedo ladit maloyo jo me ot pa rwot, kun loyo kwede bene lwak me lobo meno.<verse eid="2CH 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 26:22" />Lok kom Ujia mudonge ducu, nia i acakine nio i agikine, lanebi Icaya ma wod pa Amoj aye ocoyo. <verse eid="2CH 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 26:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:1">Ica 6:1</ref></char></note>Ujia oto, ci en oywe kacel ki kwarine, ci kiyike kacel ki kwarine i kabedogi me yik kama yam kiyiko iye luker, kun guwaco ni, “En ladobo.” Wode Yocam aye oleyo katyene.<verse eid="2CH 26:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="2CH 27" />
  <para style="s1">Rwot Yocam me Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 15:32-38">2 Luk 15:32-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 27:1" />Yocam ocamo ker ma mwaka me dite pyere aryo wiye abic, ci obedo kaloc i Jerucalem pi mwaka apar wiye abicel. Nying mine Yeruca ma nya pa Jadok. <verse eid="2CH 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 27:2" />En obedo katiyo gin manen atir iwang Rwot, kun lubu gin ducu mayam wone Ujia otiyo, ento pe opoto i bal calo en pien pe omedo ki donyo i Ot pa Rwot kawango odok eceta. Ento lwak onongo pud gumede ki timgi maracu. <verse eid="2CH 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 27:3" />En ogero dogola mamalo me Ot pa Rwot, ka dok obedo kagedo ikom cel me Opel matek tutwal. <verse eid="2CH 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 27:4" />Omede ki gero taun madito i lobo gotgot matye i Juda, ki cel gogogu ki odi matego ma ocudu malo iwi cere ma yadi dwong iye. <verse eid="2CH 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 27:5" />En olwenyo ikom rwot pa jo Ammon ci oloyogi. Jo Ammon gumiye ryal maromo talanta miya acel i mwaka meno, ki ngano guniya alip apar, ki cayiri guniya alip apar. Jo Ammon gubedo kaculu bote wel marom i mwaka me aryo ki me adeke. <verse eid="2CH 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 27:6" />Ci Yocam omede odoko tek pien obedo kalubu yo ma atir inyim Rwot Lubangane. <verse eid="2CH 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 27:7" />Lok kom Yocam mudonge ducu, ki mony ducu ma en olwenyo, ki kite ducu, nen kityeko coyone i <char style="bk">Buk pa Luker me Icrael ki me Juda.</char> <verse eid="2CH 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 27:8" />En ocamo ker ma mwaka me dite tye pyere aryo wiye abic, ci obedo kaloc i Jerucalem pi mwaka apar wiye abicel. <verse eid="2CH 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 27:9" />Yocam oto, en oywe kacel ki kwarine, ci kiyike i gangkal pa Daudi. Wode Akaj aye oleyo katyene.<verse eid="2CH 27:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="2CH 28" />
  <para style="s1">Rwot Akaj me Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 16:1-4">2 Luk 16:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 28:1" />Akaj ocamo ker ma mwaka me dite tye pyere aryo, ci obedo kaloc i Jerucalem pi mwaka apar wiye abicel. Pe obedo katiyo gin manen atir iwang Rwot Lubangane, kit ma kwarone Daudi yam otiyoni, <verse eid="2CH 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 28:2" />ento obedo kalubu kit pa luker me Icrael. En otiyo cal aliya pi jok Baal. <verse eid="2CH 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 28:3" />Obedo kawango odok eceta i nota pa wod pa Kinom, ki bene owango wode me gityer, kun en lubu kwede kit tim me kwer pa rok ducu ma Rwot yam oryemogi woko ki inyim jo Icrael. <verse eid="2CH 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 28:4" />Akaj obedo katyero gitum ki wango odok eceta iwang jogi ma iwi godi mabocone ducu ki iwi cere ki iwang ayweya ma ite yadi ma potgi oluk.<verse eid="2CH 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lweny ikom Ciria ki Icrael</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 16:5">2 Luk 16:5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 28:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 7:1">Ica 7:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pieno Rwot Lubangane omiyo en woko i cing rwot me Ciria, ma oloyo en ci oyako jo mapol ki ikin lwake oterogi woko wa i Damaciko. Dok kimiye i cing rwot me Icrael, ma oloyo en kun oneko lwak jone madwong adada. <verse eid="2CH 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 28:6" />Pien Peka wod pa Remalia obino ikomgi ci oneko jo alip miya ki pyere aryo i Juda inino acel, gin ducu gubedo twoni oita lwenye matego, pien onongo dong gutyeko bwoto Rwot Lubanga woko, ma en Lubanga pa kwarigi. <verse eid="2CH 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 28:7" />Ka Jikri twon oteka me Epraim, oneko Maaceya wod pa rwot Akaj, ki Ajrikam ma ladit maloyo i gangkal, ki Elkana ma en aye lawang rwot.<verse eid="2CH 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 28:8" />Jo Icrael guyako jo alip miya aryo ki ikin utmegigi, mon, awobe, ki anyira; dok guyako jamigi mapol ci gutero i Camaria.<verse eid="2CH 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lanebi Oded</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 28:9" />Ento lanebi pa Rwot mo onongo ceng tye kunu, ma nyinge Oded; en ocito karwate ki mony ma onongo ocito i Camaria, ci owaco botgi ni, “Nenu, nene kiniga omako Rwot Lubanga pa kwariwu ikom jo Juda ci omiyogi i cingwu, ento wun wunekogi ki akemo madwong mada ma pire owinye wa i polo. <verse eid="2CH 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 28:10" />Kombedi tamwu tye karido wi lwak ma a i Juda ki Jerucalem, co ki mon, wek gubed opiiwu. Pe wun bene ongeyo ni wutye ki bal ma wutimo inyim Rwot Lubangawu? <verse eid="2CH 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 28:11" />Dong wuwiny loka, ci wucwal jo ma wukwanyogini wek gudok cen; pien gin utmegiwu, wudwokgi kama wukwanyogi ki iyeni, pien akemo pa Rwot tye ikomwu madwong.” <verse eid="2CH 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 28:12" />Ludito mukene me Epraim, ma gin aye Ajaria wod pa Yokanan, Berekia wod pa Mecilemot, Lekijikia wod pa Calum, ki Amaca wod pa Kadlai, gucung gujuku jo ma gua i mony, <verse eid="2CH 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 28:13" />kun giwaco ni, “Pe wubikelo jo ma kiyakogi wa botwa kany, pien tamwu tye me tingo alii mukene ki bot Rwot ka dok wamedo ikom balwa ki alii ma dong watyeko tingoneni! Pe aliiwa dong tye dwong, dok bene akemo pa Rwot tye magwar ikom wa jo Icrael.” <verse eid="2CH 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 28:14" />Kitmeno jo ma gin lumonyi guweko dano ki jami ducu ma guyakogi inyim lutela ki inyim lwak mucoke ducu. <verse eid="2CH 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 28:15" />Jo ma kicoyo nyinggi maloni gua gutero dano ma kiyakogini, kacel ki jami, ci guruku jo ducu ma ikin gi ma gitye nono nyo munero ki bongi ma lumony onongo guyako. Gurukugi ki bongi, ka kimiyogi war tyen wa ki cam bene ki gin amatagu, dok guwiro komgi ki moo. Ka lacen gutingo jo magoro ikin gi ki kana, guterogi wa bot lutugi jo Juda ma gibedo cok Jeriko, i taun madito me otit, ka gucako gudok cen wa i Camaria.<verse eid="2CH 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akaj olegoni Aciria okonye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 16:7-9">2 Luk 16:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 28:16" />Ikare meno rwot Akaj ocwalo kwena bot rwot me Aciria kun lego kony ki bote; <verse eid="2CH 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 28:17" />pien onongo jo Edom gumonyo jo Juda ci guloyogi bene, guyako jo mogo ki ikin gi, guterogi woko i opii. <verse eid="2CH 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 28:18" />Jo Piliciti bene gumonyo taun ma i Cepela ki Negeb me Juda, Bet-cemec, Aijalon, Gederot, Coko ki taun madito ki matino ma ingete ducu, Timna ki gangi matino ma ingete ducu, Gimjo ki gangi matino ma ingete ducu; ci gubedo iye. <verse eid="2CH 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 28:19" />Ci Rwot oketo pwod ikom Juda pi rwot Akaj me Juda, pien en obedo katimo tim mogo me kwer i Juda, pien obedo kacayo dog Rwot Lubangane. <verse eid="2CH 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 28:20" />Pimeno omiyo Tiglat-pilecer rwot me Aciria ma ka konyo en obino kalweny ikome, ci otime malit ma omiye tek bedo. <verse eid="2CH 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 28:21" />Ci Akaj okwanyo jami ma i Ot pa Rwot Lubangane ki ma i ode ki ma i ot pa lutelane, ci oculu ki mucoro bot rwot me Aciria; ento en pe omedo ki nongo iye kit kony mo wa acel.<verse eid="2CH 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bal pa Akaj</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 28:22" />Ikare ma dong can odiye adada rwot Akaj aceli omede ameda ki cayo dog Rwot Lubangane. <verse eid="2CH 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 28:23" />En otyero gitum bot lwak lubangagu pa jo Damaciko ma onongo guloye, kun waco ni, “Pien lwak lubangagu pa luker me Ciria okonyogi, an abityero gitum botgi wek gukonya bene.” Ento man okelo can madit ikome ki ikom jo Juda ducu. <verse eid="2CH 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 28:24" />Ci Akaj ocoko jami ducu ma kitiyo kwede i Ot pa Rwot Lubanga ocako ngido woko matinotino gin jami magi ma onongo kitiyo kwedgi i Ot pa Lubanga, ka dok oloro dogola me Ot pa Rwot woko; cut otiyo keno tyer mapol pire kene ma oromo i Jerucalem woko ducu. <verse eid="2CH 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 28:25" />I taun madito acel acel ducu ma i Juda en oketo iye wang jogi kama kiwango iye odok eceta bot lwak lubanga mukenegu, ma omiyo kiniga omako Rwot Lubanga pa kwarine. <verse eid="2CH 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 28:26" />Lok kom Akaj mudonge ducu, ki kite ducu, nia i acakine nio i agikine, gityeko coyone i <char style="bk">Buk pa Luker me Juda ki me Icrael.</char> <verse eid="2CH 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 28:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:28">Ica 14:28</ref></char></note>Akaj oto, ci en oywe kacel ki kwarine, ci kiyiko en i gange ma i Jerucalem, pien pe gutere kayiko i lyel pa luker me Juda. Ci wode Kejekia aye oleyo katyene.<verse eid="2CH 28:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="2CH 29" />
  <para style="s1">Rwot Kejekia me Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 18:1-3">2 Luk 18:1-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 29:1" />Kejekia ocamo ker ma mwaka me dite tye pyere aryo wiye abic, ci obedo kaloc i Jerucalem pi mwaka pyere aryo wiye abongwen. Nying mine Abija ma nya pa Jekaria. <verse eid="2CH 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 29:2" />Kejekia obedo katiyo gin manen atir iwang Rwot Lubangane, kun lubu gin ducu mayam kwarone Daudi otiyo.<verse eid="2CH 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kilonyo Ot pa Rwot Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 29:3" />I mwaka mukwongo me loce, i dwe me acele, en aye en oyabo iye dogola me Ot pa Rwot, ka dok oyubugi. <verse eid="2CH 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 29:4" />En okelo ajwaki ki Lulevi, omiyo gucoke kacel idyekal tung kunyango, <verse eid="2CH 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 29:5" />ka ocako waco botgi ni, “Wuwiny loka, wun Lulevi! Kombedi wulonye kenwu, dok wulony Ot pa Rwot Lubanga pa kwariwu, obed maleng, wukwany cilo woko ki i Kabedo man Malengi. <verse eid="2CH 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 29:6" />Kwariwa gucayo dog Rwot Lubangawa woko. Gubedo katimo gin manen marac iwang Rwot Lubangawa: dok gutyeko bwoto en woko, kun guloko wanggi kamukene ma cwinygi pe ikom Rwot Lubanga. <verse eid="2CH 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 29:7" />Gin bene gucego dogola me kicika ma kidonyo kwede i Ot pa Rwot, ka bene guneko wa mac tara woko ki ote, pe bene guwango odok eceta nyo kadi ki tyero gitum awanga mo i Kabedo Maleng bot Lubanga pa Icrael. <verse eid="2CH 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 29:8" />Pimeno omiyo akemo omako Rwot ikom Juda ki Jerucalem, ci otiyo ikin gi gin ma omiyo gudoko jo makelo lworo, ur ki jwat matek bot dano, macalo wun wutye ka nenone ki wangwuni. <verse eid="2CH 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 29:9" />Nen ba, kwariwa ki nekogi woko liweng ki pala lucwan dok awobewa, anyirawa ki monwa ducu kiterogi i opii pi lok man. <verse eid="2CH 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 29:10" />Amoko tama gira kombedi me keto gicike ikin wan ki Rwot, Lubanga pa Icrael, wek kinigane magwari otugi oa woko ki ikomwa. <verse eid="2CH 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 29:11" />Wun Lulevi pe wubed ata, lutinona, Rwot otyeko yerowu me cung inyime, wek wutii bote kun wutelo wi lwake i woro en, ki me bedo jo ma mere ma oyero pi wango odoko eceta bote.”<verse eid="2CH 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 29:12" />Cutcut Lulevi magi gua, gin aye Makat wod pa Amacai, ki Joel wod pa Ajaria, ma gin likwayo pa Kokat; ki likwayo pa Merari, ma gin aye Kic wod pa Abdi, ki Ajaria wod pa Jekalelel; ki likwayo pa Gercon, ma gin aye Joa wod pa Jimma, ki Eden wod pa Joa; <verse eid="2CH 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 29:13" />ki ikom likwayo pa Elijapan ma gin aye Cimri ki Jeuel; ki likwayo pa Acap, ma gin aye Jekaria ki Matania; <verse eid="2CH 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 29:14" />ki likwayo pa Keman, ma gin aye Jekuel ki Cimel; ki likwayo pa Jedutun, gin aye Cemaya ki Ujiel. <verse eid="2CH 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 29:15" />Gucoko utmegigi kacel ci gulonye ken gi, ka dong gucako donyo i Ot kit macalo onongo rwot ociko malube ki lok pa Rwot, wek gulony Ot pa Rwot. <verse eid="2CH 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 29:16" />Ajwaki gudonyo gucito wa i kicika ma i tyelo ma i Ot pa Rwot kalonyone, ci gukati woko ki jami maracu me kwer ma gunongo i Ot pa Rwot, gukelo guketo idyekal ma i Ot pa Rwot; ka dong Lulevi gutingo gutero guonyo woko wa i laora nota kulu Kidron. <verse eid="2CH 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 29:17" />Gucako lonyo Ot inino dwe acel me dwe me acel, ka dok inino dwe aboro me dwe me acel gubino i kicika ma kidonyo kwede i Ot pa Rwot, ka lacen gubedo ka lonyo Ot pa Rwot pi nino aboro, ci gutyeko ticgi inino dwe apar wiye abicel me dwe meno.<verse eid="2CH 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kidyero Ot pa Lubanga odoco</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 29:18" />Lacen gucito gudonyo bot Kejekia ci guwace ni, “Dong watyeko lonyo Ot pa Rwot Lubanga woko ducu, keno tyer me gitum awanga ki jami me tic ducu, ki meja ma kiketo iye mugati ma kiketo inyim Rwot, wa jami tic ducu. <verse eid="2CH 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 29:19" />Dok jami tic ducu mayam rwot Akaj obolo woko ikare me loce ma onongo pe ogwoko Cik pa Rwot, wayubugi dok walonyogi bene; nen, gitye inyim keno tyer pa Rwot i kabedone kikome.”<verse eid="2CH 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 29:20" />Lacen rwot Kejekia orune me cito kun ocoko ludito ma giloyo taun madito owoto kacel kwedgi, ci gucito wa i Ot pa Rwot. <verse eid="2CH 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 29:21" />Ka dong gucako kelo twoni abiro, nyogi romi abiro, ki lutino romi abiro ki nyogi dyegi abiro pi gitum me bal pi ot pa luker ki jo Juda ki Jerucalem ducu, ki pi kabedo maleng. Ci ociko ajwaki ma gin likwayo pa Aron me tyerogi iwi keno tyer pa Rwot. <verse eid="2CH 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 29:22" />Kitmeno gucako neko twoni, ci ajwaki gukwanyo remogi gucoro ikom keno tyer. Ka dok guneko nyogi romi ci remogi bene gucoro ikom keno tyer; ingeye guneko lutino romi ci remone gucoro ikom keno tye bene. <verse eid="2CH 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 29:23" />Lacen kikelo nyogi dyegi bot rwot ki jo ma gucoke ducu, pi miyo gitum pi bal, ci guketo cinggi ikomgi; <verse eid="2CH 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 29:24" />ci ajwaki guneko nyogi dyegi ka gutyero gitum pi bal ki remogi iwi keno tyer, me lakwany bal ki ikom jo Icrael ducu. Rwot Kejekia onongo ociko ni omyero gityer gitum awanga ki gitum pi bal pi jo Icrael ducu.<verse eid="2CH 29:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 29:25" />Kejekia omiyo Lulevi gucung i Ot pa Rwot kun gumako atego agoyagu, ki nangagu, ki opukgu, kun lubu cik ma Daudi ceng omiyogi, ki en bene otiyo gin ma Rwot oloko ki Gad ma lanen piny ki lanebi Natan ma gutiyo macalo lunebine. <verse eid="2CH 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 29:26" />Lulevi gucung gumako jami wer pa Daudi, kun ajwaki gumako tumgi. <verse eid="2CH 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 29:27" />Cutcut Kejekia ociko ni myero gityer gitum awanga iwi keno tyer. Ikare ma kicako tyero gitum awanga, kicako wer me pako Rwot Lubanga cut, kun kikutu ki tumgu, ma kigoyo bene jami me wer bot Lubanga pa Icrael. <verse eid="2CH 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 29:28" />Lwak ma gucoke ducu gumiyo woro bot Lubanga, luwer guwero wer, ki lukut tum gukutu tumgi; gumede kwede nio ka gutyero gitum awanga otum. <verse eid="2CH 29:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 29:29" />Ka dong tyero gitum otum, ci rwot kacel ki jo ma onongo gitye kwede ducu guryebe piny gumiyo woro bot Lubanga. <verse eid="2CH 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 29:30" />Rwot Kejekia ki lutelane gucako ciko Lulevi me wero wer me pak bot Rwot kun gilubu lok pa Daudi ki pa Acap ma lanen piny. Ci guwero wer pak ki yomcwiny, ka dok guryebe piny gumiyo woro bot Rwot.<verse eid="2CH 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 29:31" />Kejekia dok owaco ni, “Dong wutyeko kwere kenwu bot Rwot; wunyik cok, wukel gitum ki gityer me pwoc i Ot pa Rwot Lubanga.” Ci jo ma gucoke ducu gukelo gitum mapol ki gityer me pwoc; ki jo ducu ma cwinygi opwoyo gukelo gitum awanga. <verse eid="2CH 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 29:32" />Wel jami me gitum awanga ma lwak ma gucoke gukelo onongo tye twoni pyere abiro, nyogi romi miya acel, ki lutino romi miya aryo; magi ducu ki kelogi me gitum awanga bot Rwot Lubanga. <verse eid="2CH 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 29:33" />Dong gityer ma kikwero onongo obedo twoni miya abicel ki romi alip adek. <verse eid="2CH 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 29:34" />Ento ajwaki onongo ginok tutwal ma pe gitwero yango gitum awanga magi ducu, omiyo utmegigi ma Lulevi gucako konyogi nio ka ajwaki mukene ducu gulonye ken gi ka dong gutyeko tic ducu pien Lulevi onongo cwinygi leng makato ajwaki i lonye ken gi. <verse eid="2CH 29:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2CH 29:35" />Medo ikom wel gitum awanga madit tutwali, moo dwolo bene onongo tye me gityer lakwecwiny, ki dok gubedo kaliyo kongo bwino pi gitum awanga. Gidwoko kit me tic i Ot pa Rwot kitmeno. <verse eid="2CH 29:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2CH 29:36" />Omiyo Kejekia kacel ki lwak gubedo ki yomcwiny pi gin ma Lubanga otyeko tiyo pi lwak; pien loke obino atura.<verse eid="2CH 29:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="2CH 30" />
  <para style="s1">Kwero Karama me Kato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 30:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 9:9-11">Wel 9:9-11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kejekia ocwalo kwena bot jo Icrael ducu ki jo Juda, ka dok ocoyo waraga ocwalo bot jo Epraim ki Manace, me tito botgi ni omyero gubin i Ot pa Rwot Lubanga matye i Jerucalem, kakwero Karama me Kato bot Lubanga pa Icrael. <verse eid="2CH 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 30:2" />Onongo rwot ki lutelane kacel ki jo ducu ma gubedo i coke ma i Jerucalem gutyeko moko tam me kwero Karama me Kato i dwe me aryone; <verse eid="2CH 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 30:3" />pien pe onongo gitwero kwero nino man i karene kikome pien ajwaki mapol onongo pud peya gulonye keken gi, ki lwak bene pud peya gucoke i Jerucalem. <verse eid="2CH 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 30:4" />Yub meno onen atir dok mwonya tutwal iwang rwot kacel ki lwake ducu ma gubedo i cokeni. <verse eid="2CH 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 30:5" />Ci kiciko pi yweko lok man wek orom i lobo Icrael ducu cake ki i Beer-ceba nio kwede i Dan, kun kitito ni lwak omyero gubin kakwero Karama me Kato bot Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael, i Jerucalem; pien lwak mapol onongo pe gubedo kakwero nino man kit macalo giciko kwede. <verse eid="2CH 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 30:6" />Kitmeno lukwena gutero waraga pa rwot ki lutelane guwoto i lobo Icrael ki Juda ducu macalo rwot ociko, kun giwaco ni, “Wun lwak me Icrael, wudwog cen bot Rwot, Lubanga pa Abraim, pa Icaka ki pa Icrael, wek en odwog bot jo mudong ikinwu ma gubwot ki i cing luker me Aciria. <verse eid="2CH 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 30:7" />Pe wubed macalo kwariwu ki utmegiwu, ma gutime ni gin dong gicayo lok pa Rwot Lubanga pa kwarigini, pimeno Lubanga omiyo lobogi odoko obur kit macalo wutye kanenone. <verse eid="2CH 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 30:8" />Pe wubed ma ngutwu nwang kombedi macalo yam kwariwu gubedo kwede inyim Lubanga, ento wun wumii kwowu bot Rwot, wubin i Kabedo man Maleng ma en otyeko lonyo matwal, kun wutiyo bot Rwot Lubangawu, wek kinigane mageri oa woko ki ikomwu. <verse eid="2CH 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 30:9" />Kace wuloke wudwogo cen bot Rwot, ci kica bimako jo ma guyako utmegiwu ki lutinowu, ci gibiye gibidwogo i lobo man. Myero wunge ni Rwot Lubangawa en ber dok lakica, ma pe biloko wange ki ikomwu, ka wuloke wudwogo cen bote.”<verse eid="2CH 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 30:10" />Kitmeno lukwena gucako wot i taun madito ducu ma i lobo Epraim ki Manace, dok gumede ki wotgi nio wa i lobo Jebulun, ento dano gubedo kanyerogi kun ki cayogi dok kingalogi. <verse eid="2CH 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 30:11" />Jo manok keken ma i lobo pa Acer, pa Manace ki Jebulun aye gumwole ken gi gubino i Jerucalem. <verse eid="2CH 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 30:12" />Lubanga oketo cinge ikom jo Juda omiyo gubedo ki cwiny acel ikare man kun gitiyo gin ma rwot ki lutelane onongo guciko pire ma gulubu lok pa Rwot.<verse eid="2CH 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kikwero Karama me Kato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 30:13" />Ci lwak jo mapol gucoke kacel gubino i Jerucalem i coke man madit tutwal kakwero Karama me Mugati ma Tobi Pe Iye i dwe me aryo. <verse eid="2CH 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 30:14" />Ka gucako ticgi ci gumuku keno tyer ducu mayam tye i Jerucalem, ka dok gumuku bene keno tyer ducu kama ceng kiwango iye odok eceta bot jok baalgu gutero gubolo woko i laora kulu Kidron. <verse eid="2CH 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 30:15" />Ci guneko lutino romo me Karama me Kato inino dwe apar wiye angwen me dwe me aryo. Man omiyo lewic omako ajwaki ki Lulevi mogo ma onongo pud pe gulonye, oweko gucako lonye ken gi, ka dong gukelo gitum awanga i Ot pa Rwot Lubanga. <verse eid="2CH 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 30:16" />Ci gucako mako dog ticgi kit me kare ducu kun gilubu Cik pa Moses ma en dano pa Lubanga. Ajwaki ticgi obedo me coro remo ma kigamo ki i cing Lulevi. <verse eid="2CH 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 30:17" />Onongo tye jo mapol i coke man ma pe gulonye ken gi; pi lok meno omiyo Lulevi guneko latin romo me Karama me Kato pi ngat acel acel ma pe olonye, wek obed leng pi Rwot. <verse eid="2CH 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 30:18" />Jo mapol ikin lwak onongo gua ki i lobo Epraim, Manace, Icakar ki Jebulun, ma pud peya gulonye ken gi, ento gubedo kacamo karama me Kato i yo ma pe opore ki kit ma kiciko con. Kadi bed kumeno, rwot Kejekia olego pirgi, kun waco ni, “In Rwot Lubanga maber tim kica ki dano acel acel <verse eid="2CH 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 30:19" />ma oketo cwinye kabino boti Lubanga, Rwot Lubanga pa kwarine, kadi bed pe ogwoko cik me Kabedo Maleng ma mako lok kom lonye.” <verse eid="2CH 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 30:20" />Rwot Lubanga owinyo dog Kejekia, ci otimogi kica ci pe otiyo gin mo marac ikom lwak. <verse eid="2CH 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 30:21" />Ci jo Icrael ducu ma onongo gitye i Jerucalem ikare meno gucako kwero Karama me Mugati ma Tobi Pe iye ki yomcwiny madwong pi nino abiro; kun Lulevi ki ajwaki gubedo ka pako Rwot nino ki nino, ma giwero wer bot Rwot ki kerogi ducu. <verse eid="2CH 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 30:22" />Kejekia oloko lok me pwoc bot Lulevi ducu ma gunyutu diro mabeco i ticgi kun gitelo woro i lega bot Rwot.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="2CH 30:22">Karama me Aryo</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 30:22">Kitmeno lwak gubedo kacamo cam me kwero nino madito pi nino abiro, kun gityero gityer lakwe cwinygu, ma gimiyo pwoc bot Rwot Lubanga pa kwarigi ki woro.<verse eid="2CH 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 30:23" />Lacen lwak ducu ma gucoke guye lawangacel me mede ki kwero nino madito pi nino abiro mukene; ci gumede kwede kitmeno ki yomcwiny madwong pi nino abiro mukene. <verse eid="2CH 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 30:24" />Onongo Kejekia rwot me Juda omiyo twoni alip acel ki romi alip abiro bot lwak ma gucoke pi gityer. Ka dok lutelane bene gumiyo twoni alip acel ki romi alip apar bot lwak ma gucoke. Omiyo ajwaki mapol gulonye ken gi. <verse eid="2CH 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 30:25" />Lwak jo Juda ducu ma i coke, kacel ki ajwaki ki Lulevi, medo ki jo ma i coke ma gua ki i lobo Icrael, kadi wa lubedo ma gua ki i lobo Icrael, kacel ki jo ma gin lubedo ma gibedo i Juda, ducu gubedo ki yomcwiny madit. <verse eid="2CH 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 30:26" />Kitmeno lwak gubedo ki yomcwiny madit i Jerucalem, pien nia wa ikare pa Solomon ma wod pa Daudi rwot me Icrael onongo gin macalo man kulu peya onen i Jerucalem. <verse eid="2CH 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 30:27" />Lacen ajwaki ki Lulevi gua malo gucung ci gumiyo gum ki lwak, ci Lubanga owinyo dwon gi, dok legagi bene oo bote i kabedone maleng matye i polo.<verse eid="2CH 30:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="2CH 31" />
  <para style="s">Kejekia okelo alokaloka ikit me Dini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 31:1" />Ka man otum, jo Icrael ducu ma dong onongo gitye gucito i taun madito ducu ma i Juda gucako ngido wir jogi woko i dul matinotino, ci gutongo yen ducu mayam kicomo pi woro jok ma dako ma kilwongo Acera, ki wang jogi ma iwi godi kacel ki keno tyer ducu ma gunongo i Juda, Benjamin, Epraim ki Manace, nio ka gubologi woko ducu. Lacen lwak jo Icrael ducu gucako dok i gangigi, kun dano acel acel odok i pacone kikome.<verse eid="2CH 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pok pa Kejekia bot ajwaki ki Lulevi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 31:2" />Kejekia oketo ajwaki ki Lulevi i dul ticgi, en oketogi i dul ki dul, kun keto ngat acel acel macalo tice tye, ma gin ajwaki ki Lulevi bedo i ticgi me tyero gitum awanga ki gityer lakwecwiny, kun gitiyo bene i dog gang mapatpat me Ot pa Rwot Lubanga pi miyo pwoc ki pak. <verse eid="2CH 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 31:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 28:1-29">Wel 28:1-29</ref></char></note>Jami ma rwot okwanyo me amiya ki ikom jamine kikome obedo pi gitum awangagu: gitum awanga me odiko ki me otyeno, ki gitum awanga pi Cabit ducu, Karam me Por Dwe, ki pi nino madito ma kiciko, ma kilubu kit macalo kicoyo i Cik pa Rwot Lubanga. <verse eid="2CH 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 31:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:12-13">Wel 18:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 21">21</ref></char></note>En bene ociko lwak ducu ma gibedo i Jerucalem ni gumi dul ma guciko me amiya bot ajwaki ki Lulevi, wek gumi kwogi kare ducu me tiyo tic bot Rwot Lubanga kun gilubu Cik mere maleng. <verse eid="2CH 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 31:5" />Cutcut ma cik man dong oket oromo i lobo ducu, ci jo Icrael gucako kelo mic me jamigi mapol ata, bel me wi mwaka, kongo bwino, moo, moo kic ki kit jami mukene ducu ma guceko i potigi; kidok gukelo acel me apar me jami acel acel madwong ma okato. <verse eid="2CH 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 31:6" />Lwak jo Icrael ki jo Juda ma gibedo i taun madito me Juda bene gukelo acel me apar me dyangi ki romi, ki jami mukene ma kityeko dyerogi bot Rwot Lubangagi, ci gudurugi lipim i odur mapol. <verse eid="2CH 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 31:7" />Gucako pango jami magi i odur ki odur i dwe me adek, ci gutyeko pango ajoggi i dwe me abiro. <verse eid="2CH 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 31:8" />Ka Kejekia ki lutela gubino guneno odur me jami ma kipango, ci gupwoyo Rwot kacel ki lwak jo Icrael. <verse eid="2CH 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 31:9" />Kejekia openyo ajwaki ki Lulevi pi odur magi. <verse eid="2CH 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 31:10" />Ci Ajaria ajwaka madit, ma en dano me ot pa Jadok, odoke iye ni, “Nia ma lwak gucako kelo jami me motgi i Ot pa Rwot Lubanga pe tye gin mo ma orem; wabedo kacamo cam ma oromo dok mudonge obedo pol ata; pien Rwot omiyo gum ki jone, kitmeno aye omiyo watye ki lwak cam man ducu ma odongi.”<verse eid="2CH 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 31:11" />Kejekia dok ocikogi ni guyub kicika mogo kimedgi inget i Ot pa Rwot; ci cut kiyubu. <verse eid="2CH 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 31:12" />Lwak gukelo gityer me motgi, acel me apar ki jami ma kidyero, ducu gukelo ki cwinygi ducu. Rwot Kejekia ki Ajaria gin aye gucimo Konania ma Lalevi me bedo ladit maloyo jami ducu, ki omine Cimei obedo ngat malube wek kigwok mot ki mic magi maber, <verse eid="2CH 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 31:13" />kun bene kiketo Jekiel, Ajajia, Nakat, Acael, Jerimot, Jojabad, Eliel, Icmakia, Makat, ki Benaya me bedo lunen tic meno pi konyo kor Konania ki omine Cimei. Jo magi ducu rwot Kejekia ki Ajaria ma en ladit maloyo tic i Ot pa Lubanga en aye guyerogi. <verse eid="2CH 31:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 31:14" />Kore ma wod pa Imla ma Lalevi kiketo en lagwok dog Ot pa Lubanga matye tung kunyango; en tice obedo me loyo gityer me mic pwoc bot Lubanga, ki me poko tyer meno. <verse eid="2CH 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 31:15" />Eden, Miniamin, Yecwa, Cemaya, Amaria ki Cekania aye gubedo kakonyo en ki gen madit i gangi pa ajwaki, pi poko dul jami bot utmegigi, jo muteggi ki jo matino ducu maromrom kun lubu dul ticgi, <verse eid="2CH 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 31:16" />dok pe olubu kit ma kicoyogi i buk me tekwaro. Kipoko bot co ma ditogi me mwakagi romo pyere adek dok kwede malo, jo ducu ma gidonyo i Ot pa Rwot kit macalo tic me nino acel acel tye kwede, ma gitiyo tic malubu dog ticgi ki dul ticgi. <verse eid="2CH 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 31:17" />Kicoyo ajwaki kun lubu dog odi pa kwarigi; ento Lulevi cake ikom dano ma dite mwaka pyere aryo dok kwede malo olubu dog tic meggi ki dul ticgi. <verse eid="2CH 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 31:18" />Kicoyo ajwaki kacel ki jo ducu matye botgi, mon gi, awobegi, ki anyiragi, ki lwakgi ducu; pien onongo gubedo lugen kun gigwoke ken gi pi bedo maleng. <verse eid="2CH 31:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 31:19" />Dong pi likwayo pa Aron, ajwaki ma onongo gibedo i lobo ma orumu taun gi madito, kiyero nying co mogo ki i taun madito ducu ki acel acel bene me poko dul jami mogo bot laco acel acel ma ikin ajwaki, ki bot dano acel acel ma ikin Lulevi ma kityeko coyo en.<verse eid="2CH 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 31:20" />Kejekia otiyo tice kitmeno oromo i lobo Juda ducu; en obedo katiyo gin maber, manen atir ki ma nyutu gene inyim Rwot Lubangane. <verse eid="2CH 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 31:21" />Kit tic acel acel ma en obedo katiyone mamako tic i Ot pa Lubanga malubu cik ki gin ma kiciko ducu, otiyo ki cwinye ducu, dok obedo kayenyo Lubangane; omiyo tice owoto maber tutwal.<verse eid="2CH 31:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="2CH 32" />
  <para style="s1">Aciria ocwalo kwena me monyo Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 18:13-37">2 Luk 18:13-37</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 19:14-19">2 Luk 19:14-19</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 19:35-37">19:35-37</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 36:1-22">Ica 36:1-22</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 37:8-38">37:8-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 32:1" />I nge lok magi ki tic magi ducu me gen, ikare ma Kejekia obedo lagen kun tiyo inyim Rwot Lubanga, Cenakerib rwot me Aciria obino kalweny ikom taun madito ducu me Juda ma kirumugi ki cel gogo, kun otamo me loyogi woko wek gubed mere. <verse eid="2CH 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 32:2" />Ka Kejekia oneno ni Cenakerib otyeko bino ma mito lweny alwenya ikom Jerucalem, ci en <verse eid="2CH 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 32:3" />ocako bedo ki yub gin ki lutelane kacel ki oteka lwenye ducu me juku wang it ma inge gang; ci gin gukonye. <verse eid="2CH 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 32:4" />Ci lwak mapol gucoke, gucako juku wang it kacel ki ora kulu mayam piine mol wok ki idye lobo meno, kun giwaco ni, “Pingo waweko luker me Aciria gibino kany gilimo pii madwong?” <verse eid="2CH 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 32:5" />En ocako tic matek cut ci ogero cel matek mayam orete woko piny, ka dok oketo lubele i wiye, ki tung wokone ogero cel mukene; ci omiyo Milo ma en kabedo ma i gangkal pa Daudi ocung matek. En bene otiyo jami lweny ki kwot mapol ata. <verse eid="2CH 32:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 32:6" />Ka dok ocako keto ludito luwi mony me loyo lwak, ocokogi ducu kacel i kabedo mo malac ma inyim dog gang, ci oloko botgi lok me cuku cwiny, kun waco ni, <verse eid="2CH 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 32:7" />“Wubed tek dok jo macir. Pe wubed lwor, cwinywu bene pe myero obale inyim rwot me Aciria ki lwake ducu ma en tye kacel kwede; pien ngat madit makato en aye tye kwedwa. <verse eid="2CH 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 32:8" />En tye ki dul mony pa dano ma gigeno tekogi keken gi; ento wan watye ki Rwot Lubangawa ma konyowa dok lwenyo pirwa.” Lwak gucako bedo ki gen pi lok pa Kejekia rwot me Juda.<verse eid="2CH 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 32:9" />Lacen Cenakerib rwot me Aciria kacel ki dul monye ducu ma onongo gumonyo Lakic, ocwalo lukwenane gucito wa i Jerucalem bot Kejekia rwot me Juda ki lwake ducu me Juda ma onongo gitye i Jerucalem, kun giwaco ni, <verse eid="2CH 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 32:10" />“Cenakerib, rwot me Aciria, owaco boti kuman ni, ‘In ijengo genni ikom gin ango, ma omiyo pud icung matek i Jerucalem? <verse eid="2CH 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 32:11" />Kejekia mono pe tye kaumu wangwu wek wuto woko ki kec kacel ki orwo pii, ma nongo en tito botwu ni Rwot Lubangawa bilarowa ki i cing rwot me Aciria’? <verse eid="2CH 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 32:12" />En Kejekia aceli aye pe ojwero wang jogine ma iwi godi kacel ki keno tyere woko ducu, kun ociko jo Juda ki jo matye i Jerucalem ni, ‘Myero wubed ka woro Lubanga inyim keno tyer acel keken, dok bene wuwang gitum mewu iye’? <verse eid="2CH 32:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 32:13" />Tika wun wungeyo gin ma an kacel ki kwarina watyeko tiyone ikom lwak ducu me lobo mukene? Wuneno lwak lubanga pa rok me lobo magi gutwero laro lwak me lobo meno ki i cinga? <verse eid="2CH 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 32:14" />Tye lubanga mo acel kong ki ikin lwak lubanga mukeneni mayam kwarina gujwero woko liwengi matwero laro lwake ki i cinga, ma omiyo wutamo ni Lubangawu bene bitwero larowu ki i cinga? <verse eid="2CH 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 32:15" />Pimeno, kombedi pe wuwek Kejekia obwolwu nyo oum wangwu kit man, dok pe wuye wa loke, pien pe tye lubanga me rok mo nyo ker mo mayam olaro lwake ki i cinga nyo ki i cing kwarina. Ci Lubangawu bitwero larowu ki i cinga ningning?”<verse eid="2CH 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 32:16" />Lukwena pa Cenakerib dok gumede ki loko lok mapol ikom Rwot Lubanga ki ikom latice Kejekia. <verse eid="2CH 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 32:17" />Ci Cenakerib kikome ocoyo waraga ma nyutu cac madwong ikom Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael ki loko lok maracu ikome, kun waco ni, “Kit macalo lwak lubanga me rok mukene pe gutwero laro lwakgi ki i cingani, ci Lubanga pa Kejekia bene pe bitwero laro lwake ki i cinga.” <verse eid="2CH 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 32:18" />Gucako dange ikom jo Jerucalem ma onongo gitye iwi cel ki dwon malongo i leb pa Lujudaya, kun giburugi ma gimiyogi lworo, ka wek gima taun madito pa jo ma i Jerucalem woko. <verse eid="2CH 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 32:19" />Gubedo kaloko lok ikom Lubanga pa jo ma i Jerucalem kit macalo kong gubedo kaloko ikom lwak lubanga pa lurok me wi loboni, ma dano aye gutiyogi ki cinggi.<verse eid="2CH 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rwot olaro Kejekia ki i cing Cenakerib</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 32:20" />Lacen rwot Kejekia kacel ki lanebi Icaya, wod pa Amoj, gulego pi lok man kun gicwalo kokogi i polo. <verse eid="2CH 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 32:21" />Ci Rwot ocwalo lamalaika cut, ma otyeko twoni oteka lweny ki ludito wi mony ki ludito mukene woko ducu ki i gony pa rwot me Aciria. Kitmeno en odok i lobone ki lewic ma wange olwal woko. Ci ikare ma en obino i ot pa lubangane, lutinone ma en onywalogi gutonge ki pala lucwan guneke woko kenyo. <verse eid="2CH 32:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 32:22" />Meno en aye kit ma Rwot olaro kwede Kejekia ki jo ma gibedo i Jerucalem ki i cing Cenakerib rwot me Aciria, ka dok ki i cing lumerokgi ducu. Rwot omiyogi yweyo me kuc i kabedo ducu ma orumugi. <verse eid="2CH 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 32:23" />Jo mapol gucako kelo mot mapol bot Rwot i Jerucalem kun gikelo bene jami mabeco me wel bot Kejekia rwot me Juda; cake ikare meno ocito kwede anyim kimiye woro madit tutwal inyim rok me lobo ducu.<verse eid="2CH 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Two pa Kejekia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 20:1-3">2 Luk 20:1-3</ref>,<ref loc="2KI 20:12-19">12-19</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 38:1-3">Ica 38:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 39:1-8">39:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 32:24" />Ikare meno two omako Kejekia ma onongo cok to woko, ci olego Rwot; Rwot odoke iye kun omiye lanyut ni ebicang. <verse eid="2CH 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 32:25" />Ento Kejekia pe orwo nyo odok piny ento oile malo ki awaka madit i cwinye kun pe opwoyo Rwot pi gin maber ma otiyo bote ki pi Juda. Pimeno akemo omako Rwot ikome ci opwode kacel ki jo Juda ki jo ma i Jerucalem. <verse eid="2CH 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 32:26" />Ento ka Kejekia omwole kene ocako weko wakene ca ma i cwinye ni, en kacel ki jo ma gibedo i Jerucalem, ci omiyo akemo pa Rwot pe obino ikomgi ikare me loc pa Kejekia.<verse eid="2CH 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lonyo pa Kejekia ki deyone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 32:27" />Kejekia onongo tye ki lonyo kacel ki yweka madwong mada. En ogero ot kano lim pi keto ryal, jabu, lutino godi me wel, angwece, kwot mapol gu ki pi jami me welgu ducu. <verse eid="2CH 32:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 32:28" />Ogoyo bene dero me kano cam, kama en keto iye bel, kongo bwino, ki moo, ogoyo bene dwol pi kwayo dyangi ducu, ki dwol romi bene. <verse eid="2CH 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 32:29" />En ogero taun madito mapol pire kene, ocoko romi ki dyangi mapol ata; pien Lubanga onongo omiye jami madwong tutwal. <verse eid="2CH 32:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 32:30" />En Kejekia aceli aye oloro wang pii matye tung malo kama pii ma a i Gikon mol kato kwede woko, en dok oyubu omiyo pii omol okemo tung kupotoceng inget gangkal pa Daudi. Kejekia obedo ki gum maber kacel ki lonyo ikom tice ducu ma en otiyo. <verse eid="2CH 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 32:31" />Dong i lok ma dok ikom lukwena pa luker me Babilon, ma kicwalogi bote me penyo en pi lanyut ma onongo Lubanga otiyo i lobone, Lubanga oweke gire pire kene, pi temo en ki pi ngeyo lok ducu matye i cwinye.<verse eid="2CH 32:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Agiki me loc pa Kejekia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 20:20-21">2 Luk 20:20-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 32:32" />Lok kom Kejekia mudonge ducu, ki tic mabeco ma en otiyo, nen, kityeko coyone i <char style="bk">Lok Kom Ginanyuta ma Lanebi Icaya wod pa Amoj Oneno, </char> ki i <char style="bk">Buk pa Luker me Juda ki Icrael. </char> <verse eid="2CH 32:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 32:33" />Kejekia oto, en oywe kacel ki kwarine ci kiyike i lyel mamalo ma ikin lyel pa likwayo pa Daudi. Jo Juda ki jo ma gibedo i Jerucalem ducu gumiye deyo ikare me tone. Ci wode Manace aye oleyo katyene.<verse eid="2CH 32:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="2CH 33" />
  <para style="s1">Rwot Manace me Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 21:1-9">2 Luk 21:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 33:1" />Manace ocamo ker ma mwaka me dite onongo oromo apar wiye aryo, ci obedo kaloc i Jerucalem pi mwaka pyere abic wiye abic. <verse eid="2CH 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 33:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 15:4">Jer 15:4</ref></char></note>Manace obedo katiyo gin manen marac iwang Rwot Lubanga, kun lubu kwede kit tim me kwer pa rok ducu mayam Rwot oryemogi woko ki inyim jo Icrael. <verse eid="2CH 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 33:3" />En dok oroco wang jogi ma iwi godi, ka dok ogero odoco kama yam wone Kejekia ojwerogi wokoni. En ocano keno tyer pi lwak Baalgu, ka dok ocomo yen pi woro Acera ma jok ma dakoni, ci ocako woro kwai jami mapol ma i polo ducu, kun tiyo botgi. <verse eid="2CH 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 33:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 6:6">2 Tek 6:6</ref></char></note>Dok ocano keno tyer pa jogigu wa i Ot pa Rwot Lubanga, kama yam Rwot owaco ni, “Abiketo nyinga bedo i Jerucalem matwal wek kiwora.” <verse eid="2CH 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 33:5" />Ka dok ocano lwak keno tyer pi woro kwai jami mapol ma i polo ducu idyekal aryo me Ot pa Rwot Lubanga. <verse eid="2CH 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 33:6" />En bene owango awobene ki mac me gityer i nota pa wod pa Kinom, dok obedo katyet ki ajaa ki ngiyo i dyelgu kun tiyo ki lutal ki lukor tipugu ki megi jogi. Obedo katiyo gin manen maracu iwang Rwot, ma omiyo kiniga omako Rwot Lubanga. <verse eid="2CH 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 33:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 9:3-5">Luk 9:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 7:12-18">2 Tek 7:12-18</ref></char></note>Ka dok omiyo kipayo cal jok, ci ocibo i Ot pa Lubanga, mayam Lubanga olok ikome bot Daudi ki bot wode Solomon ni, “I Ot man, ki i Jerucalem, en aye mayam ayero ki ikin kaka ma i Icrael ducu, ni abiketo nyinga bedo iye matwal wek ki wor. <verse eid="2CH 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 33:8" />Pe dong abimiyo tyen jo Icrael bedo kawire a woko ki iye i lobo mayam amiyo bot kwariwuni, teke gibigwoke kun kilubu kit lok ducu ma atyeko cikogi kwede, dok kilubu Cika ducu mayam latica Moses ocikogi kwede.” <verse eid="2CH 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 33:9" />Manace obito jo me Juda ki jo ma gibedo i Jerucalem me timo gin maracu, makato lurok mayam Rwot ojwerogi woko ki inyim jo Icrael.<verse eid="2CH 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Manace ongut</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 33:10" />Rwot oloko bot Manace kacel ki lwake lok me juk, ento gin pe guwinyo loke. <verse eid="2CH 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 33:11" />Pimeno Rwot ocwalo ludito maloyo mony pa rwot me Aciria, gumako Manace ki goli, gutweye ki nyor mola ci gutere kwede wa i Babilon.<verse eid="2CH 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 33:12" />Ikare matye i can matek ci en obako doge, kun mwole inyim Rwot Lubanga pa kwarine ka olege ni otime kica. <verse eid="2CH 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 33:13" />Lubanga owinyo leganeni ki me bako doge, ka ocako dwoko en cen wa i Jerucalem me bedo ikom kere kikome. Ci Manace ongeyo atir ni Rwot en aye Lubanga ma Latwer maloyo ducu.<verse eid="2CH 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 33:14" />Lacen en ogero cel ma woko me gangkal pa Daudi ki tung kupotoceng me Gikon i nota, en ogero o wa i yoo ma wok ki i dog gang ma kilwongoni dog cel me Rec, orumu ki Opel, ogero ma ocudu malo likung; ka dok bene oketo ludito maloyo mony i taun madito ducu ma kirumu ki cel gogo ma i Juda. <verse eid="2CH 33:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 33:15" />En ojwero lwak lubanga me rokgu kacel ki cal jokgu woko ki i Ot pa Rwot, ka dok omuku keno tyer ducu mayam en ocano kama kigero iye ki Ot pa Rwot, ki ma onongo gitye i Jerucalem, ocokogi ducu obologi woko inge taun madit meno. <verse eid="2CH 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 33:16" />En dok ocano keno tyer pa Rwot odoco, ka otyero iye gitum me gityer lakwecwiny ki gityer me miyo pwoc; ci ociko jo Juda me woro Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael. <verse eid="2CH 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 33:17" />Lwak pud gumede ki tyero gitum iwi godi, ento gityerogi bot Rwot Lubangagi keken.<verse eid="2CH 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Agiki loc pa Manace</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 21:17-18">2 Luk 21:17-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 33:18" />Lok kom Manace mudonge ducu, wa ki legane bot Lubangane, ki lok pa luneno ma guloko bote i nying Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael, kicoyo i <char style="bk">Buk me Tekwaro pa Luker me Icrael,</char> <verse eid="2CH 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 33:19" />ki lagam me legane ma Lubanga odwoko bote, bale ki kit ma en ocayo kwede dog Rwot, ki kabedo ducu ma en ceng ogero iye wang jogi ma iwi godi, ka dong ocibo lwak yen me woro Acera ma jok ma dakoni, ki cal jogine ma ocibo ma onongo pud peya omwole kene, nen, gityeko coyone i <char style="bk">Buk me Tekwaro pa Lunebi.</char> <verse eid="2CH 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 33:20" />Kitmeno Manace oto, en oywe kacel ki kwarine, ci kiyike i ode; wode Amon aye oleyo katyene.<verse eid="2CH 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rwot Amon me Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 21:19-26">2 Luk 21:19-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 33:21" />Amon ocamo ker ma mwaka me dite pyere aryo wiye aryo, ci obedo kaloc i Jerucalem pi mwaka aryo. <verse eid="2CH 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 33:22" />Amon obedo katiyo gin manen marac iwang Rwot Lubanga, kit macalo wone Manace obedo katiyo. Amon obedo katyero gitum bot cal lubangagu mayam wone Manace otiyo, kun worogi bene. <verse eid="2CH 33:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 33:23" />En pe omwole kene inyim Rwot Lubanga, kit macalo wone Manace yam omwole kwede, ento Amon obedo ka tingo alii makato teretere. <verse eid="2CH 33:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 33:24" />Ci lutice gupiro lok ikome, ci guneko en woko ki i ode. <verse eid="2CH 33:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 33:25" />Ento lwak me lobonu guneko jo ducu ma onongo gupiro lok ikom rwot Amon; ci gin lwak me lobonu guketo wode Yocia me bedo rwot ma kakare.<verse eid="2CH 33:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="2CH 34" />
  <para style="s1">Rwot Yocia me Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 22:1-2">2 Luk 22:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 34:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 3:6">Jer 3:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yocia ocamo ker ma mwaka me dite oromo aboro, ci obedo kaloc i Jerucalem pi mwaka pyere adek wiye acel. <verse eid="2CH 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 34:2" />Yocia obedo katiyo gin manen atir iwang Rwot Lubanga, en obedo kalubu kit pa kwarone Daudi ducu, pe obedo kacabe ikom lok ma dok i lubu cik Rwot Lubanga.<verse eid="2CH 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yocia ojwero ka woro jokgigu woko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 34:3" />I mwaka me aboro me loce, ma onongo en pud awobi matidi, Yocia ocako woro Lubanga kit ma kwarone Daudi ceng otiyo kun keto cwinye ikome. I mwaka me apar wiye aryone me loce, en ocako lonyo Juda ki Jerucalem kun muku wang jogi ma iwi godi woko ducu, ka dok ojwero yen ducu ma kicomo pi woro jok Acera ducu, ki cal ma kipayo, ki cal jogi ma ki cweyogu ducu. <verse eid="2CH 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 34:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 21:3">2 Luk 21:3</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 33:3">2 Tek 33:3</ref></char></note> En omiyo kimuku keno tyer pa lwak Baalgu ducu ki kama keno me wango gityere onongo tye iye onginyogi woko; ka dok omuku keno tyer ma gucudu malo iwi godi kama kiwango iye odok eceta. Ci dok ojwero wir me woro jok Acera ducu, ki cal apaya, ki cal jogi ma kiliyo aliya, ongidogi woko matinotino, ka orego odoko apwa, ka dong ocako onyone iwi lyel pa jo mayam gubedo ka tyero gityer bot cal jogi magi. <verse eid="2CH 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 34:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 13:2">1 Luk 13:2</ref></char></note>En bene owango cogo pa ajwaki iwi keno tyergi, man otiyo pi lonyo Juda ki Jerucalem odok maleng odoco. <verse eid="2CH 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 34:6" />Ki i taun madito pa jo Manace, jo Epraim ki jo Cimeon, nio kwede wa i taun pa jo Naputali, ki iwi oburgi murumu kenyo, <verse eid="2CH 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 34:7" />en omuku keno tyer pa jogi, ki cal jok Aceragu ducu, ki cal jogi mukenegu, ci oturu matinotino tutwal, ka dok omuku bene lwak keno tyer kama kiwango iye odok eceta ki i lobo Icrael ducu. Ka lacen dong en odok cen i Jerucalem.<verse eid="2CH 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kinongo buk me Cik</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 22:3-20">2 Luk 22:3-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 34:8" />I mwaka me apar wiye aboro me loce, madong onongo en otyeko kwanyo gin maracu woko ki i lobo kacel ki i Ot pa Lubanga Yocia ocwalo Capan wod pa Ajalia, ki Maaceya laloc me taun madit, ki Joa wod pa Joakaj, ma en laco lok ma time, kayubu Ot pa Rwot Lubangane. <verse eid="2CH 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 34:9" />Gubino bot Ilkia ajwaka madit ci gumiyo bote lim mayam gikelo i Ot pa Lubanga, ma Lulevi ki lukur dogola yam gujogo ki bot jo Manace ki jo Epraim dok ki bot jo Icrael ducu mudong, ki bot jo Juda ki jo Benjamin ducu, ki bot jo ma gibedo i Jerucalem. <verse eid="2CH 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 34:10" />Ci gumiyo lim man bot ludito tic ma i Ot pa Rwot Lubanga; ci gin lutic magi ma gitiyo i Ot pa Rwot gumiyo lim man pi yubu Ot pa Rwot kama obale, ki me rocone odoco. <verse eid="2CH 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 34:11" />Gumiyo lim man bot lupaa bao ki bot lugedo wek guwil ki godi ma kipayo, ki me wilo yen pi gin latwe bao, ki pi rii wi odi ducu mayam luker me Juda guweko obale odoko wi oburni. <verse eid="2CH 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 34:12" />Ci co magi gutiyo tic ki gen. Jo ma loyogi onongo kiketo Jakat ki Obadia ma gin Lulevi, ma jo me ot pa Merari, Jekaria ki Meculam, ma jo me ot pa Kokat, kiketogi me bedo lulo dogtic me Ot pa Rwot. Lulevi ducu mayam gungiyo ki jami me wer, <verse eid="2CH 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 34:13" />kiketogi me bedo lulo jo ma tingo yec, madok bene ticgi me cungu dano i dog tic mapatpat; Lulevi mukene gubedo lucoc, lunyampara ki lugwok dogola Ot pa Lubanga.<verse eid="2CH 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 34:14" />Ikare ma gitye kakwanyo lim ma onongo kikelo i Ot pa Rwot, ci Ilkia ajwaka madit otugi nongo buk me Cik pa Rwot mayam omiyo ki Moses. <verse eid="2CH 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 34:15" />Cutcut Ilkia owaco bot Capan ma karan ni, “Atyeko nongo buk me Cik i Ot pa Rwot.” Ilkia ocako miyo buk man bot Capan. <verse eid="2CH 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 34:16" />Capan okelo buk man bot rwot, ka omede kitito lok bot rwot Yocia ni, “Tic ducu mayam iciko ni lutici guti, gin dong gutyeko tiyone. <verse eid="2CH 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 34:17" />Wakwanyo lim ma wanongo i Ot pa Rwot ci wamiyo i cing lulo dog tic ki luticgi.” <verse eid="2CH 34:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 34:18" />Ka dok Capan karan otito bot rwot ni, “Ajwaka Ilkia otyeko miya buk mo.” Ci Capan ocako kwanone inyim rwot.<verse eid="2CH 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 34:19" />Ka rwot owinyo lok me Cik, ci oyeco bongine woko. <verse eid="2CH 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 34:20" />Omiyo rwot ociko Ilkia, ki Akikam wod pa Capan, ki Abudon wod pa Mika, ki Capan ma karan, ki Acaya ma latic pa rwot, kun waco ni, <verse eid="2CH 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 34:21" />“Wucit, wupeny dog Rwot Lubanga pira ki pi jo ma gudong i Icrael ki i Juda, pi lok man ma i buk ma kityeko nongoni. Akemo pa Rwot kara olyeto ikomwa matek kuman, pien kwariwa pe gubedo ka woro lok ducu ma i buk man, pi tic kwede ikit ducu mayam kicoyo kwede ma mako komwa.” <verse eid="2CH 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 34:22" />Kitmeno Ilkia kacel ki jo ma rwot ocwalogi gucito bot Kulda ma lanebi ma dako ma cware Calum wod pa Tokat, ma wod pa Kacra, ma lagwok bongi pa rwot. Dakonu onongo bedo i Jerucalem i dul gang ma kilwongo Dul gang me Aryone; ci guloko kwede lok ikom gin mutime. <verse eid="2CH 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 34:23" />En owaco botgini gucit gutit lok pa Rwot Lubanga bot dano ma ocwalogi ni <verse eid="2CH 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 34:24" />Rwot Lubanga owaco ni, “Nen ba, abikelo gin marac bipoto ikom kabedo man, ki ikom jo ma gibedo iye, pi cobo lok ducu ma kiceno ki dano ma kicoyo i buk ma kikwano inyim rwot me Juda. <verse eid="2CH 34:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 34:25" />Gin gutyeko bwota woko kun giwango odok eceta bot lwak lubanga mukene, wek kimii kiniga obed ka maka pi jogi ducu ma kitiyo ki cinggini. Pieno akemona bilyeto matek ikom kabedo man ma pe dong bikwe. <verse eid="2CH 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 34:26" />Ento lok ma dok ikom rwot me Juda ma ocwalowu kapenyo dog Rwot Lubanga, wun wubiwace kit man ni: Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael owaco kit man ni, ikom lok ma iwinyoni, <verse eid="2CH 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 34:27" />dong ityeko ngut ki i cwinyi ci imwole keni inyima ikare ma iwinyo lok mayam aloko ikom kabedo man ki ikom jo ma gibedo iye, imwole woko keni inyima, ci icako yeco bongini woko kun ikok kwede inyima; pieno an bene atyeko winyo kokoni, man lok pa Rwot kikome. <verse eid="2CH 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 34:28" />Nen ba, an abidwoki ikin kwarini, ci kibiyiki i lyeli ki kuc, dok wangi pe bineno gin maracu ducu ma abikelo ikom kabedo man ki ikom jo ma gibedo iye.” Ci gin gudwoko lok bot rwot.<verse eid="2CH 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yocia oketo Gicike me woro Rwot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 34:29" />I nge meno rwot ocwalo kwena bot ludongo me Juda ki me Jerucalem ci gucoke kacel. <verse eid="2CH 34:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 34:30" />Rwot ocako cito i Ot pa Rwot Lubanga kacel ki jo Juda ducu, ki jo ma gibedo i Jerucalem ajwaki kacel ki Lulevi ki lwak ducu, jo madito ki jo matino; ci okwano botgi buk me gicike ma kinongo i Ot pa Rwot. <verse eid="2CH 34:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 34:31" />Rwot Yocia ocung i kabedone ka ocako keto gicike inyim Rwot Lubanga ni, ebilubu gin ma Rwot mito dok ebigwoko cike ki gin ma en ociko ducu, ki cwinye ducu, ki tipune ducu, kun etiyo lok me gicike ma kicoyo i buk meno. <verse eid="2CH 34:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 34:32" />En ociko dano ducu ma onongo gitye i Jerucalem ki i Benjamin ikare meno ni gulub gicike meno. Jo ma gibedo i Jerucalem gubedo kalubu gicike pa Lubanga, ma Lubanga pa kwarigi. <verse eid="2CH 34:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 34:33" />Ka dok Yocia ojwero jami me kipyeda woko ducu ma i dul lobo ducu pa jo Icrael, omiyo jo ducu ma i Icrael guworo Rwot Lubangagi. I karene ducu pe guloke guweko lubu kor Rwot Lubanga pa kwarigi.<verse eid="2CH 34:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="2CH 35" />
  <para style="s1">Yocia okwero Karama me Kato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 23:21-23">2 Luk 23:21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 35:1" />Yocia okwero Karama me Kato pa Rwot i Jerucalem. Ci guneko lutino romi me Kato inino dwe apar wiye angwen me dwe mukwongo. <verse eid="2CH 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 35:2" />En oyero ajwaki ci oketogi i dog ticgi, dok ocuku cwinygi ikom tic ma i Ot pa Rwot. <verse eid="2CH 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 35:3" />Dok owaco bot Lulevi ma gin aye gipwonyo jo Icrael ducuni, ma gin jo maleng inyim Rwot ni, “Wuket Canduk me Gicike i Ot pa Rwot Lubanga ma Solomon wod pa Daudi, rwot me Icrael yam ogero; pe myero dok wubed katingone iwi gwokwu. Wun dong wutii bot Rwot Lubangawu ki lwake jo Icrael. <verse eid="2CH 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 35:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 8:14">2 Tek 8:14</ref></char></note>Wuyube kun wulubu dog odi pa kwariwu ki dulwu, kun wulubu bene gin mayam Daudi rwot me Icrael ociko ki gin ma wode Solomon ociko. <verse eid="2CH 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 35:5" />Dok wucung i Kabedo Maleng, wucung kun wulubu dog odi pa kwari utmegiwu ma gin jo me loboni, kun dul acel acel pa Lulevi ocung pi dog ot acel acel pa lwak. <verse eid="2CH 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 35:6" />Kitmeno dong wunek lutino romi me kwero Karama me Kato, wulonye kenwu, wuyub gin ma mite pi utmegiwu, wek gulub lok pa Rwot ma Moses ociko.”<verse eid="2CH 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 35:7" />Yocia omiyo lutino romi ki lutino dyegi alip pyere adek, ki twoni alip adek, bot lwak pi gityer me kwero Karama me Kato pi lwak jo ducu ma onongo gitye kenyo. Jami magi ducu jami ma oa ikom jami pa rwot Yocia. <verse eid="2CH 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 35:8" />Ki lutelagi bene gumiyo gin ma cwinygi opwoyo bot lwak, bot ajwaki ki bot Lulevi. Ilkia, Jekaria ki Jekiel, ma gin ludito ma giloyo tic ma i Ot pa Lubanga, gumiyo bot ajwaki lutino romi ki dyegi alip aryo ki miya abicel ki twoni miya adek me gityer me kwero Karama me Kato. <verse eid="2CH 35:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 35:9" />Konania ki omegine, ki Cemaya ki Netanel, ki Kacabia, Jeyel ki, Jojabad, ma gin ludito pa Lulevi, gumiyo lutino romi ki dyegi alip abic, ki twoni miya abic, bot Lulevi me gityer me kwero Karama me Kato.<verse eid="2CH 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 35:10" />Ikare ma dong kiyubu jami ducu kakare me kwero Karama me Kato, ajwaki gucako cung i kabedogi, ki Lulevi bene gucung i dul ki dul i dog ticgi kun gin ducu gilubu gin ma rwot ceng ociko. <verse eid="2CH 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 35:11" />Guneko lutino romi me kwero Karama me Kato, ci ajwaki ticgi obedo me coro remo ma kigamo ki bot Lulevi ma gitye kayango ringo. <verse eid="2CH 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 35:12" />Ikare ma kitimo man kiketo dul mukene me gitum cen, ma kibipoko ikin lwak kun kilubu dog odi pa kwarigi, wek gutyer bot Rwot, macalo kicoyo i buk pa Moses. Ci gutiyo ki twoni bene kitmeno. <verse eid="2CH 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 35:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:8-9">Nia 12:8-9</ref></char></note>Lulevi gubulu lutino romi me kwero Karama me Kato ki mac kun kilubu cik mayam kiciko; ento jami me gityer maleng gutedo ateda ki otako ki agulu, ki cupuriya, ka gucako tingone gutyero bot lwak oyotoyot. <verse eid="2CH 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 35:14" />Inge meno gubedo kayubu jami pirgi ken gi ki pi ajwaki, pien ajwaki ma gin likwayo pa Aron onongo gitye ki tic madwong tutwal me wango gitum awangagu ki moo dwologu nio wa i wor. Kitmeno Lulevi guyubu jami pirgi ken gi ki pi ajwaki bene ma gin likwayo pa Aron. <verse eid="2CH 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 35:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 25:1">1 Tek 25:1</ref></char></note>Likwayo pa Acap ma gin luwer, gubedo i kabedogi macalo Daudi, Acap, Keman, ki Jedutun ma lanebi pa rwot onongo guciko; ki lugwok dogola Ot pa Rwot Lubanga ducu gubedo i dogola acel acel. Pe gumito weko dogticgi pien gin guniang ni utmegigi ma Lulevi gubedo kayube pirgi bene.<verse eid="2CH 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 35:16" />Meno aye kit ma kiyubu ki tic pa Rwot i ninonu, pi kwero Karama me Kato ki pi tyero gitum awanga ikom keno tyer pa Rwot, kun kilubu lok ma rwot Yocia ociko. <verse eid="2CH 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 35:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-20">Nia 12:1-20</ref></char></note>Jo Icrael ducu ma onongo gitye kunu gukwero Karama me Kato ikare meno, ki dok gukwero bene nino madito me Mugati ma Tobi Pe iye pi nino abiro. <verse eid="2CH 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 35:18" />Pe tye nino mo madito me Karama me Kato ma kikwero kit man i Icrael nia ikare pa lanebi Camuel. Dok pe tye laker mo ikin luker me Icrael mayam okwero nino Karama me Kato macalo Yocia okwero man, kacel ki ajwaki ki Lulevi, ki jo Juda ki jo Jerucalem ducu ma onongo gubedo tye, ki jo ducu ma gibedo i Jerucalem. <verse eid="2CH 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 35:19" />I mwaka me apar wiye aboro me loc pa Yocia en aye kikwero iye nino man madit me Karama me Kato.<verse eid="2CH 35:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Agiki loc pa Yocia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 23:28-30">2 Luk 23:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 35:20" />Inge man ducu, ma dong Yocia otyeko yubu Ot pa Lubanga, Neko rwot me Ejipt ocito kalweny i Karkemic macok ki kulu Euprate, ci Yocia oa bene ocito kalweny ikome cut. <verse eid="2CH 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 35:21" />Ento Neko ocwalo kwena bot Yocia kun waco ni, “An pe atye ki lok mo ikomi in rwot me Juda! Tin an pe abino kalweny ikomi, ento abino kalwenyo ikom jo ma atye kalweny ikomgi keken; dok Lubanga en aye ocika me tiyo man oyotoyot. Wek pyem ki Lubanga matye kwedani miyo neki woko.” <verse eid="2CH 35:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 35:22" />Ento Yocia pe oye loko ngeye ki rwot Neko, ci oruke macalo dano mo ata wek elweny kwede. En Yocia pe owinyo lok pa Neko ma oa ki i dog Lubangani kadi ki acel ento ocere ocito kalweny kwede i bar; me Megiddo. <verse eid="2CH 35:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 35:23" />Cutcut gutugi celo rwot Yocia woko; ci rwot owaco bot lutice ni, “Wukwanya woko ki iwang lweny, pien dong gutyeko keto ret marac tutwal, ikoma.” <verse eid="2CH 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 35:24" />Ci lutice gukwanye woko ki i gadigadine gukete i gadigadine me aryone ka gutere i Jerucalem. Yocia oto, ci kiyike i lyel pa kwarine. Jo Juda ki jo Jerucalem ducu gukumu matek pi Yocia. <verse eid="2CH 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 35:25" />Jeremia bene okok matek pi Yocia; co kacel ki mon ma gubedo kawer guloko pi Yocia i kokogi cake ikare ca nio wa onyo. Guketo man odoko cik i Icrael ducu: nen kityeko coyone i <char style="bk">Buk me Koko.</char> <verse eid="2CH 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 35:26" />Lok kom Yocia mudonge ducu, ki tic mabeco ma en ceng otiyo ducu ki kit ma omine bot Rwot, ki worone ikome lok me Cik pa Rwot. <verse eid="2CH 35:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 35:27" />Ki gin mayam en otiyo ducu, nia i acakine nio i agikine, nen, ki tyeko coyone i <char style="bk">Buk pa Luker me Icrael ki me Juda. </char><verse eid="2CH 35:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="2CH 36" />
  <para style="s1">Rwot Yekoakaj me Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 23:30-35">2 Luk 23:30-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 36:1" />Lwak ma gin wegi lobo gukwanyo Yekoakaj wod pa Yocia, ci guketo en obedo rwot me leyo katyen wone i Jerucalem. <verse eid="2CH 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 36:2" />Yekoakaj ocamo ker ma mwaka me dite pyere aryo wiye adek, ci obedo kaloc i Jerucalem pi dwe adek. <verse eid="2CH 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 36:3" />Lacen rwot me Ejipt oryemo Yekoakaj woko ki i ker ka oketo wel ajog mapek ikom jo Juda i wel me kilo alip adek ki miya angwen me ryal ki kilo pyere adek wiye angwen me jabu. <verse eid="2CH 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 36:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:11-12">Jer 22:11-12</ref></char></note>Rwot me Ejipt oketo Eliakim omin Yekoakaj obedo rwot me Juda ki me Jerucalem ci ocako loko nyinge Yekoyakim; ento Neko okwanyo Yekoakaj otero woko i Ejipt.<verse eid="2CH 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rwot Yekoyakim me Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 23:36-24:7">2 Luk 23:36—24:7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 36:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 22:18-19">Jer 22:18-19</ref>; <ref loc="JER 26:1-6">26:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 35:1-19">35:1-19</ref></char>
    </note>Yekoyakim ocamo ker ma mwaka me dite pyere aryo wiye abic, ci obedo kaloc i Jerucalem pi mwaka apar wiye acel. En obedo katiyo gin manen marac iwang Rwot Lubangane. <verse eid="2CH 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 36:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:1-38">Jer 25:1-38</ref>; <ref loc="JER 36:1-32">36:1-32</ref>; <ref loc="JER 45:1-5">45:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 1:1-2">Dan 1:1-2</ref></char></note>Nebukadnejar rwot me Babilon obino kalweny ikome. Ci omake otweye ki nyor ka otere kwede woko wa i Babilon. <verse eid="2CH 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 36:7" />Nebukadnejar bene okwanyo jami mogo ki ikin jami ma kitiyo kwedgi i Ot pa Rwot oterogi i Babilon, ci oketogi i gang kale i Babilon. <verse eid="2CH 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 36:8" />Lok kom Yekoyakim mudonge ducu, ki tim me kipyedane ducu mayam otiyo, kacel ki tice ki lok ma kinongo ikome, nen, kityeko coyone i <char style="bk">Buk pa Luker me Icrael ki me Juda. </char> Wode Yekoyakin aye oleyo katyene.<verse eid="2CH 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rwot Yekoyakin me Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 24:8-17">2 Luk 24:8-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 36:9" />Yekoyakin ocamo ker ma mwaka me dite aboro, ci obedo kaloc i Jerucalem pi dwe adek ki nino apar. Obedo katiyo gin manen marac iwang Rwot Lubanga. <verse eid="2CH 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 36:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:24-30">Jer 22:24-30</ref>; <ref loc="JER 24:1-10">24:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 29:1-2">29:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 37:1">37:1</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 17:12-13">Eje 17:12-13</ref></char></note>I dog potokot en aye Nebukadnejar ocwalo lutice kaome ci gutere wa i Babilon. Ci gutero wa jami mabeco ma kitiyo kwedgi i Ot pa Rwot. Ci oketo omine Jedekia obedo rwot me loyo jo Juda ki Jerucalem.<verse eid="2CH 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rwot Jedekia me Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 24:18-20">2 Luk 24:18-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 36:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 27:1-22">Jer 27:1-22</ref>; <ref loc="JER 28:1-17">28:1-17</ref></char>
    </note>Jedekia ocamo ker ma mwaka me dite pyere aryo wiye acel, ci obedo kaloc i Jerucalem pi mwaka apar wiye acel. <verse eid="2CH 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 36:12" />En obedo katiyo gin manen marac iwang Rwot Lubangane. En pe omwole inyim lanebi Jeremia, ma oloko kwede lok ma oa ki bot Rwot Lubanga. <verse eid="2CH 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 36:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 17:15">Eje 17:15</ref></char></note>Jedekia bene ojemo ikom rwot Nebukadnejar mayam omiyo en okwongo kwong ki nying Lubanga; omiyo cwinye obedo nwang ma pe mito loke bot Rwot, Lubanga pa Icrael. <verse eid="2CH 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 36:14" />Ajwaki ma gin lutel kacel ki lwak mukenegu ducu pe gugeno Rwot matwal, gubedo kalubu gin me kwer pa rok mukene, omiyo gubalo kwede Ot pa Rwot woko mayam Rwot otyeko lonyo obedo leng i Jerucalem.<verse eid="2CH 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 36:15" />Rwot, Lubanga pa kwarigi, obedo kacwalo lok botgi teretere kun oro lukwenane me tito botgi, pien kica omako en ikom lwake ki pi kabedo mere. <verse eid="2CH 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 36:16" />Ento gin gubedo kangalo lukwena pa Lubanga, ma gicayo lokegu, dok gujwiyo lunebine bene, nio ka akemo omako Rwot ikom lwake, ma gin mo maromo jukune dong pe.<verse eid="2CH 36:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 36:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 21:1-10">Jer 21:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 34:1-5">34:1-5</ref></char>
    </note>Rwot ocako kelo rwot pa jo Kaldaya kalweny ikomgi, ci oneko awobegi ki pala lucwan ki i kabedo maleng ma i Ot pa Lubanga, pe obedo ki kica ikom awobi nyo nyako, jo muteggi nyo jo ma otii; magi ducu Lubanga omiyogi woko i cinge. <verse eid="2CH 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 36:18" />Ki jami ducu mayam kitiyo kwedgi i Ot pa Lubanga, jami madito ki matinone, ki lonyo ma kikano i Ot pa Rwot Lubanga, ki lonyo ma rwot Jedekia okano ki pa lutelane ducu, rwot pa jo Kaldaya otero magi woko ducu i Babilon. <verse eid="2CH 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 36:19" />Guwango Ot pa Lubanga woko, ka dok kimuku cel murumu Jerucalem, ci guwango odi ma gibedo iye woko ducu ki mac, kun gibalo bene wa jami ducu ma pirgi tego. <verse eid="2CH 36:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 36:20" />En otero jo ma guloyo ki i lak to i Babilon, ci gudoko opiine ki pa lutinone nio ka ker me Percia ocung matek. <verse eid="2CH 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 36:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:11">Jer 25:11</ref>; <ref loc="JER 29:10">29:10</ref></char></note>Man obedo pi cobo lok pa Rwot mayam oloko ki i dog Jeremia ni, “Lobo bidong nono pi mwaka pyere abiro nio ka ocobo kawang yweyo me Cabit ma pe kilubuni.”<verse eid="2CH 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ciro ociko ni jo Icrael gudok cen</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EZR 1:1-4">Eji 1:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 36:22" />I mwaka mukwongo me loc pa Ciro rwot me Percia, wek lok pa Rwot mayam oloko ki i dog Jeremia ocobe kakare, cutcut Rwot Lubanga otugu cwiny Ciro rwot me Percia omiyo en otito lok oromo i lobo ma ite kere ducu. En ocoyo lok man bene ki waraga ni, <verse eid="2CH 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 36:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 44:28">Ica 44:28</ref></char></note>“Ciro rwot me Percia owaco kuman ni, ‘Rwot, ma en Lubanga me polo, otyeko miyo ker ducu ma iwi lobo i cinga, dok ocika ni ager Ot pire i Jerucalem, matye i Juda. Bot ngat mo keken ma ikinwu ma ikom lwake ducu awaco ni, Rwot Lubangane myero obed kwede. Wek en oa ociti i Jerucalem.’”<verse eid="2CH 36:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 36" />
</usx>